{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower\n; consolidated_funded_indebtedness: Consolidated Funded Indebtedness as at the end of the fiscal quarter (numerator of the Leverage Ratio)\n; ebitda: EBITDA of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation day\n; ebitr: EBITR for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation day\n; consolidated_interest_expense: Consolidated Interest Expense for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation day\n; consolidated_rentals: Consolidated Rentals for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation day\n; consolidated_indebtedness: Consolidated Indebtedness at the observation time\n; consolidated_total_capitalization: Consolidated Total Capitalization at the observation time\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter Bool)\n  (consolidated_funded_indebtedness Real)\n  (ebitda Real)\n  (ebitr Real)\n  (consolidated_interest_expense Real)\n  (consolidated_rentals Real)\n  (consolidated_indebtedness Real)\n  (consolidated_total_capitalization Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 6.21.1 Leverage Ratio must not be greater than 2.00 to 1.00 at fiscal quarter end\n    (=> is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter\n        (<= (/ consolidated_funded_indebtedness ebitda) 2.0))\n    ; 6.21.2 Fixed charge coverage must not be less than 4.00 to 1.00 at fiscal quarter end\n    (=> is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter\n        (>= (/ ebitr (+ consolidated_interest_expense consolidated_rentals)) 4.0))\n    ; 6.21.3 Indebtedness to Total Capitalization must not be greater than 0.50 to 1.00 at any time\n    (<= (/ consolidated_indebtedness consolidated_total_capitalization) 0.5)))",
