{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; interest_coverage_ratio: Parent's Interest Coverage Ratio as of the observation date, for the four Fiscal Quarters ending on that day (ratio X in 'X to 1').\n; is_qe_jun2004_dec2007: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter ending during the period June 30, 2004 through December 31, 2007.\n; is_qe_2008: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter ending during January 1, 2008 through December 31, 2008.\n; is_qe_2009: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter ending during January 1, 2009 through December 31, 2009.\n; is_qe_2010: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter ending during January 1, 2010 through December 31, 2010.\n; is_qe_jan2011_mar2011: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter ending during January 1, 2011 through March 31, 2011.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((interest_coverage_ratio Real) (is_qe_jun2004_dec2007 Bool) (is_qe_2008 Bool) (is_qe_2009 Bool) (is_qe_2010 Bool) (is_qe_jan2011_mar2011 Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; Section 5.2(a): Revolving Credit, Tranche B, Swing Loan Lenders and Issuers\n    (=> is_qe_jun2004_dec2007 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.25))\n    (=> is_qe_2008 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.5))\n    (=> is_qe_2009 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.75))\n    (=> is_qe_2010 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.0))\n    (=> is_qe_jan2011_mar2011 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.25))\n    ; Section 5.2(b): Tranche C Agent and Tranche C Lenders\n    (=> is_qe_jun2004_dec2007 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.0))\n    (=> is_qe_2008 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.25))\n    (=> is_qe_2009 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.5))\n    (=> is_qe_2010 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.75))\n    (=> is_qe_jan2011_mar2011 (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.0))))",
