  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; leverage_ratio: The Borrower's Leverage Ratio at the observation time, as a ratio of X to 1.00 (e.g. 5.75 means 5.75:1.00). Atomic input; the source supplies no definition.\n; in_period_1: True iff the observation time falls in a fiscal quarter ending in the period commencing the Effective Date to and including September 30, 2002.\n; in_period_2: True iff the observation time falls in a fiscal quarter ending in the period commencing December 31, 2002 to and including September 30, 2003.\n; in_period_3: True iff the observation time falls in a fiscal quarter ending in the period commencing December 31, 2003 to and including September 30, 2004.\n; in_period_4: True iff the observation time falls in a fiscal quarter ending in the period commencing December 31, 2004 to and including September 30, 2005.\n; in_period_5: True iff the observation time falls in the fiscal quarter ending December 31, 2005 or in any fiscal quarter of the Borrower thereafter.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((leverage_ratio Real) (in_period_1 Bool) (in_period_2 Bool) (in_period_3 Bool) (in_period_4 Bool) (in_period_5 Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> in_period_1 (<= leverage_ratio 5.75))\n    (=> in_period_2 (<= leverage_ratio 5.0))\n    (=> in_period_3 (<= leverage_ratio 4.25))\n    (=> in_period_4 (<= leverage_ratio 3.5))\n    (=> in_period_5 (<= leverage_ratio 3.0))))",
