{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_quarterly_testing_date: True iff the observation date is a Quarterly Testing Date, the date as of which Section 7.12(a) and (b) are tested.\n; is_on_or_after_march_31_2017: True iff the observation date is on or after March 31, 2017, the date from which testing commences.\n; leverage_ratio: Leverage Ratio of the Borrower as of the observation date, expressed as x in x to 1.0.\n; in_specified_acquisition_period: True iff the observation date falls during a Specified Acquisition Period.\n; consolidated_ebitda_ltm: Consolidated EBITDA of the Borrower for the period of four consecutive Fiscal Quarters ending on the observation date.\n; consolidated_interest_expense_ltm: Consolidated Interest Expense of the Borrower for the same period of four consecutive Fiscal Quarters ending on the observation date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_quarterly_testing_date Bool) (is_on_or_after_march_31_2017 Bool) (leverage_ratio Real) (in_specified_acquisition_period Bool) (consolidated_ebitda_ltm Real) (consolidated_interest_expense_ltm Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_quarterly_testing_date is_on_or_after_march_31_2017)\n      (and (<= leverage_ratio (ite in_specified_acquisition_period 7.0 6.0))\n           (>= (/ consolidated_ebitda_ltm consolidated_interest_expense_ltm) 1.5))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "is_quarterly_testing_date",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is a Quarterly Testing Date, the date as of which the leverage and interest coverage covenants are tested.",
      "source_quote": "As of each Quarterly Testing Date"
    },
