{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; observation_on_or_after_agreement_date: true iff the observation time is on or after the date of this Agreement.\n; facility_terminated_or_expired: true iff the Revolving Credit Facility has been terminated or has expired as of the observation time.\n; obligations_paid_in_full: true iff the Obligations have been paid in full as of the observation time.\n; bank_written_consent_otherwise: true iff the Bank has expressly consented in writing, effective at the observation time, to the Borrower not complying with Section 8.2.\n; current_assets: Borrower's current assets at the observation time, in dollars.\n; current_liabilities: Borrower's current liabilities at the observation time, in dollars.\n; tangible_net_worth: Borrower's Tangible Net Worth at the observation time, in dollars.\n; total_indebtedness: Borrower's total Indebtedness at the observation time, in dollars.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (observation_on_or_after_agreement_date Bool)\n    (facility_terminated_or_expired Bool)\n    (obligations_paid_in_full Bool)\n    (bank_written_consent_otherwise Bool)\n    (current_assets Real)\n    (current_liabilities Real)\n    (tangible_net_worth Real)\n    (total_indebtedness Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and observation_on_or_after_agreement_date\n           (not (and facility_terminated_or_expired obligations_paid_in_full))\n           (not bank_written_consent_otherwise))\n      (and (>= (/ current_assets current_liabilities) 2.0)\n           (>= tangible_net_worth 22000000.0)\n           (<= (/ total_indebtedness tangible_net_worth) 0.5))))",
