  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; leverage_ratio: G&K Group consolidated Leverage Ratio as of the observation date, as a ratio to 1.00 (e.g. 4.25 means 4.25 to 1.00).\n; is_sep_27_1997: true iff the observation date is the Covenant Computation Date September 27, 1997.\n; is_dec_27_1997: true iff the observation date is the Covenant Computation Date December 27, 1997.\n; is_mar_28_1998: true iff the observation date is the Covenant Computation Date March 28, 1998.\n; is_jun_27_1998: true iff the observation date is the Covenant Computation Date June 27, 1998.\n; is_sep_26_1998: true iff the observation date is the Covenant Computation Date September 26, 1998.\n; is_dec_26_1998: true iff the observation date is the Covenant Computation Date December 26, 1998.\n; is_mar_27_1999: true iff the observation date is the Covenant Computation Date March 27, 1999.\n; is_jun_26_1999: true iff the observation date is the Covenant Computation Date June 26, 1999.\n; is_sep_25_1999_or_later: true iff the observation date is a Covenant Computation Date on or after September 25, 1999.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((leverage_ratio Real) (is_sep_27_1997 Bool) (is_dec_27_1997 Bool) (is_mar_28_1998 Bool) (is_jun_27_1998 Bool) (is_sep_26_1998 Bool) (is_dec_26_1998 Bool) (is_mar_27_1999 Bool) (is_jun_26_1999 Bool) (is_sep_25_1999_or_later Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> is_sep_27_1997 (<= leverage_ratio 4.25))\n    (=> is_dec_27_1997 (<= leverage_ratio 4.0))\n    (=> is_mar_28_1998 (<= leverage_ratio 3.5))\n    (=> is_jun_27_1998 (<= leverage_ratio 3.0))\n    (=> is_sep_26_1998 (<= leverage_ratio 3.0))\n    (=> is_dec_26_1998 (<= leverage_ratio 3.0))\n    (=> is_mar_27_1999 (<= leverage_ratio 2.75))\n    (=> is_jun_26_1999 (<= leverage_ratio 2.75))\n    (=> is_sep_25_1999_or_later (<= leverage_ratio 2.5))))",
