{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; leverage_ratio: The Borrower's Leverage Ratio at the observation time, as an atomic Real expressed as a plain ratio (0.30:1.00 = 0.30). The source does not define its computation.\n; agreement_in_effect: True iff this Agreement is in effect at the observation time.\n; loan_outstanding: True iff any Loan remains outstanding and unpaid at the observation time.\n; other_amount_owing: True iff any other amount is owing under any Loan Document to any Lender or the Agent at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((leverage_ratio Real) (agreement_in_effect Bool) (loan_outstanding Bool) (other_amount_owing Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (or agreement_in_effect loan_outstanding other_amount_owing)\n      (<= leverage_ratio 0.30)))",
