{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_quarter_end: True exactly when the observation date is a fiscal quarter end, the date at which the ratio is calculated.\n; profit_before_taxes_and_extraordinary_items: Consolidated Profit Before Taxes and Extraordinary Items of the Company and its Subsidiaries, summed over the four-quarter rolling period ending at this quarter end.\n; fixed_charges: Consolidated Fixed Charges of the Company and its Subsidiaries over the same four-quarter rolling period. It is used both as an addend in the numerator and as the denominator.\n; amortization_of_intangible_assets: Consolidated amortization of intangible assets over the same four-quarter rolling period.\n; equity_in_earnings_of_affiliates: Consolidated equity in earnings of Affiliates over the same four-quarter rolling period, subtracted in the numerator.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (is_quarter_end Bool)\n  (profit_before_taxes_and_extraordinary_items Real)\n  (fixed_charges Real)\n  (amortization_of_intangible_assets Real)\n  (equity_in_earnings_of_affiliates Real)\n) Bool\n  (=> is_quarter_end\n      (> (/ (- (+ profit_before_taxes_and_extraordinary_items fixed_charges amortization_of_intangible_assets) equity_in_earnings_of_affiliates) fixed_charges) 1.75)))",
