  "notes": "The covenant is triggered when Availability is strictly less than the greater of $10,000,000 and 15% of the Aggregate Revolving Loan Commitments. When triggered, the FCCR must be at least 1.10, inclusive. The FCCR is an atomic input because no arithmetic definition was supplied. The covenant period and the Required Lenders consent are separate Boolean inputs and are not folded into a single opaque flag."
