{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; interest_coverage_ratio: The Borrower's Interest Coverage Ratio as of the end of the observed fiscal quarter, expressed as a ratio X in \"X to 1.00\". Kept atomic because no arithmetic definition is supplied.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: True iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter.\n; is_on_or_after_march_31_2008_quarter: True iff the observed fiscal quarter is the quarter ending March 31, 2008 or a later fiscal quarter.\n; obligation_unpaid: True iff any Obligation remains unpaid, excluding (a) Letter of Credit Obligations not yet due and payable for Letters of Credit cash collateralized per Sections 2.2(a)(ii), 2.5(e), 7.2(b) or 7.3(b), and (b) contingent indemnification obligations not due and payable that by their terms survive termination or expiration of the Agreement and the other Credit Documents.\n; lender_has_revolving_commitment: True iff any Lender has any Revolving Commitment under the Agreement.\n; uncollateralized_lc_exposure_exists: True iff any Letter of Credit Exposure exists, excluding exposure cash collateralized per Sections 2.2(a)(ii), 2.5(e), 7.2(b) or 7.3(b).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((interest_coverage_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_on_or_after_march_31_2008_quarter Bool) (obligation_unpaid Bool) (lender_has_revolving_commitment Bool) (uncollateralized_lc_exposure_exists Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           is_on_or_after_march_31_2008_quarter\n           (or obligation_unpaid lender_has_revolving_commitment uncollateralized_lc_exposure_exists))\n      (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.0)))",
