  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; covenant_period_in_effect: true iff the Commitments have not yet expired or terminated, or Loans, interest, fees, other amounts have not been paid in full, or Letters of Credit remain unexpired/uncollateralized, or LC Disbursements remain unreimbursed (i.e., the Article IX covenant period is still running)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower\n; is_quarter_on_or_after_2005_09_30: true iff the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date is the quarter ending September 30, 2005 or a later quarter\n; ebitda: Borrower EBITDA for the period of four fiscal quarters ending on the observation date\n; interest_expense: Borrower Interest Expense for the same four-fiscal-quarter period ending on the observation date\n; total_debt: Borrower Total Debt as of the observation date (last day of the fiscal quarter)\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((covenant_period_in_effect Bool) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_quarter_on_or_after_2005_09_30 Bool) (ebitda Real) (interest_expense Real) (total_debt Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and covenant_period_in_effect is_fiscal_quarter_end is_quarter_on_or_after_2005_09_30)\n      (and (not (< (/ ebitda interest_expense) 3.5))\n           (not (> (/ total_debt ebitda) 3.75)))))",
