{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Loan Parties as at the end of the fiscal quarter being observed (atomic ratio, as a plain number, e.g. 1.25 means 1.25:1.0).\n; total_leverage_ratio: Total Leverage Ratio as of the end of the fiscal quarter being observed (atomic ratio, as a plain number, e.g. 4.0 means 4.0:1.0).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: True iff the observation is as of the end of a fiscal quarter.\n; is_tier1_quarter: True iff the observed fiscal quarter ends on or about December 31, 2013, March 31, 2014, June 30, 2014 or September 30, 2014.\n; is_tier2_quarter: True iff the observed fiscal quarter ends on or about December 31, 2014, March 31, 2015, June 30, 2015 or September 30, 2015.\n; is_tier3_quarter: True iff the observed fiscal quarter ends on or about December 31, 2015, March 31, 2016, June 30, 2016 or September 30, 2016.\n; is_tier4_quarter: True iff the observed fiscal quarter is any fiscal quarter after the quarter ending on or about September 30, 2016 (\"each fiscal quarter thereafter\").\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (total_leverage_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_tier1_quarter Bool) (is_tier2_quarter Bool) (is_tier3_quarter Bool) (is_tier4_quarter Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 7.10(a): FCCR must not be less than 1.25 at the end of any fiscal quarter\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.25))\n    ; 7.10(b)(i): leverage must not be greater than 4.0\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_tier1_quarter) (<= total_leverage_ratio 4.0))\n    ; 7.10(b)(ii): leverage must not be greater than 3.0\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_tier2_quarter) (<= total_leverage_ratio 3.0))\n    ; 7.10(b)(iii): leverage must not be greater than 2.5\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_tier3_quarter) (<= total_leverage_ratio 2.5))\n    ; 7.10(b)(iv): leverage must not be greater than 2.25\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_tier4_quarter) (<= total_leverage_ratio 2.25))))",
