  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; covenant_period_active: true if at this observation any Commitments remain in effect, or the Loans and other Obligations are not paid in full, or any Letter of Credit is not cancelled or expired.\n; requisite_lenders_prior_written_consent: true if Requisite Lenders have given prior written consent that otherwise permits the Section 7 conduct at this observation.\n; has_contingent_obligation_outside_exceptions: true if Company, a Subsidiary or a Joint Venture in which they have an interest is liable for a Contingent Obligation that falls within none of exceptions (i)-(x) of Section 7.4. Exception (x) is handled separately through other_contingent_obligations_aggregate_liability.\n; other_contingent_obligations_aggregate_liability: maximum aggregate liability, contingent or otherwise, in USD, of Company and its Subsidiaries for all 'other' Contingent Obligations under clause (x), i.e. those not covered by clauses (i)-(ix).\n; increased_basket_effective: true if the observation is on or after the last day of the first Fiscal Year ending on or after October 31, 2004 during which the Consolidated Leverage Ratio as of that Fiscal Year's last day is less than 3.00:1.00.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (covenant_period_active Bool)\n    (requisite_lenders_prior_written_consent Bool)\n    (has_contingent_obligation_outside_exceptions Bool)\n    (other_contingent_obligations_aggregate_liability Real)\n    (increased_basket_effective Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and covenant_period_active (not requisite_lenders_prior_written_consent))\n      (and (not has_contingent_obligation_outside_exceptions)\n           (<= other_contingent_obligations_aggregate_liability\n               (ite increased_basket_effective 20000000.0 10000000.0)))))",
