{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; in_commitment_period: true iff the observation time falls during the Commitment Period (the period in which the covenant must be maintained at all times).\n; consolidated_unsubordinated_liabilities: Consolidated Unsubordinated Liabilities of M/I (and its consolidated entities) at the observation time, the ratio numerator.\n; consolidated_tangible_net_worth: Consolidated Tangible Net Worth at the observation time, one component of the ratio denominator.\n; subordinated_indebtedness: Subordinated Indebtedness at the observation time, the other component of the ratio denominator.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (in_commitment_period Bool)\n  (consolidated_unsubordinated_liabilities Real)\n  (consolidated_tangible_net_worth Real)\n  (subordinated_indebtedness Real)\n) Bool\n  (=> in_commitment_period\n      (<= (/ consolidated_unsubordinated_liabilities\n             (+ consolidated_tangible_net_worth subordinated_indebtedness))\n          2.0)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
