{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; commitments_expired_or_terminated: True iff the Commitments have expired or been terminated at the observation time.\n; all_loans_and_fees_paid_in_full: True iff the principal of and interest on each Loan and all fees payable under the agreement have been paid in full at the observation time.\n; cfc_complies_capital_requirements: True iff CFC complies with all minimum capital ratios and guidelines (including risk-based capital guidelines and capital leverage regulations) prescribed by regulation or enforceable order of the Board, the OCC, the OTS or other federal or state regulators having jurisdiction over it.\n; cfc_adequately_capitalized_applicable: True iff the \"adequately capitalized\" standard is applicable to CFC under those capital ratios and guidelines.\n; cfc_is_adequately_capitalized: True iff CFC is \"adequately capitalized\" within those ratios and guidelines.\n; all_bank_subs_comply_capital_requirements: True iff every CFC Subsidiary that is a regulated bank complies with all minimum capital ratios and guidelines applicable to it (true if there are no such Subsidiaries).\n; all_bank_subs_adequately_capitalized_where_applicable: True iff every CFC Subsidiary that is a regulated bank is \"adequately capitalized\" to the extent that standard is applicable to it (true if there are no such Subsidiaries or the standard is not applicable).\n; all_broker_dealer_subs_comply_rules: True iff every CFC Subsidiary that is a registered broker-dealer complies with all material rules and regulations of the SEC, the New York Stock Exchange and the National Association of Securities Dealers applicable to it, including net capital requirements (true if there are no such Subsidiaries).\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (commitments_expired_or_terminated Bool)\n  (all_loans_and_fees_paid_in_full Bool)\n  (cfc_complies_capital_requirements Bool)\n  (cfc_adequately_capitalized_applicable Bool)\n  (cfc_is_adequately_capitalized Bool)\n  (all_bank_subs_comply_capital_requirements Bool)\n  (all_bank_subs_adequately_capitalized_where_applicable Bool)\n  (all_broker_dealer_subs_comply_rules Bool)\n) Bool\n  (=> (not (and commitments_expired_or_terminated all_loans_and_fees_paid_in_full))\n      (and cfc_complies_capital_requirements\n           (=> cfc_adequately_capitalized_applicable cfc_is_adequately_capitalized)\n           all_bank_subs_comply_capital_requirements\n           all_bank_subs_adequately_capitalized_where_applicable\n           all_broker_dealer_subs_comply_rules)))",
