  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; credit_available_or_in_use: true iff any credit is available to or in use by the Borrower under the agreement at the observation time.\n; waived_in_writing: true iff compliance with Section 8.24 is waived in writing pursuant to Section 13.13 for this observation.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; in_period_1: true iff the observation date is from and including March 31, 2003 to and including June 30, 2004.\n; in_period_2: true iff the observation date is from and including July 1, 2004 to and including June 30, 2005.\n; in_period_3: true iff the observation date is on or after July 1, 2005.\n; ebitda_four_quarters: Borrower EBITDA for the four fiscal quarters then ended.\n; fixed_charges_four_quarters: Borrower Fixed Charges for the same four fiscal quarters then ended.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((credit_available_or_in_use Bool) (waived_in_writing Bool) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (in_period_1 Bool) (in_period_2 Bool) (in_period_3 Bool) (ebitda_four_quarters Real) (fixed_charges_four_quarters Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and credit_available_or_in_use (not waived_in_writing) is_fiscal_quarter_end)\n      (and (=> in_period_1 (>= (/ ebitda_four_quarters fixed_charges_four_quarters) 1.25))\n           (=> in_period_2 (>= (/ ebitda_four_quarters fixed_charges_four_quarters) 1.5))\n           (=> in_period_3 (>= (/ ebitda_four_quarters fixed_charges_four_quarters) 1.75)))))",
