{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a quarter of the Borrower's fiscal year.\n; earnings_available_for_fixed_charges: Borrower's Consolidated Earnings Available for Fixed Charges for the twelve months ended on the observation date.\n; fixed_charges: Borrower's Consolidated Fixed Charges for the twelve months ended on the observation date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_quarter_end Bool) (earnings_available_for_fixed_charges Real) (fixed_charges Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_quarter_end (>= (/ earnings_available_for_fixed_charges fixed_charges) 2.0)))",
