{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_calendar_month_end: true exactly when the observation is at the end of a calendar month.\n; covenant_period_active: true exactly when any Commitment, Loan or Letter of Credit Liability is outstanding and not all amounts payable by the Borrower have been paid in full.\n; tangible_capital_base: the Borrower's Tangible Capital Base in US dollars at the observation date.\n; current_ratio: the Borrower's Current Ratio at the observation date, expressed as a number X for X:1.0.\n; total_liabilities: the Borrower's Total Liabilities in US dollars at the observation date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_calendar_month_end Bool) (covenant_period_active Bool) (tangible_capital_base Real) (current_ratio Real) (total_liabilities Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and covenant_period_active is_calendar_month_end)\n      (and (>= tangible_capital_base 65000000.0)\n           (>= current_ratio 1.0)\n           (<= (/ total_liabilities tangible_capital_base) 5.0))))",
