  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_last_day_of_calendar_month: true iff the observation date is the last day of a calendar month (\"as of the last day of each calendar month\").\n; quick_assets: Borrower's Quick Assets at the observation date (atomic; no definition supplied).\n; current_liabilities: Borrower's Current Liabilities at the observation date.\n; deferred_maintenance_royalties_and_license_revenue: amount of deferred maintenance and royalties and other revenue derived from Licenses, the amount subtracted from Current Liabilities.\n; unrestricted_cash: Borrower's unrestricted cash at the observation date.\n; revolving_line_availability: amount available under the Committed Revolving Line at the observation date.\n; indebtedness_to_bank: Borrower's total Indebtedness to Bank at the observation date.\n; other_secured_indebtedness: all other secured Indebtedness of Borrower (excluding Indebtedness to Bank) at the observation date.\n; gross_revenue: Borrower's actual gross revenue for the measurement period ending at the observation date.\n; projected_gross_revenue: Borrower's projected gross revenue for the same period under its revenue plan attached as Exhibit F.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (is_last_day_of_calendar_month Bool)\n    (quick_assets Real)\n    (current_liabilities Real)\n    (deferred_maintenance_royalties_and_license_revenue Real)\n    (unrestricted_cash Real)\n    (revolving_line_availability Real)\n    (indebtedness_to_bank Real)\n    (other_secured_indebtedness Real)\n    (gross_revenue Real)\n    (projected_gross_revenue Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_last_day_of_calendar_month\n      (and\n        ; (a) Quick Ratio >= 1.75 to 1.00\n        (>= (/ quick_assets (- current_liabilities deferred_maintenance_royalties_and_license_revenue)) 1.75)\n        ; (b) Liquidity Ratio >= 1.75 to 1.00\n        (>= (/ (+ unrestricted_cash revolving_line_availability) (+ indebtedness_to_bank other_secured_indebtedness)) 1.75)\n        ; (c) Minimum Revenue: gross revenue >= 80% of projected gross revenue\n        (>= gross_revenue (* 0.8 projected_gross_revenue)))))",
