  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; consolidated_total_funded_debt: Consolidated Total Funded Debt as at the observation date.\n; consolidated_ebitda_four_quarters: Consolidated EBITDA for the period of four fiscal quarters ending on or most recently ended prior to the observation date.\n; consolidated_interest_expense_four_quarters: Consolidated Interest Expense of the Borrower for the same four-consecutive-fiscal-quarter period.\n; on_or_after_security_termination_date: true iff the observation date is on or after the Security Termination Date; false if it is prior to that date.\n; inventory_ar_subject_to_lien: aggregate amount of inventory and accounts receivable of the Borrower and the Subsidiary Guarantors subject to the Lien of the Security Agreement at the observation date.\n; inventory_ar_owned: aggregate amount of inventory and accounts receivable owned by the Borrower and the Subsidiary Guarantors at the observation date.\n; revolving_credit_exposure: aggregate Revolving Credit Exposure of the Lenders under this Agreement at the observation date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_total_funded_debt Real) (consolidated_ebitda_four_quarters Real) (consolidated_interest_expense_four_quarters Real) (on_or_after_security_termination_date Bool) (inventory_ar_subject_to_lien Real) (inventory_ar_owned Real) (revolving_credit_exposure Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; (a) leverage ratio must not be more than 3.75 to 1\n    (<= (/ consolidated_total_funded_debt consolidated_ebitda_four_quarters) 3.75)\n    ; (b) interest coverage ratio must not be less than 3.00 to 1\n    (>= (/ consolidated_ebitda_four_quarters consolidated_interest_expense_four_quarters) 3.0)\n    ; (c) collateral/exposure ratio must not be less than 1.30 to 1; numerator depends on Security Termination Date\n    (>= (/ (ite on_or_after_security_termination_date inventory_ar_owned inventory_ar_subject_to_lien) revolving_credit_exposure) 1.3)))",
