  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; four_quarter_determination_required: Bool, true if a determination hereunder is required by the terms hereof to be made for a period of four consecutive Fiscal Quarters at this observation time.\n; fewer_than_four_full_quarters_elapsed: Bool, true if fewer than four full Fiscal Quarters have elapsed since the Effective Date at this observation time.\n; used_in_ratio_with_balance_sheet_item: Bool, true if the determination is to be used in a ratio with a balance sheet item.\n; full_quarters_elapsed_in_period: Real, number of Fiscal Quarters in the period from the first day of the first Fiscal Quarter beginning after the Effective Date through the last day of the most recent Fiscal Quarter then ended.\n; elapsed_period_amount: Real, the unannualized amount of the determination measured over that elapsed period.\n; determination_amount_used: Real, the amount actually used for the four-quarter determination at this observation.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((four_quarter_determination_required Bool) (fewer_than_four_full_quarters_elapsed Bool) (used_in_ratio_with_balance_sheet_item Bool) (full_quarters_elapsed_in_period Real) (elapsed_period_amount Real) (determination_amount_used Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and four_quarter_determination_required fewer_than_four_full_quarters_elapsed)\n      (= determination_amount_used\n         (ite used_in_ratio_with_balance_sheet_item\n              (/ (* elapsed_period_amount 4.0) full_quarters_elapsed_in_period)\n              elapsed_period_amount))))",
