  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; total_liabilities: Borrower's total liabilities at the observation time, GAAP consistently applied, before subtracting the Subordinated Note principal.\n; subordinated_note_principal: principal amount of the Subordinated Note at the observation time.\n; total_assets: Borrower's total assets at the observation time, GAAP consistently applied.\n; intangible_assets: sum of Borrower's intangible assets at the observation time, GAAP consistently applied.\n; in_period_through_2000_05_31: true iff the observation date is within the period from the date of the Agreement through May 31, 2000.\n; in_period_2000_06_01_to_2001_05_31: true iff the observation date is within June 1, 2000 through May 31, 2001.\n; in_period_from_2001_06_01: true iff the observation date is on or after June 1, 2001.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((total_liabilities Real) (subordinated_note_principal Real) (total_assets Real) (intangible_assets Real) (in_period_through_2000_05_31 Bool) (in_period_2000_06_01_to_2001_05_31 Bool) (in_period_from_2001_06_01 Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> in_period_through_2000_05_31\n        (<= (/ (- total_liabilities subordinated_note_principal)\n               (+ (- total_assets intangible_assets) subordinated_note_principal))\n            2.5))\n    (=> in_period_2000_06_01_to_2001_05_31\n        (<= (/ (- total_liabilities subordinated_note_principal)\n               (+ (- total_assets intangible_assets) subordinated_note_principal))\n            2.25))\n    (=> in_period_from_2001_06_01\n        (<= (/ (- total_liabilities subordinated_note_principal)\n               (+ (- total_assets intangible_assets) subordinated_note_principal))\n            2.0))))",
