  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; commitments_outstanding: true if the Commitments have NOT yet expired or been terminated at the observation time.\n; loans_or_fees_unpaid: true if the principal of or interest on any Loan, or any fee payable under the agreement, has NOT been paid in full at the observation time.\n; letters_of_credit_outstanding: true if any Letter of Credit has NOT yet expired or terminated at the observation time.\n; lc_disbursements_unreimbursed: true if any L/C Disbursement has NOT yet been reimbursed at the observation time.\n; consolidated_ebitda: Consolidated EBITDA of the Borrower for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending at the observation time (currency units).\n; consolidated_cash_interest_expense: Consolidated Cash Interest Expense of the Borrower for the same four-consecutive-fiscal-quarter period (same currency units).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((commitments_outstanding Bool) (loans_or_fees_unpaid Bool) (letters_of_credit_outstanding Bool) (lc_disbursements_unreimbursed Bool) (consolidated_ebitda Real) (consolidated_cash_interest_expense Real)) Bool\n  (=> (or commitments_outstanding loans_or_fees_unpaid letters_of_credit_outstanding lc_disbursements_unreimbursed)\n      (>= (/ consolidated_ebitda consolidated_cash_interest_expense) 3.0)))",
