  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; consolidated_total_leverage_ratio: Consolidated Total Leverage Ratio of the Borrower at the observation time, as a plain number (3.00:1.00 is 3.0).\n; covenant_in_effect: true iff the observation time is on or after the Effective Date and the Total Commitment and all Letters of Credit have not yet terminated and the Loans, Notes, Unpaid Drawings, Fees and other Obligations (except indemnities under Section 13.13 not then due and payable) have not yet been paid in full.\n; in_period_initial: true iff the observation time is from the Initial Borrowing Date through and including September 29, 2002.\n; in_period_middle: true iff the observation time is from September 30, 2002 through and including March 30, 2003.\n; in_period_final: true iff the observation time is on or after March 31, 2003.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_total_leverage_ratio Real) (covenant_in_effect Bool) (in_period_initial Bool) (in_period_middle Bool) (in_period_final Bool)) Bool\n  (=> covenant_in_effect\n    (and\n      (=> in_period_initial (<= consolidated_total_leverage_ratio 3.0))\n      (=> in_period_middle (<= consolidated_total_leverage_ratio 2.75))\n      (=> in_period_final (<= consolidated_total_leverage_ratio 2.5)))))",
