  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; lender_has_commitment: true if any Lender has any Commitment at the observation time.\n; loan_or_obligation_unpaid: true if any Loan or other Obligation remains unpaid or unsatisfied at the observation time.\n; letter_of_credit_outstanding: true if any Letter of Credit remains outstanding at the observation time.\n; is_borrower_fiscal_quarter_end: true if the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; is_on_or_after_dec_31_2006_quarter: true if the fiscal quarter ending at the observation date is the quarter ending December 31, 2006 or a later quarter.\n; consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio: Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio as of the end of the fiscal quarter, as a number (3.0 means 3.0 to 1.0).\n; consolidated_leverage_ratio: Consolidated Leverage Ratio as of the end of the fiscal quarter, as a number (3.75 means 3.75 to 1.0).\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (lender_has_commitment Bool)\n  (loan_or_obligation_unpaid Bool)\n  (letter_of_credit_outstanding Bool)\n  (is_borrower_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (is_on_or_after_dec_31_2006_quarter Bool)\n  (consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio Real)\n  (consolidated_leverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and (or lender_has_commitment loan_or_obligation_unpaid letter_of_credit_outstanding)\n           is_borrower_fiscal_quarter_end\n           is_on_or_after_dec_31_2006_quarter)\n      (and (not (< consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio 3.0))\n           (not (> consolidated_leverage_ratio 3.75)))))",
