{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; adjusted_indebtedness: PriceSmart's Adjusted Indebtedness on a Consolidated Basis at the observation time (numerator of the Adjusted Indebtedness to Tangible Net Worth ratio).\n; tangible_net_worth: PriceSmart's Tangible Net Worth on a Consolidated Basis at the observation time (denominator of that ratio).\n; current_assets: PriceSmart's Current Assets on a Consolidated Basis at the observation time.\n; current_liabilities: PriceSmart's Current Liabilities on a Consolidated Basis at the observation time.\n; cash_flow: PriceSmart's Cash Flow on a Consolidated Basis for the four consecutive fiscal quarters ending at the observation time, taken as a single accounting period.\n; debt_service: PriceSmart's Debt Service on a Consolidated Basis for that same four-fiscal-quarter period.\n; projected_debt_service: PriceSmart's Projected Debt Service on a Consolidated Basis, determined as of the last day of that four-fiscal-quarter period.\n; reserve_market_value: Market value of the funds or assets on deposit in the Debt Service Reserve Account at the observation time.\n; debt_service_reserve_requirement: The Debt Service Reserve Requirement amount at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((adjusted_indebtedness Real) (tangible_net_worth Real) (current_assets Real) (current_liabilities Real) (cash_flow Real) (debt_service Real) (projected_debt_service Real) (reserve_market_value Real) (debt_service_reserve_requirement Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    (<= (/ adjusted_indebtedness tangible_net_worth) 1.0)\n    (>= (/ current_assets current_liabilities) 1.2)\n    (>= (/ cash_flow debt_service) 1.3)\n    (>= (/ cash_flow projected_debt_service) 1.3)\n    (>= reserve_market_value debt_service_reserve_requirement)))",
