{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; leverage_ratio: the Borrower's Leverage Ratio at the observation time (atomic Real; no definition supplied). At a quarter end it is the ratio as of that quarter end. At an Advance it is the ratio after giving effect to the Advance.\n; is_calendar_quarter_end: true iff the observation is as of the end of a calendar quarter (Section 7.8(a)).\n; is_facility_b_increasing_advance: true iff the observation is at the time of an Advance increasing the principal amount of the Facility B Loans, after giving effect to the Advance (Section 7.8(b)).\n; threshold_debt_proceeds_received: true iff the Threshold Debt Proceeds have been received as of the observation.\n; cash_equity_proceeds_received: true iff the Cash Equity Proceeds have been received as of the observation.\n; in_period_agreement_date_to_2000_03_30: true iff the observation date is within the period Agreement Date through March 30, 2000.\n; in_period_2000_03_31_to_2002_03_30: true iff the observation date is within the period March 31, 2000 through March 30, 2002.\n; on_or_after_2002_03_31: true iff the observation date is March 31, 2002 or thereafter.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((leverage_ratio Real)\n                            (is_calendar_quarter_end Bool)\n                            (is_facility_b_increasing_advance Bool)\n                            (threshold_debt_proceeds_received Bool)\n                            (cash_equity_proceeds_received Bool)\n                            (in_period_agreement_date_to_2000_03_30 Bool)\n                            (in_period_2000_03_31_to_2002_03_30 Bool)\n                            (on_or_after_2002_03_31 Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (or is_calendar_quarter_end is_facility_b_increasing_advance)\n      (let ((both_received (and threshold_debt_proceeds_received cash_equity_proceeds_received)))\n        (and\n          ; (i) prior to receipt of both (x) and (y)\n          (=> (and (not both_received) in_period_agreement_date_to_2000_03_30) (<= leverage_ratio 4.5))\n          (=> (and (not both_received) in_period_2000_03_31_to_2002_03_30) (<= leverage_ratio 4.0))\n          (=> (and (not both_received) on_or_after_2002_03_31) (<= leverage_ratio 3.5))\n          ; (ii) after receipt of both (x) and (y)\n          (=> (and both_received in_period_agreement_date_to_2000_03_30) (<= leverage_ratio 5.0))\n          (=> (and both_received in_period_2000_03_31_to_2002_03_30) (<= leverage_ratio 5.0))\n          (=> (and both_received on_or_after_2002_03_31) (<= leverage_ratio 4.0))))))",
