{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; in_covenant_period: true if the observation is from and after the date of the agreement until the later of the Termination Date and payment in full of all Loans and other Obligations.\n; lender_prior_written_consent: true if Lender has given prior written consent covering this observation.\n; consolidated_current_assets: Consolidated Current Assets at the observation time.\n; consolidated_current_liabilities: Consolidated Current Liabilities at the observation time.\n; consolidated_indebtedness: Consolidated Indebtedness at the observation time.\n; consolidated_net_worth: Consolidated Net Worth at the observation time.\n; consolidated_tangible_net_worth: Consolidated Tangible Net Worth at the observation time.\n; sum_quarterly_net_income_excluding_loss_quarters: sum, over each fiscal quarter commencing with the quarter ended December 31, 1997 through the latest quarter, of Borrower's consolidated net income for that quarter, with each quarter that has a net loss counted as zero.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (in_covenant_period Bool)\n    (lender_prior_written_consent Bool)\n    (consolidated_current_assets Real)\n    (consolidated_current_liabilities Real)\n    (consolidated_indebtedness Real)\n    (consolidated_net_worth Real)\n    (consolidated_tangible_net_worth Real)\n    (sum_quarterly_net_income_excluding_loss_quarters Real)\n  ) Bool\n  (=> (and in_covenant_period (not lender_prior_written_consent))\n      (and\n        (>= (/ consolidated_current_assets consolidated_current_liabilities) 3.0)\n        (<= (/ consolidated_indebtedness consolidated_net_worth) 1.25)\n        (>= consolidated_tangible_net_worth\n            (+ 15000000.0 (* 0.4 sum_quarterly_net_income_excluding_loss_quarters))))))",
