  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true exactly when the observation is as of the end of a fiscal quarter (applies to 7.11(a) and 7.11(c)).\n; consolidated_leverage_ratio: the Consolidated Leverage Ratio at this observation, as a ratio x for x:1.0.\n; consolidated_fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: the Consolidated Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio at this observation, as a ratio x for x:1.0.\n; consolidated_net_worth: Consolidated Net Worth at this observation, in US dollars.\n; cumulative_floored_quarterly_net_income: in US dollars, the sum over each fiscal quarter ending after the Closing Date and on or before this observation of max(Consolidated Net Income for that quarter, 0). Each quarter is floored at zero before summing.\n; cumulative_equity_transaction_net_proceeds: in US dollars, the cumulative net proceeds from Equity Transactions occurring after the Closing Date, up to this observation.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (consolidated_leverage_ratio Real)\n  (consolidated_fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real)\n  (consolidated_net_worth Real)\n  (cumulative_floored_quarterly_net_income Real)\n  (cumulative_equity_transaction_net_proceeds Real)\n) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 7.11(a): at each fiscal quarter end, leverage ratio not greater than 3.0:1.0\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 3.0))\n    ; 7.11(b): at all times, net worth not less than 180 million + 50% of cumulative floored quarterly net income + 75% of cumulative equity net proceeds\n    (>= consolidated_net_worth\n        (+ 180000000.0\n           (* 0.5 cumulative_floored_quarterly_net_income)\n           (* 0.75 cumulative_equity_transaction_net_proceeds)))\n    ; 7.11(c): at each fiscal quarter end, fixed charge coverage ratio not less than 2.0:1.0\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (>= consolidated_fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 2.0))\n  )\n)",
