{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; ebitda: EBITDA of the Borrower for the twelve fiscal months then ended.\n; rental_expense: Rental Expense for the same twelve fiscal months.\n; capex: aggregate principal amount of Capital Expenditures of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries for the same twelve fiscal months.\n; interest_expense: Interest Expense of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries on a consolidated basis for the same twelve fiscal months.\n; loans_outstanding: aggregate outstanding principal amount of all Loans under this Agreement at the observation time.\n; short_term_loans_outstanding: aggregate outstanding principal amount of all \"Loans\" under the Short-Term Credit Agreement at the observation time.\n; total_commitment: Total Commitment under this Agreement at the observation time.\n; short_term_total_commitment: \"Total Commitment\" under the Short-Term Credit Agreement at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n                            (ebitda Real)\n                            (rental_expense Real)\n                            (capex Real)\n                            (interest_expense Real)\n                            (loans_outstanding Real)\n                            (short_term_loans_outstanding Real)\n                            (total_commitment Real)\n                            (short_term_total_commitment Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end\n      (>= (/ (- (+ ebitda rental_expense) capex)\n             (+ interest_expense rental_expense))\n          (ite (< (+ loans_outstanding short_term_loans_outstanding)\n                  (* 0.25 (+ total_commitment short_term_total_commitment)))\n               1.0\n               1.25))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "is_fiscal_quarter_end",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.",
      "source_quote": "as of the last day of each fiscal quarter"
    },
    {
      "name": "ebitda",
      "meaning": "EBITDA of the Borrower for the twelve fiscal months then ended.",
      "source_quote": "EBITDA for the twelve fiscal months of the Borrower then ended"
    },
    {
      "name": "rental_expense",
      "meaning": "Rental Expense for the same twelve fiscal months.",
      "source_quote": "Rental Expense for the same twelve fiscal months"
    },
    {
      "name": "capex",
      "meaning": "Aggregate principal amount of Capital Expenditures of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries for the same twelve fiscal months.",
      "source_quote": "the aggregate principal amount of Capital Expenditures of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries for the same twelve fiscal months"
    },
    {
      "name": "interest_expense",
      "meaning": "Interest Expense of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries on a consolidated basis for the same twelve fiscal months.",
      "source_quote": "Interest Expense of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries on a consolidated basis for the same twelve fiscal months"
    },
    {
      "name": "loans_outstanding",
      "meaning": "Aggregate outstanding principal amount of all Loans under this Agreement at the observation time.",
      "source_quote": "the aggregate outstanding principal amount of all Loans"
    },
    {
      "name": "short_term_loans_outstanding",
      "meaning": "Aggregate outstanding principal amount of all \"Loans\" under the Short-Term Credit Agreement at the observation time.",
      "source_quote": "the aggregate outstanding principal amount of all \"Loans\" under the Short-Term Credit Agreement"
    },
    {
      "name": "total_commitment",
      "meaning": "Total Commitment under this Agreement at the observation time.",
      "source_quote": "the Total Commitment"
    },
    {
      "name": "short_term_total_commitment",
      "meaning": "\"Total Commitment\" under the Short-Term Credit Agreement at the observation time.",
      "source_quote": "the \"Total Commitment\" under the Short-Term Credit Agreement"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Cash Flow Ratio = (EBITDA + Rental Expense - Capital Expenditures) / (Interest Expense + Rental Expense). It must not be less than 1.25, so the check is >= 1.25. The threshold drops to 1.00 when combined Loans are strictly less than 25% of the combined Total Commitments. The division uses a variable denominator, so the logic is QF_NRA. A zero denominator is left to the evaluator to report as unresolved. The covenant is applied only at fiscal quarter end. The 'provided that at any time' clause only changes the threshold on those quarter-end tests. The Article VI lead-in (consent, duration) is not encoded as a separate input."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrowers.\n; is_quarter_beginning_on_or_after_2001_12_30: true iff the fiscal quarter ending at this observation began on or after December 30, 2001.\n; bank_otherwise_agrees: true iff the Bank has otherwise agreed (waived or modified) the Section 9.4 requirement for this observation.\n; pro_forma_fccr: Pro Forma Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Borrowers as of the end of the fiscal quarter, as a plain ratio (1.50 to 1.00 is 1.5). The definition is not supplied, so it is atomic.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_quarter_beginning_on_or_after_2001_12_30 Bool) (bank_otherwise_agrees Bool) (pro_forma_fccr Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_quarter_beginning_on_or_after_2001_12_30 (not bank_otherwise_agrees))\n      (>= pro_forma_fccr 1.5)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
