    {
      "name": "pro_forma_fccr",
      "meaning": "Pro Forma Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Borrowers as of the end of the fiscal quarter, as a plain ratio (1.50 to 1.00 is 1.5). Atomic because no definition is supplied.",
