  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_adlt_fiscal_quarter_end: true exactly when the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of ADLT.\n; is_on_or_after_june_1996_quarter_end: true exactly when the observation date is at or after the end of the fiscal quarter ending June, 1996 (the first covered quarter).\n; cash_flow_coverage_ratio: the Cash Flow Coverage Ratio as of the observation date, as a Real in x:1.0 form (2.0 means 2.0 to 1.0). Its definition is not supplied, so it is atomic.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_adlt_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_on_or_after_june_1996_quarter_end Bool) (cash_flow_coverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_adlt_fiscal_quarter_end is_on_or_after_june_1996_quarter_end)\n      (>= cash_flow_coverage_ratio 2.0)))",
