{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; on_or_after_agreement_date: True iff the observation time is on or after the date of this Agreement.\n; credit_facility_expired_or_terminated: True iff the Credit Facility has expired or been terminated at the observation time.\n; notes_and_other_liabilities_paid_in_full: True iff the Notes and other liabilities of the Company under the Agreement have been paid in full at the observation time.\n; ebitda_to_fixed_charge_ratio: The Company's EBITDA to Fixed Charge Ratio at the observation time, as a Real (x to 1.00). The source gives no arithmetic definition, so it is atomic.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((on_or_after_agreement_date Bool) (credit_facility_expired_or_terminated Bool) (notes_and_other_liabilities_paid_in_full Bool) (ebitda_to_fixed_charge_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and on_or_after_agreement_date\n           (or (not credit_facility_expired_or_terminated)\n               (not notes_and_other_liabilities_paid_in_full)))\n      (>= ebitda_to_fixed_charge_ratio 2.0)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
