{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Borrower's Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio for the measurement period applicable at this observation (atomic Real; no definition supplied). Threshold is 1.25 for 1.25:1.0.\n; is_period_closing_to_mar_30_1997: true iff this observation tests the period from the Closing Date to March 30, 1997.\n; is_period_closing_to_jun_29_1997: true iff this observation tests the period from the Closing Date to June 29, 1997.\n; is_period_closing_to_sep_28_1997: true iff this observation tests the period from the Closing Date to September 28, 1997.\n; is_trailing_four_quarter_period: true iff this observation tests the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ended at the end of the most recent fiscal quarter, for the period after September 28, 1997 (the 'thereafter' clause).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (is_period_closing_to_mar_30_1997 Bool) (is_period_closing_to_jun_29_1997 Bool) (is_period_closing_to_sep_28_1997 Bool) (is_trailing_four_quarter_period Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (or is_period_closing_to_mar_30_1997\n          is_period_closing_to_jun_29_1997\n          is_period_closing_to_sep_28_1997\n          is_trailing_four_quarter_period)\n      (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.25)))",
