  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of Borrower as of the last day of the Fiscal Quarter being observed, expressed as a plain ratio (1.15:1.00 = 1.15); atomic input since no definition is supplied.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter.\n; is_closing_date_through_feb_1999: true iff the Fiscal Quarter ending at the observation falls in the period from the Closing Date through February 1999.\n; is_quarter_ending_may_31_1999: true iff the Fiscal Quarter ends May 31, 1999.\n; is_quarter_ending_aug_or_nov_1999: true iff the Fiscal Quarter ends in August 1999 or on November 30, 1999.\n; is_quarter_thereafter: true iff the Fiscal Quarter ends after November 30, 1999 (the 'Thereafter' row).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_closing_date_through_feb_1999 Bool) (is_quarter_ending_may_31_1999 Bool) (is_quarter_ending_aug_or_nov_1999 Bool) (is_quarter_thereafter Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_closing_date_through_feb_1999) (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.15))\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_quarter_ending_may_31_1999) (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.05))\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_quarter_ending_aug_or_nov_1999) (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.15))\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_quarter_thereafter) (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.20))))",
