  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; debt_to_capitalization_ratio: Borrower's Debt to Capitalization Ratio at the observation time, as a decimal (1.0 means 1.0 to 1.0); atomic input because no arithmetic definition is supplied.\n; on_or_after_effective_date: true iff the observation time is on or after the Effective Date.\n; merger_consummated: true iff the observation time is on or after the date on which the Merger is consummated.\n; corporate_conversion_occurred: true iff the observation time is on or after the date on which a Corporate Conversion occurs.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((debt_to_capitalization_ratio Real)\n                            (on_or_after_effective_date Bool)\n                            (merger_consummated Bool)\n                            (corporate_conversion_occurred Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; (a) From the Effective Date until but not including the earlier of the Merger and Corporate Conversion dates: <= .53\n    (=> (and on_or_after_effective_date\n             (not (or merger_consummated corporate_conversion_occurred)))\n        (<= debt_to_capitalization_ratio 0.53))\n    ; (b) From the earlier of the Merger and Corporate Conversion dates and thereafter: <= .57\n    (=> (or merger_consummated corporate_conversion_occurred)\n        (<= debt_to_capitalization_ratio 0.57))))",
