  "notes": "All three covenants are negative covenants that apply at any time, so they are translated pointwise and conjoined. The 0.50 to 1 ratio in (a) is encoded as debt / (net worth + debt) <= 0.5, which uses division by a variable and therefore needs QF_NRA. A zero denominator is reported as unresolved by the evaluator, and no positivity is assumed. In (c), the 'without deduction for losses' wording is carried by the input's definition, since the source gives no formula for it. The $50,000,000 base, the 33% factor and the equity-proceeds term are in the formula. Defined terms such as Indebtedness, Wholly-Owned Subsidiary and Convertible Securities are not defined in the supplied context, so the inputs are taken as already computed under those definitions."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; credit_in_use_or_available: true if credit is in use or available under the Agreement at the observation time.\n; amount_unpaid: true if any amount remains unpaid on any Note, Reimbursement Obligation or L/C at the observation time.\n; waived_in_writing_by_required_banks: true if compliance with the relevant Section 7.4 obligation is waived in writing by the Required Banks.\n; accounting_system_maintained: true if the Borrower and each Subsidiary maintain a system of accounting in accordance with sound accounting practice at the observation time.\n; is_45_day_deadline_after_fiscal_q1_q2_q3: true if the observation date is the 45th day after the close of one of the first three fiscal quarters of a fiscal year of the Borrower.\n; quarterly_statements_delivered_within_45_days: true if, for that quarter, each Bank received within 45 days after quarter close the consolidated and consolidating balance sheets and income statements and the consolidated cash flow statements for the quarter and year to date and the corresponding prior-year periods, prepared by the Borrower and certified by its chief financial officer.\n; compliance_certificate_delivered_with_quarterly_statements: true if the Exhibit H Compliance Certificate, signed by the President or CFO, was delivered together with the quarterly statements.\n; is_90_day_deadline_after_fiscal_year_end: true if the observation date is the 90th day after the close of a fiscal year of the Borrower.\n; annual_audit_and_statements_delivered_within_90_days: true if, for that fiscal year, each Bank received within 90 days after year end the audit report, the accompanying financial statements and the unaudited consolidating balance sheets and statements of income.\n; compliance_certificate_delivered_with_annual_statements: true if the Exhibit H Compliance Certificate, signed by the President or CFO, was delivered together with the annual financial statements.\n; is_45_day_deadline_after_last_fiscal_quarter: true if the observation date is the 45th day after the close of the last fiscal quarter of a fiscal year.\n; q4_compliance_certificate_delivered_within_45_days: true if a Compliance Certificate in the form required by subsection (c) was delivered within 45 days after the close of the last fiscal quarter.\n; q4_pricing_ratio_certificate_delivered_within_45_days: true if an Exhibit K Pricing Ratio Certificate, signed by the President or CFO and showing the Pricing Ratio as of the last day of that fiscal quarter, was delivered within 45 days after the close of the last fiscal quarter.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (credit_in_use_or_available Bool)\n  (amount_unpaid Bool)\n  (waived_in_writing_by_required_banks Bool)\n  (accounting_system_maintained Bool)\n  (is_45_day_deadline_after_fiscal_q1_q2_q3 Bool)\n  (quarterly_statements_delivered_within_45_days Bool)\n  (compliance_certificate_delivered_with_quarterly_statements Bool)\n  (is_90_day_deadline_after_fiscal_year_end Bool)\n  (annual_audit_and_statements_delivered_within_90_days Bool)\n  (compliance_certificate_delivered_with_annual_statements Bool)\n  (is_45_day_deadline_after_last_fiscal_quarter Bool)\n  (q4_compliance_certificate_delivered_within_45_days Bool)\n  (q4_pricing_ratio_certificate_delivered_within_45_days Bool)\n) Bool\n  (=> (and (or credit_in_use_or_available amount_unpaid)\n           (not waived_in_writing_by_required_banks))\n      (and accounting_system_maintained\n           (=> is_45_day_deadline_after_fiscal_q1_q2_q3\n               (and quarterly_statements_delivered_within_45_days\n                    compliance_certificate_delivered_with_quarterly_statements))\n           (=> is_90_day_deadline_after_fiscal_year_end\n               (and annual_audit_and_statements_delivered_within_90_days\n                    compliance_certificate_delivered_with_annual_statements))\n           (=> is_45_day_deadline_after_last_fiscal_quarter\n               (or q4_compliance_certificate_delivered_within_45_days\n                   q4_pricing_ratio_certificate_delivered_within_45_days)))))",
