  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter.\n; advance_or_obligation_unpaid: true iff any Advance or any other Obligation of any Loan Party under any Loan Document remains unpaid at the observation time.\n; letter_of_credit_outstanding: true iff any Letter of Credit is outstanding at the observation time.\n; lender_commitment_exists: true iff any Lender Party has any Commitment under the agreement at the observation time.\n; majority_lenders_written_consent: true iff the Borrower has the written consent of the Majority Lenders to do otherwise than the financial covenants require, in effect at the observation time.\n; leverage_ratio: Leverage Ratio as of the observation date, based on the four consecutive Fiscal Quarters most recently completed and ending that day (X in X:1.00).\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio as of the observation date, based on the four consecutive Fiscal Quarters most recently completed and ending that day (X in X:1.00).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter Bool) (advance_or_obligation_unpaid Bool) (letter_of_credit_outstanding Bool) (lender_commitment_exists Bool) (majority_lenders_written_consent Bool) (leverage_ratio Real) (fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter\n           (or advance_or_obligation_unpaid letter_of_credit_outstanding lender_commitment_exists)\n           (not majority_lenders_written_consent))\n      (and (<= leverage_ratio 2.25)\n           (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 2.0))))",
