  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_measurement_period_end: True exactly when the observation is as of the end of a Measurement Period.\n; any_advance_or_obligation_unpaid: True when any Advance or any other Obligation of any Loan Party under any Loan Document remains unpaid.\n; any_letter_of_credit_outstanding: True when any Letter of Credit is outstanding.\n; any_lender_commitment_exists: True when any Lender Party has any Commitment under the agreement.\n; consolidated_total_leverage_ratio: Consolidated Total Leverage Ratio as of the observation date, as an atomic ratio (3.50:1.00 corresponds to 3.5).\n; consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio: Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio as of the observation date, as an atomic ratio (4.00:1.00 corresponds to 4.0).\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (is_measurement_period_end Bool)\n    (any_advance_or_obligation_unpaid Bool)\n    (any_letter_of_credit_outstanding Bool)\n    (any_lender_commitment_exists Bool)\n    (consolidated_total_leverage_ratio Real)\n    (consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_measurement_period_end\n           (or any_advance_or_obligation_unpaid\n               any_letter_of_credit_outstanding\n               any_lender_commitment_exists))\n      (and (<= consolidated_total_leverage_ratio 3.5)\n           (>= consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio 4.0))))",
