  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; first_lien_leverage_ratio: First Lien Leverage Ratio as of the last day of the Test Period being observed, as a plain number (5.25:1.00 = 5.25). Calculated on a Pro Forma Basis and including any Specified Equity Contribution in EBITDA, as the covenant provides.\n; is_test_date_in_5_25_tier: True iff the observation date is the last day of a Test Period listed at 5.25:1.00, i.e. January 31, April 30, July 31 or October 31, 2017 and 2018, or January 31, 2019.\n; is_test_date_in_4_75_tier: True iff the observation date is the last day of a Test Period listed at 4.75:1.00, i.e. April 30, 2019, July 31, 2019, October 31, 2019 or January 31, 2020.\n; is_test_date_in_4_50_tier: True iff the observation date is the last day of the Test Period ending April 30, 2020 or any later Test Period (\"April 30, 2020 and thereafter\"), at 4.50:1.00.\n; is_pro_forma_compliance_check_before_jan_31_2017_test_period_end: True iff a provision of the Agreement requires compliance on a Pro Forma Basis with Section 6.12 prior to the end of the Test Period ending January 31, 2017.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((first_lien_leverage_ratio Real)\n                            (is_test_date_in_5_25_tier Bool)\n                            (is_test_date_in_4_75_tier Bool)\n                            (is_test_date_in_4_50_tier Bool)\n                            (is_pro_forma_compliance_check_before_jan_31_2017_test_period_end Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> is_test_date_in_5_25_tier (<= first_lien_leverage_ratio 5.25))\n    (=> is_test_date_in_4_75_tier (<= first_lien_leverage_ratio 4.75))\n    (=> is_test_date_in_4_50_tier (<= first_lien_leverage_ratio 4.5))\n    (=> is_pro_forma_compliance_check_before_jan_31_2017_test_period_end (<= first_lien_leverage_ratio 5.5))))",
