{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; funded_debt: Borrower's Funded Debt at the observation time, without duplication. It is all indebtedness for money borrowed, indebtedness guaranteed, purchase money market mortgages, capitalized leases, outstanding letters of credit (aggregate face amount), conditional sales contracts and similar title retention debt instruments, including current maturities of such indebtedness. This applies to debt that by its terms matures more than one year from the calculation date and/or is renewable or extendable at the obligor's option beyond one year from that date.\n; pre_tax_income: all pre-tax income earned by the Borrower for the EBITDA period (EBITDA clause A).\n; depreciation: depreciation for the same EBITDA period (EBITDA clause B).\n; amortization: amortization of goodwill and other intangible assets for the same EBITDA period (EBITDA clause C).\n; net_interest_expense: net-interest expense for the same EBITDA period (EBITDA clause D).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((funded_debt Real) (pre_tax_income Real) (depreciation Real) (amortization Real) (net_interest_expense Real)) Bool\n  (<= (/ funded_debt (+ pre_tax_income depreciation amortization net_interest_expense)) 3.0))",
