{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; consolidated_fccr: Consolidated Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio as at the observation date, as a ratio X:1.00 (so 1.25:1.00 is 1.25).\n; consolidated_leverage_ratio: Consolidated Leverage Ratio as at the observation date, as a ratio X:1.00 (so 2.50:1.00 is 2.5).\n; is_on_or_after_spin_out_effective_date: true iff the observation date (the fiscal quarter end) occurs on or after the Spin-Out Transaction Effective Date; false if it occurs prior to that date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (consolidated_fccr Real) (consolidated_leverage_ratio Real) (is_on_or_after_spin_out_effective_date Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    ;; 7.1(a): FCCR must not be less than 1.25 at fiscal quarter end\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (>= consolidated_fccr 1.25))\n    ;; 7.1(b)(i): before the Spin-Out Transaction Effective Date, leverage must not exceed 2.50\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end (not is_on_or_after_spin_out_effective_date))\n        (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 2.5))\n    ;; 7.1(b)(ii): on or after the Spin-Out Transaction Effective Date, leverage must not exceed 2.00\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_on_or_after_spin_out_effective_date)\n        (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 2.0))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "is_fiscal_quarter_end",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.",
      "source_quote": "last day of any fiscal quarter of the Borrower"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_fccr",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio as at the observation date, expressed as X in X:1.00 (1.25:1.00 is 1.25).",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_leverage_ratio",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Leverage Ratio as at the observation date, expressed as X in X:1.00 (2.50:1.00 is 2.5).",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated Leverage Ratio"
    },
    {
      "name": "is_on_or_after_spin_out_effective_date",
      "meaning": "True iff the fiscal quarter end occurs on or after the Spin-Out Transaction Effective Date; false if it occurs prior to that date.",
      "source_quote": "occurring on or after the Spin-Out Transaction Effective Date"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The FCCR must not be less than 1.25 (>= 1.25), and the leverage ratio must not exceed the cap (<= 2.5 before the Spin-Out Transaction Effective Date, <= 2.0 on or after it). Both tests apply only on fiscal quarter-end observations. The before and on-or-after cases are complementary, so one Boolean covers both. The ratios are atomic inputs because their definitions are not supplied. The 'until the Discharge of Obligations' scope is treated as covering the observation period supplied."
}

