  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Parent\n; total_debt: Total Debt as of the observation date (last day of the fiscal quarter)\n; ebitdax_ttm: EBITDAX for the four fiscal quarters ending on the observation date\n; senior_secured_leverage_ratio: Senior Secured Leverage Ratio as of the observation date (atomic; definition not supplied)\n; interest_expense_ttm: Interest Expense for the period of four fiscal quarters ending on the observation date\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter Bool) (total_debt Real) (ebitdax_ttm Real) (senior_secured_leverage_ratio Real) (interest_expense_ttm Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter\n      (and\n        ; 9.01(a): Total Debt / EBITDAX must not be greater than 4.00 to 1.0\n        (<= (/ total_debt ebitdax_ttm) 4.0)\n        ; 9.01(b): Senior Secured Leverage Ratio must not be greater than 3.00 to 1.00\n        (<= senior_secured_leverage_ratio 3.0)\n        ; 9.01(c): EBITDAX / Interest Expense must not be less than 2.5 to 1.0\n        (>= (/ ebitdax_ttm interest_expense_ttm) 2.5))))",
