{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Company.\n; is_quarter_on_or_after_2007_11_30: true iff the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date ends on or after November 30, 2007.\n; indebtedness_for_borrowed_money: Indebtedness For Borrowed Money of the Company and its consolidated Subsidiaries as of the last day of the fiscal quarter, excluding undrawn amounts in respect of Facility LCs. Pro forma for Permitted Acquisitions as the source requires.\n; ebitda_four_quarter: EBITDA, actual amount for the four-quarter period ending on the observation date. Pro forma for Permitted Acquisitions as the source requires.\n; ebit_four_quarter: EBIT, actual amount for the four-quarter period ending on the observation date. Pro forma for Permitted Acquisitions as the source requires.\n; interest_expense_four_quarter: Interest Expense, actual amount for the four-quarter period ending on the observation date. Pro forma for Permitted Acquisitions as the source requires.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n                            (is_quarter_on_or_after_2007_11_30 Bool)\n                            (indebtedness_for_borrowed_money Real)\n                            (ebitda_four_quarter Real)\n                            (ebit_four_quarter Real)\n                            (interest_expense_four_quarter Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_quarter_on_or_after_2007_11_30)\n      (and (<= (/ indebtedness_for_borrowed_money ebitda_four_quarter) 3.5)\n           (>= (/ ebit_four_quarter interest_expense_four_quarter) 2.5))))",
  "symbols": [
