  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Loan Parties and their Subsidiaries as of the observation day (atomic Real; its definition is not supplied)\n; advance_unpaid: true iff any Advance remains unpaid on the observation day\n; other_obligation_unpaid: true iff any other Obligation (besides Advances) remains unpaid on the observation day\n; commitments_in_force: true iff any portion of the Commitments remains in force on the observation day\n; agent_consent_given: true iff the Administrative Agent, with the written approval of the Requisite Lenders (or of all Lenders if required by Section 12.1), has consented to otherwise permit a Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio below 1.50 to 1.00 as of the observation day\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (advance_unpaid Bool) (other_obligation_unpaid Bool) (commitments_in_force Bool) (agent_consent_given Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and (or advance_unpaid other_obligation_unpaid commitments_in_force)\n           (not agent_consent_given))\n      (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.5)))",
