  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; lender_commitment_outstanding: true when any Lender has any Commitment hereunder at the observation time.\n; unpaid_obligation_outstanding: true when any Loan or other Obligation hereunder remains unpaid or unsatisfied, excluding contingent indemnity obligations in respect of which no claim has been asserted.\n; letter_of_credit_outstanding: true when any Letter of Credit remains outstanding at the observation time.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true when the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio: Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio as of the end of the fiscal quarter, as a number x for x to 1.00.\n; consolidated_leverage_ratio: Consolidated Leverage Ratio as of the end of the fiscal quarter, as a number x for x to 1.00.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((lender_commitment_outstanding Bool) (unpaid_obligation_outstanding Bool) (letter_of_credit_outstanding Bool) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio Real) (consolidated_leverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           (or lender_commitment_outstanding unpaid_obligation_outstanding letter_of_credit_outstanding))\n      (and (not (< consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio 3.0))\n           (not (> consolidated_leverage_ratio 2.5)))))",
