{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; commitments_or_amounts_outstanding: true iff at the observation time any Bank has any Commitment under the agreement or any amount payable under the agreement remains unpaid.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; consolidated_adjusted_ebit_four_quarters: Consolidated Adjusted EBIT for the four fiscal quarters then ended taken as a single accounting period, excluding the effect of the one-time $123,800,000 (after tax) restructuring charge.\n; consolidated_interest_expense_four_quarters: Consolidated Interest Expense for the four fiscal quarters then ended taken as a single accounting period, excluding the effect of the one-time restructuring charge.\n; consolidated_railcar_lease_expense_four_quarters: Consolidated Railcar Lease Expense for the four fiscal quarters then ended taken as a single accounting period, excluding the effect of the one-time restructuring charge.\n; tnw_prior_quarter_end: Consolidated Tangible Net Worth calculated as at the end of the most recently ended fiscal quarter, excluding the effect of the one-time restructuring charge.\n; writeoffs_special_charges_announced_in_quarter: total amount of write-offs and similar special charges publicly announced by the Borrower during the current fiscal quarter, as a nonreducing-sign-positive amount that reduces Consolidated Tangible Net Worth.\n; restricted_payments_in_quarter: total amount of Restricted Payments made during the current fiscal quarter, as a positive amount that reduces Consolidated Tangible Net Worth.\n; cumulative_positive_quarterly_net_income: sum of Consolidated Net Income over each fiscal quarter ended after December 31, 1995 and on or before the observation date whose Consolidated Net Income is positive; non-positive quarters contribute zero; excludes the effect of the one-time restructuring charge.\n; gatx_exposure: aggregate amount of investments by the Borrower in, net advances by the Borrower to, and receivables due to the Borrower from, GATX and its Subsidiaries other than the Borrower and Subsidiaries of the Borrower, as at the observation date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (commitments_or_amounts_outstanding Bool)\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (consolidated_adjusted_ebit_four_quarters Real)\n  (consolidated_interest_expense_four_quarters Real)\n  (consolidated_railcar_lease_expense_four_quarters Real)\n  (tnw_prior_quarter_end Real)\n  (writeoffs_special_charges_announced_in_quarter Real)\n  (restricted_payments_in_quarter Real)\n  (cumulative_positive_quarterly_net_income Real)\n  (gatx_exposure Real)) Bool\n  (=> commitments_or_amounts_outstanding\n    (and\n      ; (a) interest and railcar lease coverage ratio strictly greater than 1.45 to 1.0 at fiscal quarter end\n      (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end\n        (> (/ consolidated_adjusted_ebit_four_quarters\n              (+ consolidated_interest_expense_four_quarters\n                 (* 0.5 consolidated_railcar_lease_expense_four_quarters)))\n           1.45))\n      ; (b) deemed Consolidated Tangible Net Worth strictly greater than $570,000,000 plus 25% of cumulative positive quarterly net income\n      (> (- (- tnw_prior_quarter_end writeoffs_special_charges_announced_in_quarter) restricted_payments_in_quarter)\n         (+ 570000000.0 (* 0.25 cumulative_positive_quarterly_net_income)))\n      ; (c) GATX exposure not exceeding 65% of deemed Consolidated Tangible Net Worth\n      (<= gatx_exposure\n          (* 0.65 (- (- tnw_prior_quarter_end writeoffs_special_charges_announced_in_quarter) restricted_payments_in_quarter))))))",
