  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; loans_or_obligations_unpaid: true iff, at the observation time, any Loan or any other Obligations remain unpaid.\n; consolidated_indebtedness: Consolidated Indebtedness of the Borrower at the observation time (Real, currency units).\n; consolidated_net_worth: Consolidated Net Worth of the Borrower at the observation time (Real, currency units, same units as consolidated_indebtedness).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((loans_or_obligations_unpaid Bool) (consolidated_indebtedness Real) (consolidated_net_worth Real)) Bool\n  (=> loans_or_obligations_unpaid\n      (<= (/ consolidated_indebtedness (+ consolidated_indebtedness consolidated_net_worth)) 0.65)))",
