  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; consolidated_leverage_ratio: Consolidated Leverage Ratio of the Company, measured on the last day of the fiscal quarter being observed (atomic; definition not supplied).\n; consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio: Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio of the Company for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending with the fiscal quarter being observed (atomic; definition not supplied).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end_after_closing_date: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter that ends after the Closing Date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_leverage_ratio Real) (consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end_after_closing_date Bool)) Bool\n  (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end_after_closing_date\n      (and (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 4.0)\n           (>= consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio 3.0))))",
