  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; asset_coverage_ratio: the Asset Coverage Ratio as of the observation date (atomic Real, definition not supplied).\n; consolidated_ebitdar_ltm: Consolidated EBITDAR for the period of four fiscal quarters ending on the observation date.\n; consolidated_interest_expense_ltm: Consolidated Interest Expense for the same four-fiscal-quarter period.\n; consolidated_rental_expense_ltm: Consolidated Rental Expense for the same four-fiscal-quarter period.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter Bool) (asset_coverage_ratio Real) (consolidated_ebitdar_ltm Real) (consolidated_interest_expense_ltm Real) (consolidated_rental_expense_ltm Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 6.10(a): not permitted to be <= 1.10 to 1.00, so it must be > 1.10\n    (=> is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter (> asset_coverage_ratio 1.10))\n    ; 6.10(b): EBITDAR / (interest + rental) must not be <= 2.25, so it must be > 2.25\n    (=> is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter\n        (> (/ consolidated_ebitdar_ltm (+ consolidated_interest_expense_ltm consolidated_rental_expense_ltm)) 2.25))))",
