{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true exactly when the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower (Section 7.11(a) applies only then).\n; consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio: the Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio as of the observation date, as a Real number (X for X:1.00). It is an atomic input because the source gives no definition.\n; consolidated_leverage_ratio: the Consolidated Leverage Ratio at the observation time, which falls within a period of four fiscal quarters of the Borrower, as a Real number (X for X:1.00). It is an atomic input because the source gives no definition.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio Real) (consolidated_leverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 7.11(a): the ratio must not be less than 3.00 at a fiscal quarter end\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (>= consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio 3.00))\n    ; 7.11(b): the ratio must not be greater than 2.25 at any observed time\n    (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 2.25)))",
