      "meaning": "True exactly when the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower, so that the interest coverage test in Section 7.11(a) applies.",
      "source_quote": "as of the end of any fiscal quarter of the Borrower"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio",
      "meaning": "The Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio as of the observation date, as a Real number (X for X:1.00). It is an atomic input because the source gives no definition.",
