{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; consolidated_current_ratio: Consolidated Current Ratio of the Borrower at the observation time (current-ratio value, e.g. 1.25 means 1.25:1.00).\n; covenant_term_in_effect: True iff at the observation time the Agreement remains in effect or the principal of or interest on any Note, any amount under any Letter of Credit or Acceptance Draft, or any fee, expense or amount payable hereunder or in connection with the Transactions is unpaid.\n; in_closing_through_dec_30_1998: True iff the observation date is on or after the Closing Date and on or before December 30, 1998 (inclusive).\n; after_dec_30_1998: True iff the observation date is after December 30, 1998.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_current_ratio Real) (covenant_term_in_effect Bool) (in_closing_through_dec_30_1998 Bool) (after_dec_30_1998 Bool)) Bool\n  (=> covenant_term_in_effect\n      (and (=> in_closing_through_dec_30_1998 (not (< consolidated_current_ratio 1.20)))\n           (=> after_dec_30_1998 (not (< consolidated_current_ratio 1.30))))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "consolidated_current_ratio",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Current Ratio of the Borrower at the observation time, as a Real (1.20 represents 1.20:1.00).",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated Current Ratio of the Borrower"
    },
    {
      "name": "covenant_term_in_effect",
      "meaning": "True iff at the observation time the Agreement remains in effect or the principal of or interest on any Note, any amount under any Letter of Credit or Acceptance Draft, or any fee, expense or amount payable hereunder or in connection with the Transactions is unpaid.",
      "source_quote": "so long as this Agreement shall remain in effect or the principal of or interest on any Note"
    },
    {
      "name": "in_closing_through_dec_30_1998",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is on or after the Closing Date and on or before December 30, 1998 (inclusive).",
      "source_quote": "from the Closing Date through and including December 30, 1998"
    },
    {
      "name": "after_dec_30_1998",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is after December 30, 1998.",
      "source_quote": "thereafter, 1.30:1.00"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The covenant prohibits the ratio from being less than 1.20 (through and including Dec 30, 1998) or 1.30 (thereafter), so compliance is ratio >= threshold (not strictly greater). Encoded as (not (< ratio threshold)) to mirror 'less than'. The covenant is applied pointwise at each observation; the two period flags are evaluator-supplied calendar inputs. No division is involved."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; long_term_indebtedness: Long-Term Indebtedness of the Borrowers and Subsidiaries at the observation time, as defined in the Agreement; currency units, same as total_capitalization.\n; total_capitalization: Total Capitalization at the observation time, as defined in the Agreement; same currency units as long_term_indebtedness.\n; commitments_terminated: True iff the Commitments have been terminated at the observation time.\n; all_obligations_paid_in_full: True iff the principal of and interest on each Loan, all Fees and all other expenses or amounts payable under any Loan Document have been paid in full at the observation time.\n; required_lenders_consent: True iff the Required Lenders have consented in writing, at the observation time, to the Borrower permitting the ratio to exceed .65 to 1.0.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((long_term_indebtedness Real) (total_capitalization Real) (commitments_terminated Bool) (all_obligations_paid_in_full Bool) (required_lenders_consent Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and (not (and commitments_terminated all_obligations_paid_in_full))\n           (not required_lenders_consent))\n      (<= (/ long_term_indebtedness total_capitalization) 0.65)))",
  "symbols": [
