  "notes": "Pointwise at-any-time translation: the covenant is active unless both the Commitments are terminated and all obligations are paid in full, and it is waived when the Required Lenders have consented in writing. When active, LTI/TC must be at most 0.65, since only exceeding .65 to 1.0 is prohibited. The ratio is computed as a division. A zero Total Capitalization is left to the evaluator to report as unresolved. QF_NRA is used because the division is by a variable."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (commitments_in_effect Bool) ; true if any Commitments under the agreement remain in effect at this observation\n  (loan_principal_or_interest_unpaid Bool) ; true if any principal of or interest on any Loan remains outstanding and unpaid at this observation\n  (letter_of_credit_outstanding Bool) ; true if any Letter of Credit remains outstanding at this observation\n  (lc_disbursement_unreimbursed Bool) ; true if any LC Disbursement remains unreimbursed at this observation\n  (fees_or_other_amounts_unpaid Bool) ; true if any Fees or any other amounts payable under the agreement remain unpaid at this observation\n  (required_lenders_written_consent Bool) ; true if the Required Lenders have otherwise consented in writing to non-compliance with Section 5.13 at this observation\n  (consolidated_total_debt Real) ; Consolidated Total Debt at this observation, numerator of the ratio in 5.13(a), as defined in the agreement\n  (consolidated_subsidiary_debt Real) ; Consolidated Subsidiary Debt at this observation, numerator of the ratio in 5.13(b), as defined in the agreement\n  (consolidated_total_capitalization Real) ; Consolidated Total Capitalization at this observation, denominator of both ratios, as defined in the agreement\n) Bool\n  (=> (and (or commitments_in_effect\n               loan_principal_or_interest_unpaid\n               letter_of_credit_outstanding\n               lc_disbursement_unreimbursed\n               fees_or_other_amounts_unpaid)\n           (not required_lenders_written_consent))\n      (and (<= (/ consolidated_total_debt consolidated_total_capitalization) 0.35)\n           (<= (/ consolidated_subsidiary_debt consolidated_total_capitalization) 0.10))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "commitments_in_effect",
      "meaning": "True if any Commitments under the agreement remain in effect at this observation.",
      "source_quote": "any Commitments hereunder remain in effect"
    },
    {
      "name": "loan_principal_or_interest_unpaid",
      "meaning": "True if any principal of or interest on any Loan remains outstanding and unpaid at this observation.",
      "source_quote": "any principal of or interest on any Loan remains outstanding and unpaid"
    },
    {
      "name": "letter_of_credit_outstanding",
      "meaning": "True if any Letter of Credit remains outstanding at this observation.",
      "source_quote": "any Letter of Credit remains outstanding"
    },
    {
      "name": "lc_disbursement_unreimbursed",
      "meaning": "True if any LC Disbursement remains unreimbursed at this observation.",
      "source_quote": "any LC Disbursement remains unreimbursed"
    },
    {
      "name": "fees_or_other_amounts_unpaid",
      "meaning": "True if any Fees or any other amounts payable under the agreement remain unpaid at this observation.",
      "source_quote": "any Fees or any other amounts payable hereunder remain unpaid"
    },
    {
      "name": "required_lenders_written_consent",
      "meaning": "True if the Required Lenders have otherwise consented in writing to non-compliance with Section 5.13 at this observation.",
      "source_quote": "unless the Required Lenders shall otherwise consent in writing"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_total_debt",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Total Debt at this observation, the numerator of the ratio in 5.13(a), as defined in the agreement.",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated Total Debt"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_subsidiary_debt",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Subsidiary Debt at this observation, the numerator of the ratio in 5.13(b), as defined in the agreement.",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated Subsidiary Debt"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_total_capitalization",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Total Capitalization at this observation, the denominator of both ratios, as defined in the agreement.",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated Total Capitalization"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The covenant applies when at least one of the five 'so long as' conditions holds and the Required Lenders have not consented in writing. When it applies, both ratios must hold: Consolidated Total Debt / Consolidated Total Capitalization must not be greater than 0.35 (so it must be <= 0.35), and Consolidated Subsidiary Debt / Consolidated Total Capitalization must not be greater than .10 (so it must be <= 0.10). The ratios are written as divisions, so a zero capitalization is reported as unresolved by the evaluator, as the stated policy requires. QF_NRA is used because the denominator is a variable. The definitions of the consolidated debt and capitalization terms are not supplied, so each is an atomic Real input."
