{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; is_on_or_after_2012_12_31: true iff the observation date is on or after December 31, 2012 (the commencement date).\n; consolidated_leverage_ratio: Consolidated Leverage Ratio as of the observation date, as a number x meaning x:1.0.\n; consolidated_fccr: Consolidated Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio as of the observation date, as a number x meaning x:1.0.\n; consolidated_tangible_net_worth: Consolidated Tangible Net Worth in US dollars as of the observation date.\n; net_income_quarterly_sum_losses_floored_at_zero: sum, in US dollars, over each full fiscal quarter ending after June 30, 2012 and up to the observation date, of Consolidated Net Income earned in that quarter, counting a quarter with a net loss as 0.\n; equity_issuance_increases: aggregate increases in US dollars in stockholders' equity of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries after the date of the agreement from the issuance and sale of Equity Interests of the Borrower or any Subsidiary, including upon conversion of debt securities of the Borrower into such Equity Interests, excluding issuances to the Borrower or a Wholly Owned Subsidiary.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n                            (is_on_or_after_2012_12_31 Bool)\n                            (consolidated_leverage_ratio Real)\n                            (consolidated_fccr Real)\n                            (consolidated_tangible_net_worth Real)\n                            (net_income_quarterly_sum_losses_floored_at_zero Real)\n                            (equity_issuance_increases Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_on_or_after_2012_12_31)\n      (and\n        ; (a) leverage must not be greater than 2.00:1.0\n        (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 2.0)\n        ; (b) fixed charge coverage must not be less than 1.50:1.0\n        (>= consolidated_fccr 1.5)\n        ; (c) tangible net worth must not be less than the sum of (i), (ii) and (iii)\n        (>= consolidated_tangible_net_worth\n            (+ 156600000.0\n               (* 0.5 net_income_quarterly_sum_losses_floored_at_zero)\n               equity_issuance_increases)))))",
  "symbols": [
