  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; commitments_in_effect: True if the Revolving Credit Commitments remain in effect at the observation time.\n; note_or_loc_outstanding_unpaid: True if any Note or Letter of Credit remains outstanding and unpaid at the observation time.\n; other_amount_owing: True if any other amount is owing to any Lender or the Administrative Agent hereunder or under any other Loan Document at the observation time.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: True if the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter.\n; is_quarter_on_or_after_sep_30_2010: True if the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date is the quarter ending September 30, 2010 or a later quarter.\n; total_leverage_ratio: Total Leverage Ratio as of the observation date, expressed as X in X to 1.00.\n; interest_charge_coverage_ratio: Interest Charge Coverage Ratio as of the observation date, expressed as X in X to 1.00.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((commitments_in_effect Bool) (note_or_loc_outstanding_unpaid Bool) (other_amount_owing Bool) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_quarter_on_or_after_sep_30_2010 Bool) (total_leverage_ratio Real) (interest_charge_coverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and (or commitments_in_effect note_or_loc_outstanding_unpaid other_amount_owing)\n           is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           is_quarter_on_or_after_sep_30_2010)\n      (and (<= total_leverage_ratio 2.25)\n           (>= interest_charge_coverage_ratio 3.5))))",
