{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; makes_unrestricted_sub_investment: true iff at this observation the Company or a Restricted Subsidiary makes a loan, advance, capital contribution or other investment in an Unrestricted Subsidiary.\n; lacks_two_investment_grade_ratings: true iff the Company does not have outstanding Index Debt that is investment grade rated by two of Moody's, S&P and Fitch.\n; leverage_ratio: the Leverage Ratio at this observation (actual, as defined in the agreement), as a ratio to 1.0.\n; pro_forma_leverage_ratio: the Leverage Ratio on a pro forma basis after giving effect to the transaction, as if it had occurred at the beginning of any relevant quarter, as a ratio to 1.0.\n; is_loan_advance_or_other_investment: true iff the transaction is a loan, advance or other investment (not solely a capital contribution), so the arm's length condition (i) applies.\n; arm_length_terms: true iff the transaction is on terms no less favorable to the Company or Restricted Subsidiary than a comparable arm's length transaction with an unaffiliated Person.\n; default_continuing_at_time: true iff a Default or Event of Default has occurred and is continuing at the time of making the transaction.\n; default_would_occur_after_effect: true iff a Default or Event of Default would occur after giving effect to the transaction.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (makes_unrestricted_sub_investment Bool)\n    (lacks_two_investment_grade_ratings Bool)\n    (leverage_ratio Real)\n    (pro_forma_leverage_ratio Real)\n    (is_loan_advance_or_other_investment Bool)\n    (arm_length_terms Bool)\n    (default_continuing_at_time Bool)\n    (default_would_occur_after_effect Bool)\n  ) Bool\n  (=> (and makes_unrestricted_sub_investment\n           lacks_two_investment_grade_ratings\n           (or (> leverage_ratio 5.5) (> pro_forma_leverage_ratio 5.5)))\n      (and (=> is_loan_advance_or_other_investment arm_length_terms)\n           (not default_continuing_at_time)\n           (not default_would_occur_after_effect))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
