      "meaning": "The Leverage Ratio on a pro forma basis after giving effect to the transaction as if it had occurred at the beginning of any relevant quarter, expressed as a ratio to 1.0.",
      "source_quote": "would exceed on a pro forma basis after giving effect to a transaction of the sort referred to in this Section 9.06 as if it had occurred at the beginning of any relevant quarter"
