    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_fixed_charges",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Fixed Charges for the Fiscal Quarter just ended and the immediately preceding 3 Fiscal Quarters.",
      "source_quote": "the ratio of Income Available for Fixed Charges to Consolidated Fixed Charges for the Fiscal Quarter just ended and the immediately preceding 3 Fiscal Quarters"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The ratio is Income Available for Fixed Charges divided by Consolidated Fixed Charges over the trailing 4 Fiscal Quarters. Division by zero is left to the evaluator to report as unresolved. The base test is ratio >= 2.5 ('shall not have been less than 2.5 to 1.0'). The proviso is read as replacing that test with a strict ratio > 2.0 in the CSC Put quarter and the following 3 quarters. This is an interpretation, because the source does not say explicitly that the proviso displaces the 2.5 test. QF_NRA is used because the ratio divides two variables."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; advance_unpaid: true if any Advance remains unpaid at the observation.\n; letter_of_credit_outstanding: true if any Letter of Credit is outstanding at the observation.\n; lender_has_commitment: true if any Lender has any Commitment under the agreement at the observation.\n; is_measurement_date: true if the observation date is the last day of a full fiscal quarter of the Borrower ending after the Effective Date (a Measurement Date).\n; is_first_six_full_quarters: true if the Measurement Date is the last day of one of the first six full fiscal quarters following the Effective Date.\n; consolidated_total_debt: Consolidated Total Debt as of the Measurement Date.\n; consolidated_rental_expense: Consolidated Rental Expense for the four fiscal quarter period ending on the Measurement Date.\n; consolidated_ebitdar: Consolidated EBITDAR for the four fiscal quarter period ending on the Measurement Date.\n; consolidated_interest_expense: Consolidated Interest Expense for the four fiscal quarter period ending on the Measurement Date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((advance_unpaid Bool)\n                            (letter_of_credit_outstanding Bool)\n                            (lender_has_commitment Bool)\n                            (is_measurement_date Bool)\n                            (is_first_six_full_quarters Bool)\n                            (consolidated_total_debt Real)\n                            (consolidated_rental_expense Real)\n                            (consolidated_ebitdar Real)\n                            (consolidated_interest_expense Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and (or advance_unpaid letter_of_credit_outstanding lender_has_commitment)\n           is_measurement_date)\n      (and\n        ; (a) Leverage Ratio: (debt + 6 * rental) / EBITDAR <= 3.75 for first six quarters, else 3.5\n        (<= (/ (+ consolidated_total_debt (* 6.0 consolidated_rental_expense))\n               consolidated_ebitdar)\n            (ite is_first_six_full_quarters 3.75 3.5))\n        ; (b) Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio: EBITDAR / (interest + rental) >= 2.0\n        (>= (/ consolidated_ebitdar\n               (+ consolidated_interest_expense consolidated_rental_expense))\n            2.0))))",
