  "notes": "Holdings must not permit the ratio to be less than the table amount, so compliance is ratio >= threshold. The ratio is (receivables + first-priority inventory - Section 6.02(f)-secured inventory amounts) / Consolidated Funded Indebtedness. QF_NRA is used because the denominator is a variable; division by zero is left to the evaluator as unresolved. The subtraction of Section 6.02(f) amounts is my reading of 'exclusive of'. Quarters before 9/30/05 have no table entry, so no requirement is imposed on them."
