{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; leverage_ratio: The Leverage Ratio of the Company at the observation time, as a ratio to 1.00 (e.g. 2.75 means 2.75 to 1.00). Atomic input because no definition is supplied.\n; commitments_expired_or_terminated: True iff the Commitments have expired or been terminated at the observation time.\n; loans_and_fees_paid_in_full: True iff the principal of and interest on each Loan and all fees payable under the agreement have been paid in full at the observation time.\n; letters_of_credit_expired_or_terminated: True iff all Letters of Credit have expired or been terminated at the observation time.\n; lc_disbursements_reimbursed: True iff all LC Disbursements have been reimbursed by the Borrowers at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((leverage_ratio Real) (commitments_expired_or_terminated Bool) (loans_and_fees_paid_in_full Bool) (letters_of_credit_expired_or_terminated Bool) (lc_disbursements_reimbursed Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (not (and commitments_expired_or_terminated loans_and_fees_paid_in_full letters_of_credit_expired_or_terminated lc_disbursements_reimbursed))\n      (<= leverage_ratio 2.75)))",
