{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; mgmt_fees_accrued_fy: aggregate management fees and similar charges accrued and payable to the Hotel Manager in respect of the Hotels for the AIRCOA fiscal year containing the observation.\n; gross_revenues_fy: Gross Revenues for that same fiscal year.\n; in_compliance_with_section_8_10: true iff the Borrowers are in compliance with Section 8.10 (minimum Debt Service Coverage Ratio) at the observation time.\n; mgmt_fee_paid_by_operating_partnership_now: true iff an Operating Partnership pays any management fee or similar charge to the Hotel Manager at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((mgmt_fees_accrued_fy Real) (gross_revenues_fy Real) (in_compliance_with_section_8_10 Bool) (mgmt_fee_paid_by_operating_partnership_now Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    (<= mgmt_fees_accrued_fy (* 0.04 gross_revenues_fy))\n    (=> (not in_compliance_with_section_8_10) (not mgmt_fee_paid_by_operating_partnership_now))))",
  "symbols": [
