  "notes": "The two ratios are atomic Real inputs because the source supplies no definitions for them. 'Not less than 2.50' becomes >= 2.5 and 'not greater than 5.50' becomes <= 5.5, so the thresholds are inclusive. The covenant term and the applicability of each test are separate Boolean inputs, so the formula holds vacuously when the covenant is not in effect or the test does not apply."
