  ],
  "notes": "The covenant applies while any of the three conditions (Obligations outstanding, a Lender Commitment, or a Letter of Credit outstanding) holds, so they are joined with OR. 'At all times' is encoded pointwise. 'Not less than 1.50 to 1.00' is encoded as ratio >= 1.5, using real division so that a zero Current Liabilities value is reported as unresolved by the evaluator. No positivity assumptions are made. QF_NRA is used because the division has a variable denominator."
