  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; designation_occurs: true if at this observation the Borrower designates any Restricted Subsidiary as an Unrestricted Subsidiary, or any Unrestricted Subsidiary as a Restricted Subsidiary, under Section 6.14.\n; designation_to_unrestricted: true if the designation at this observation is of a Subsidiary as an Unrestricted Subsidiary (not the reverse).\n; default_before_designation: true if a Default has occurred and is continuing immediately before the designation.\n; default_after_designation: true if a Default has occurred and is continuing immediately after the designation.\n; first_priority_net_leverage_pro_forma: Consolidated First Priority Net Leverage Ratio immediately after giving Pro Forma Effect to the designation (ratio x:1.00 as a Real).\n; total_net_leverage_pro_forma: Consolidated Total Net Leverage Ratio immediately after giving Pro Forma Effect to the designation (ratio x:1.00 as a Real).\n; compliance_certificate_delivered: true if the Borrower has delivered to the Administrative Agent a certificate setting forth in reasonable detail the calculations demonstrating compliance with the leverage ratio tests, as a condition precedent to effectiveness of the designation.\n; subsidiary_is_restricted_for_other_debt: true if the Subsidiary is a Restricted Subsidiary for the purpose of the Series A-2 Notes, the ABL Facility or any Junior Financing, as applicable.\n; subsidiary_is_or_owns_infusion_business: true if the Subsidiary constitutes or owns a part of the Infusion Business.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((designation_occurs Bool) (designation_to_unrestricted Bool) (default_before_designation Bool) (default_after_designation Bool) (first_priority_net_leverage_pro_forma Real) (total_net_leverage_pro_forma Real) (compliance_certificate_delivered Bool) (subsidiary_is_restricted_for_other_debt Bool) (subsidiary_is_or_owns_infusion_business Bool)) Bool\n  (=> designation_occurs\n      (and (not default_before_designation)\n           (not default_after_designation)\n           (<= first_priority_net_leverage_pro_forma 4.00)\n           (<= total_net_leverage_pro_forma 5.25)\n           compliance_certificate_delivered\n           (=> designation_to_unrestricted\n               (and (not subsidiary_is_restricted_for_other_debt)\n                    (not subsidiary_is_or_owns_infusion_business))))))",
