{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; credit_exposure_outstanding: true iff any Loan, Unpaid Reimbursement Obligation, Letter of Credit or Note is outstanding at the observation.\n; commitment_obligation_exists: true iff any Bank has any obligation to make any Loans, or the Administrative Agent has any obligation to issue, extend or renew any Letters of Credit, at the observation.\n; is_reference_period_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a Reference Period.\n; reference_period_ends_on_or_after_2000_12_30: true iff the Reference Period ending at this observation ends on or after December 30, 2000.\n; consolidated_operating_cash_flow: Consolidated Operating Cash Flow of the Parent and Borrower for the Reference Period ending at the observation.\n; consolidated_fixed_charges: Consolidated Fixed Charges of the Parent and Borrower for the same Reference Period.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((credit_exposure_outstanding Bool) (commitment_obligation_exists Bool) (is_reference_period_end Bool) (reference_period_ends_on_or_after_2000_12_30 Bool) (consolidated_operating_cash_flow Real) (consolidated_fixed_charges Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and (or credit_exposure_outstanding commitment_obligation_exists)\n           is_reference_period_end\n           reference_period_ends_on_or_after_2000_12_30)\n      (>= (/ consolidated_operating_cash_flow consolidated_fixed_charges) 1.1)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
