  ],
  "notes": "Ratio (a) uses division, so a zero Tangible Net Worth is reported as unresolved by the evaluator. Quarter-end ratio limits are guarded by calendar flags. Working Capital applies at every observation. Budget variance is written as actual <= 1.15 * projected, which avoids a second division and treats an excess of exactly 15% as compliant. Negative budget figures are not assumed away."
