{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Borrower's Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio as of the observation date (atomic Real; no arithmetic definition supplied), expressed as a ratio X in \"X to 1.00\".\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; is_on_or_after_dec_31_2009_quarter: true iff the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date is the quarter ending December 31, 2009 or a later fiscal quarter.\n; bridge_obligations_outstanding: true iff the covenant period is still running at the observation date, i.e. the Bridge Commitments have not both expired or terminated and been followed by payment in full of principal and interest on each Bridge Loan and all fees payable hereunder.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_on_or_after_dec_31_2009_quarter Bool) (bridge_obligations_outstanding Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and bridge_obligations_outstanding is_fiscal_quarter_end is_on_or_after_dec_31_2009_quarter)\n      (not (< fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.35))))",
