  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter (\"at the end of any fiscal quarter\").\n; is_on_or_after_quarter_ended_june_30_1999: true iff the observed fiscal quarter end is the quarter ended June 30, 1999 or a later quarter (\"Beginning with the fiscal quarter ended June 30, 1999\").\n; four_quarter_period_includes_quarter_ended_june_30_1999: true iff the four-fiscal-quarter period used for EBITDA at this observation includes the fiscal quarter ended June 30, 1999, so the proviso exclusion applies.\n; ebitda_four_quarters: EBITDA in dollars for the four prior fiscal quarters ending at this quarter end, as measured before the proviso adjustment. It still reflects the one-time $3,996,000 charge if that charge falls in the period.\n; rent_expense_four_quarters: rent expense in dollars for the same four-fiscal-quarter period.\n; consolidated_fixed_charges_four_quarters: Consolidated Fixed Charges in dollars for the four fiscal quarter period ending on this date.\n; funded_debt_not_in_fixed_charges_principal: principal amount in dollars of Funded Debt not included as part of the calculation of Consolidated Fixed Charges.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (is_on_or_after_quarter_ended_june_30_1999 Bool)\n  (four_quarter_period_includes_quarter_ended_june_30_1999 Bool)\n  (ebitda_four_quarters Real)\n  (rent_expense_four_quarters Real)\n  (consolidated_fixed_charges_four_quarters Real)\n  (funded_debt_not_in_fixed_charges_principal Real)\n) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_on_or_after_quarter_ended_june_30_1999)\n      (>= (/ (+ (ite four_quarter_period_includes_quarter_ended_june_30_1999\n                     (+ ebitda_four_quarters 3996000.0)\n                     ebitda_four_quarters)\n                rent_expense_four_quarters)\n             (+ consolidated_fixed_charges_four_quarters\n                rent_expense_four_quarters\n                (/ funded_debt_not_in_fixed_charges_principal 5.0)))\n          1.30)))",
