  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; obligations_outstanding_unpaid: true iff any of the Obligations are outstanding and unpaid at the observation time.\n; lenders_have_funding_obligation: true iff the Lenders have an obligation to fund Advances at the observation time (whether or not borrowing conditions have been or can be fulfilled).\n; issuing_bank_has_issuance_obligation: true iff any Issuing Bank has an obligation to issue Letters of Credit at the observation time (whether or not issuance conditions have been or can be fulfilled).\n; adjusted_ebitda: Adjusted EBITDA of the Borrower as of the end of the fiscal quarter, in currency units.\n; interest_expense: Interest Expense of the Borrower for the twelve (12) month period ending at the end of that fiscal quarter, in currency units.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n    (obligations_outstanding_unpaid Bool)\n    (lenders_have_funding_obligation Bool)\n    (issuing_bank_has_issuance_obligation Bool)\n    (adjusted_ebitda Real)\n    (interest_expense Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           (or obligations_outstanding_unpaid\n               lenders_have_funding_obligation\n               issuing_bank_has_issuance_obligation))\n      (>= (/ adjusted_ebitda interest_expense) 2.5)))",
