{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; liability_to_equity_ratio: ratio of Maximum Liability to Equity as of the observation date, expressed as a multiple (1.00 means 1.00 to 1.00); the source does not define Maximum Liability or Equity, so the ratio is supplied as an atomic value\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true exactly when the observation date is the close of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((liability_to_equity_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)) Bool\n  (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (<= liability_to_equity_ratio 1.0)))",
