{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; consolidated_leverage_ratio: Consolidated Leverage Ratio of the Borrower as at the observation date, as a single number (2.50 to 1.00 is 2.5).\n; consolidated_capitalization_ratio: Consolidated Capitalization Ratio of the Borrower at the observation time, as a single number (0.55 to 1.00 is 0.55).\n; is_last_day_of_four_quarter_period: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Four-Quarter Period.\n; facility_termination_date_has_occurred: true iff the Facility Termination Date has already occurred at the observation time, so the covenant no longer applies.\n; required_lenders_consented_in_writing: true iff the Required Lenders have consented in writing to the Borrower permitting the relevant ratio breach at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_leverage_ratio Real) (consolidated_capitalization_ratio Real) (is_last_day_of_four_quarter_period Bool) (facility_termination_date_has_occurred Bool) (required_lenders_consented_in_writing Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and (not facility_termination_date_has_occurred) (not required_lenders_consented_in_writing))\n      (and (=> is_last_day_of_four_quarter_period (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 2.5))\n           (<= consolidated_capitalization_ratio 0.55))))",
  "symbols": [
