  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter that ends on or after the Closing Date.\n; revolving_credit_exposure: aggregate Revolving Credit Exposure on the observation date, in US dollars.\n; total_leverage_ratio: Total Leverage Ratio on the observation date, as the number X in \"X to 1.00\".\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (revolving_credit_exposure Real) (total_leverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end (> revolving_credit_exposure 15000000.0))\n      (<= total_leverage_ratio 6.5)))",
