  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; covenant_period_active: Bool, true iff at this observation credit is available under the Agreement or the Bank has not yet been repaid in full.\n; is_fiscal_year_end: Bool, true iff this observation is the end of a fiscal year.\n; net_income_before_taxes: Real, net income from operations and investments, before taxes, for the fiscal year.\n; interest_expense: Real, interest expense for the fiscal year; used in both cash flow and the denominator.\n; depreciation_and_noncash_charges: Real, depreciation, depletion, amortization and other non-cash charges for the fiscal year.\n; capital_lease_payments: Real, lease payments made under capital leases during the fiscal year.\n; long_term_principal_payments: Real, principal payments made on long term liabilities during the fiscal year.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((covenant_period_active Bool)\n                            (is_fiscal_year_end Bool)\n                            (net_income_before_taxes Real)\n                            (interest_expense Real)\n                            (depreciation_and_noncash_charges Real)\n                            (capital_lease_payments Real)\n                            (long_term_principal_payments Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and covenant_period_active is_fiscal_year_end)\n      (>= (/ (+ net_income_before_taxes interest_expense depreciation_and_noncash_charges)\n             (+ capital_lease_payments long_term_principal_payments interest_expense))\n          1.25)))",
