  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fq_ending_dec_31_2007: true iff the observation is as of the fiscal quarter ending December 31, 2007 (clause (a) applies).\n; is_fq_end_on_or_after_mar_31_2008: true iff the observation is as of the end of a fiscal quarter ending on or after March 31, 2008 (clause (b) applies).\n; ebitda_3q: consolidated EBITDA of the Borrower calculated for the three fiscal quarters then ended (the period ending at the observation date).\n; interest_expense_3q: consolidated Interest Expense of the Borrower for the three fiscal quarters then ended.\n; ebitda_4q: consolidated EBITDA of the Borrower calculated for the four fiscal quarters then ended (the period ending at the observation date).\n; interest_expense_4q: consolidated Interest Expense of the Borrower for the four fiscal quarters then ended.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (is_fq_ending_dec_31_2007 Bool)\n  (is_fq_end_on_or_after_mar_31_2008 Bool)\n  (ebitda_3q Real)\n  (interest_expense_3q Real)\n  (ebitda_4q Real)\n  (interest_expense_4q Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> is_fq_ending_dec_31_2007\n        (not (< (/ ebitda_3q interest_expense_3q) 2.5)))\n    (=> is_fq_end_on_or_after_mar_31_2008\n        (not (< (/ ebitda_4q interest_expense_4q) 2.5)))))",
