{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; consolidated_funded_debt: Consolidated Funded Debt of the Borrower (as defined in the Agreement) on the observation date, which is the last day of the Fiscal Quarter.\n; ebitda: EBITDA for the 4 consecutive Fiscal Quarters ending on the observation date. For Subsidiaries acquired during that period, it includes their pre-acquisition EBITDA that GAAP purchase accounting would otherwise exclude.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: True iff the observation date is the end of a Fiscal Quarter.\n; is_on_or_after_oct_31_1997: True iff the observation date is on or after October 31, 1997, so the quarter ending October 31, 1997 or a later quarter.\n; is_on_or_before_jul_31_2000: True iff the observation date is on or before July 31, 2000, so the 4.0 to 1.0 limit applies. False means a later quarterly determination, where the 3.5 to 1.0 limit applies.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_funded_debt Real) (ebitda Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_on_or_after_oct_31_1997 Bool) (is_on_or_before_jul_31_2000 Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_on_or_after_oct_31_1997)\n      (< (/ consolidated_funded_debt ebitda)\n         (ite is_on_or_before_jul_31_2000 4.0 3.5))))",
