  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Company.\n; is_at_or_after_first_test_quarter: true iff the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date is the quarter ended March 31, 2016 or a later quarter.\n; obligations_repaid_in_full: true iff the Obligations have been repaid in full, other than contingent obligations intended to survive termination of the Agreement or the other Credit Facility Documents.\n; commitments_terminated: true iff all Commitments have expired and terminated.\n; written_waiver_in_effect: true iff the Administrative Agent, on behalf of the Lenders, has waived compliance with this covenant in writing, and the waiver covers this observation.\n; total_debt_to_capitalization_ratio: the Company's ratio of Total Debt to Capitalization for the fiscal quarter ended on the observation date, as a pure ratio (1.00 = 1 to 1).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_at_or_after_first_test_quarter Bool) (obligations_repaid_in_full Bool) (commitments_terminated Bool) (written_waiver_in_effect Bool) (total_debt_to_capitalization_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           is_at_or_after_first_test_quarter\n           (not (and obligations_repaid_in_full commitments_terminated))\n           (not written_waiver_in_effect))\n      (<= total_debt_to_capitalization_ratio 0.65)))",
