{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter, i.e. a quarter-end test date within the current fiscal year.\n; commitment_or_obligation_outstanding: true iff any Bank still has any Commitment, or any Loan or other Obligation remains unpaid or unsatisfied.\n; majority_banks_waived_in_writing: true iff the Majority Banks have waived compliance with this covenant in writing for this observation.\n; ebit_and_rents_fytd: consolidated earnings before interest, taxes and Rents of the Company for the current fiscal year to date period ending at the observation date (currency units).\n; interest_expense_and_rents_fytd: Consolidated Interest Expense and Rents of the Company for the same current fiscal year to date period (currency units).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_quarter_end Bool) (commitment_or_obligation_outstanding Bool) (majority_banks_waived_in_writing Bool) (ebit_and_rents_fytd Real) (interest_expense_and_rents_fytd Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_quarter_end commitment_or_obligation_outstanding (not majority_banks_waived_in_writing))\n      (>= (/ ebit_and_rents_fytd interest_expense_and_rents_fytd) 1.5)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "is_quarter_end",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter, i.e. a quarter-end test date within the current fiscal year.",
      "source_quote": "as of each quarter for the current fiscal year to date period"
    },
    {
      "name": "commitment_or_obligation_outstanding",
      "meaning": "True iff any Bank still has any Commitment, or any Loan or other Obligation remains unpaid or unsatisfied.",
      "source_quote": "so long as any Bank shall have any Commitment hereunder, or any Loan or other Obligation shall remain unpaid or unsatisfied"
    },
    {
      "name": "majority_banks_waived_in_writing",
      "meaning": "True iff the Majority Banks have waived compliance with this covenant in writing for this observation.",
      "source_quote": "unless the Majority Banks waive compliance in writing"
    },
    {
      "name": "ebit_and_rents_fytd",
      "meaning": "Consolidated earnings before interest, taxes and Rents of the Company for the current fiscal year to date period ending at the observation date (currency units).",
      "source_quote": "consolidated earnings before interest, taxes and Rents"
    },
    {
      "name": "interest_expense_and_rents_fytd",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Interest Expense and Rents of the Company for the same current fiscal year to date period (currency units).",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated Interest Expense and Rents"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The covenant requires the ratio of (i) to (ii) not to be less than 1.5 to 1, so compliance is ratio >= 1.5. The ratio is left as a division, so a zero denominator is reported as unresolved by the evaluator under the stated policy. Cross-multiplying would change that behavior and would depend on the sign of the denominator, so it is not used. QF_NRA is used because division by a variable is nonlinear. The covenant applies only at quarter-end observations while the Commitment or Obligation condition holds and no written Majority Banks waiver exists. Each observation tests the fiscal-year-to-date period supplied by the evaluator."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Borrower's Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio for the Test Period ending on the observation date (a fiscal quarter end), as a plain Real (1.10:1.00 = 1.1). Its definition is not supplied, so it is atomic.\n; in_tier_1: True iff the Test Period ends on the last day of a fiscal quarter ending in the period commencing the Effective Date to and including September 30, 2002.\n; in_tier_2: True iff the Test Period ends on the last day of a fiscal quarter ending in the period commencing December 31, 2002 to and including September 30, 2003.\n; in_tier_3: True iff the Test Period ends on the last day of a fiscal quarter ending in the period commencing December 31, 2003 to and including September 30, 2004.\n; in_tier_4: True iff the Test Period ends on the last day of a fiscal quarter ending in the period commencing December 31, 2004 to and including September 30, 2005.\n; in_tier_5: True iff the Test Period ends on the fiscal quarter ending December 31, 2005 or on the last day of any later fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (in_tier_1 Bool) (in_tier_2 Bool) (in_tier_3 Bool) (in_tier_4 Bool) (in_tier_5 Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> in_tier_1 (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.1))\n    (=> in_tier_2 (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.2))\n    (=> in_tier_3 (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.3))\n    (=> in_tier_4 (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.4))\n    (=> in_tier_5 (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.5))))",
