{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Company; it is also the end date of the four-consecutive-fiscal-quarter period used for the ratio tests\n; consolidated_total_debt: Consolidated Total Debt as of the observation date (last day of the fiscal quarter)\n; consolidated_ebitda_four_quarters: Consolidated EBITDA for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation date\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation date\n; consolidated_net_worth: Consolidated Net Worth in dollars at the end of the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (consolidated_total_debt Real) (consolidated_ebitda_four_quarters Real) (fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (consolidated_net_worth Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 6.1(a): the ratio must not exceed 2.50\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (<= (/ consolidated_total_debt consolidated_ebitda_four_quarters) 2.50))\n    ; 6.1(b): the ratio must not be less than 1.50\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.50))\n    ; 6.1(c): net worth must not be less than $325,000,000\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (>= consolidated_net_worth 325000000.0))))",
