{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; covenant_in_effect_commitment: some Lender has a Commitment outstanding hereunder.\n; covenant_in_effect_obligation: some Loan or other Obligation (other than Unasserted Obligations) remains unpaid or unsatisfied.\n; covenant_in_effect_letter_of_credit: some Letter of Credit remains outstanding, other than L/C Obligations Cash Collateralized in accordance with the agreement.\n; is_four_quarter_period_end: observation date is the end of a period of four consecutive fiscal quarters of the Borrowers.\n; consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio: Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio for the four-fiscal-quarter period ending at the observation, as a number x for x to 1.00.\n; consolidated_funded_debt_ratio: Consolidated Funded Debt Ratio as of the end of the four-fiscal-quarter period, as a number x for x to 1.00.\n; three_or_fewer_permitted_acquisitions_in_period: three or fewer Permitted Acquisitions were consummated during the four-fiscal-quarter period.\n; permitted_acquisition_consideration_usd: aggregate consideration in USD paid by the acquiring Loan Parties to sellers in connection with those Permitted Acquisitions, including deferred cash payments and assumed liabilities that constitute Indebtedness and are included in the purchase price.\n; borrowers_elected_increase: the Borrowers have elected to increase the maximum Consolidated Funded Debt Ratio to 3.50 to 1.00 under the proviso.\n; observation_in_increase_window: observation date falls in the period beginning on the closing date of the last such Permitted Acquisition and ending on the last day of the fourth fiscal quarter following that closing date, counting the closing-date quarter as the first.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (covenant_in_effect_commitment Bool)\n  (covenant_in_effect_obligation Bool)\n  (covenant_in_effect_letter_of_credit Bool)\n  (is_four_quarter_period_end Bool)\n  (consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio Real)\n  (consolidated_funded_debt_ratio Real)\n  (three_or_fewer_permitted_acquisitions_in_period Bool)\n  (permitted_acquisition_consideration_usd Real)\n  (borrowers_elected_increase Bool)\n  (observation_in_increase_window Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and (or covenant_in_effect_commitment\n               covenant_in_effect_obligation\n               covenant_in_effect_letter_of_credit)\n           is_four_quarter_period_end)\n      (and (>= consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio 3.0)\n           (<= consolidated_funded_debt_ratio\n               (ite (and three_or_fewer_permitted_acquisitions_in_period\n                         (>= permitted_acquisition_consideration_usd 25000000.0)\n                         borrowers_elected_increase\n                         observation_in_increase_window)\n                    3.5\n                    3.0)))))",
