{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; total_liabilities: Borrower's Total Liabilities as of the observation date.\n; subordinated_debt: Borrower's Subordinated Debt as of the observation date. It is subtracted from the numerator and added to the denominator.\n; deferred_revenues: Borrower's Deferred Revenues as of the observation date. It is subtracted in the numerator.\n; tangible_net_worth: Borrower's Tangible Net Worth as of the observation date.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of Borrower.\n; is_quarter_mar_1996_or_jun_1996: true iff the quarter ending on the observation date is the quarter ending March 31, 1996 or June 30, 1996.\n; is_quarter_sep_1996: true iff the quarter ending on the observation date is the quarter ending September 30, 1996.\n; is_quarter_dec_1996_or_mar_1997: true iff the quarter ending on the observation date is the quarter ending December 31, 1996 or March 31, 1997.\n; is_quarter_jun_1997_or_later: true iff the quarter ending on the observation date is the quarter ending June 30, 1997 or any quarter thereafter.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((total_liabilities Real) (subordinated_debt Real) (deferred_revenues Real) (tangible_net_worth Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_quarter_mar_1996_or_jun_1996 Bool) (is_quarter_sep_1996 Bool) (is_quarter_dec_1996_or_mar_1997 Bool) (is_quarter_jun_1997_or_later Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           (or is_quarter_mar_1996_or_jun_1996 is_quarter_sep_1996 is_quarter_dec_1996_or_mar_1997 is_quarter_jun_1997_or_later))\n      (<= (/ (- (- total_liabilities subordinated_debt) deferred_revenues)\n             (+ tangible_net_worth subordinated_debt))\n          (ite is_quarter_mar_1996_or_jun_1996 1.5\n               (ite is_quarter_sep_1996 1.4\n                    (ite is_quarter_dec_1996_or_mar_1997 1.25 1.0))))))",
