  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; effective_date_has_occurred: true iff the observation is from and after the Effective Date.\n; commitment_outstanding: true iff any Bank has any Commitment hereunder at the observation.\n; note_amount_unpaid: true iff any amount payable under any Note remains unpaid at the observation.\n; is_four_quarter_period_end: true iff the observation is the end of a period of four consecutive fiscal quarters, so Section 5.07 is tested.\n; period_ends_before_1995_07_31: true iff that four-fiscal-quarter period ends prior to July 31, 1995. False means it ends on or after July 31, 1995.\n; interest_coverage_ratio_percent: the Interest Coverage Ratio for the four-consecutive-fiscal-quarter period ending at the observation, in percent (300 means 300%).\n; subsidiary_debt_amount_usd: aggregate outstanding Debt of Subsidiaries in US dollars at the observation, excluding Debt secured by a Lien permitted by clause (g) of Section 5.09 and Debt owing to the Borrower or another Subsidiary.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (effective_date_has_occurred Bool)\n  (commitment_outstanding Bool)\n  (note_amount_unpaid Bool)\n  (is_four_quarter_period_end Bool)\n  (period_ends_before_1995_07_31 Bool)\n  (interest_coverage_ratio_percent Real)\n  (subsidiary_debt_amount_usd Real)\n) Bool\n  (=> (and effective_date_has_occurred (or commitment_outstanding note_amount_unpaid))\n      (and\n        (=> is_four_quarter_period_end\n            (>= interest_coverage_ratio_percent (ite period_ends_before_1995_07_31 300.0 350.0)))\n        (<= subsidiary_debt_amount_usd 175000000.0))))",
