{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; total_liabilities_excl_subordinated: Borrower's total liabilities at the observation time, excluding any Subordinated Debt (Real, currency units).\n; tangible_net_worth: Borrower's Tangible Net Worth at the observation time (Real, same currency units).\n; all_obligations_fully_paid: true iff at the observation time the Note, the outstanding Letter of Credit Liabilities and all other obligations and liabilities of Borrower under the Loan Agreement and other Loan Documents are fully paid and satisfied.\n; bank_has_no_further_commitment: true iff at the observation time the Bank has no further commitment to lend under the Loan Agreement.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((total_liabilities_excl_subordinated Real) (tangible_net_worth Real) (all_obligations_fully_paid Bool) (bank_has_no_further_commitment Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (not (and all_obligations_fully_paid bank_has_no_further_commitment))\n      (<= (/ total_liabilities_excl_subordinated tangible_net_worth) 1.5)))",
