{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; covenant_period_active: true iff the observation date is on/after the Effective Date and the termination condition has not yet been met (Commitments not yet expired or terminated, Loan principal/interest and fees payable not yet paid in full, Letters of Credit not yet expired/terminated/cash collateralized, LC Disbursements not yet reimbursed).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter.\n; is_in_or_after_first_full_fiscal_quarter: true iff the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date is the first full fiscal quarter commencing after the Effective Date, or a later fiscal quarter.\n; leverage_ratio: the Leverage Ratio as of the observation date, as a Real number (X in X:1.00). Where fewer than four full fiscal quarters have been completed after the Effective Date, it is computed on annualized amounts from full fiscal quarters commencing and ending after the Effective Date.\n; interest_coverage_ratio: the Interest Coverage Ratio as of the observation date, as a Real number (X in X:1.00), computed on the same annualization basis as leverage_ratio when fewer than four full fiscal quarters have been completed.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((covenant_period_active Bool) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_in_or_after_first_full_fiscal_quarter Bool) (leverage_ratio Real) (interest_coverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and covenant_period_active is_fiscal_quarter_end is_in_or_after_first_full_fiscal_quarter)\n      (and (<= leverage_ratio 3.5)\n           (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.5))))",
