{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; advance_unpaid: true iff at least one Advance remains unpaid at the observation time.\n; lender_has_commitment: true iff at least one Lender has a Commitment hereunder at the observation time.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation time is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Guarantor.\n; consolidated_ebitdar_12m: Consolidated EBITDAR of the Guarantor and its Subsidiaries for the most recently ended period of 12 fiscal months.\n; interest_and_discount_amortization_12m: interest payable on, and amortization of debt discount in respect of, all Debt by the Guarantor and its Subsidiaries during that 12-fiscal-month period.\n; rentals_payable_12m: rentals payable under leases of real, personal or mixed property by the Guarantor and its Subsidiaries during that 12-fiscal-month period.\n; consolidated_defined_debt: Consolidated Defined Debt at the observation time.\n; consolidated_capitalization: Consolidated Capitalization at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (advance_unpaid Bool)\n  (lender_has_commitment Bool)\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (consolidated_ebitdar_12m Real)\n  (interest_and_discount_amortization_12m Real)\n  (rentals_payable_12m Real)\n  (consolidated_defined_debt Real)\n  (consolidated_capitalization Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and (or advance_unpaid lender_has_commitment) is_fiscal_quarter_end)\n      (and\n        ; (a) fixed charge coverage ratio not less than 2.50 : 1.00\n        (>= (/ consolidated_ebitdar_12m (+ interest_and_discount_amortization_12m rentals_payable_12m)) 2.5)\n        ; (b) defined debt to capitalization not greater than 0.68 : 1.00\n        (<= (/ consolidated_defined_debt consolidated_capitalization) 0.68))))",
