{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; total_leverage_ratio: Total Leverage Ratio of Holdings as of the last day of the Testing Period, calculated on a Pro Forma Basis. Consolidated EBITDA includes any Specified Equity Contribution that Parent Borrower directed to be included. Debt is not reduced by the proceeds of such a contribution.\n; is_last_day_of_testing_period: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Testing Period (Testing Periods commence with the one ending June 30, 2013).\n; is_compliance_date: true iff the last day of this Testing Period is also a Compliance Date.\n; is_period_end_jun2013_to_sep2013: true iff the Testing Period ends June 30, 2013 through September 30, 2013 (maximum 5.75).\n; is_period_end_dec2013_to_sep2014: true iff the Testing Period ends December 31, 2013 through September 30, 2014 (maximum 5.50).\n; is_period_end_dec2014_to_sep2015: true iff the Testing Period ends December 31, 2014 through September 30, 2015 (maximum 5.25).\n; is_period_end_dec2015_to_sep2016: true iff the Testing Period ends December 31, 2015 through September 30, 2016 (maximum 5.00).\n; is_period_end_dec2016_and_after: true iff the Testing Period ends December 31, 2016 or thereafter (maximum 4.75).\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (total_leverage_ratio Real)\n  (is_last_day_of_testing_period Bool)\n  (is_compliance_date Bool)\n  (is_period_end_jun2013_to_sep2013 Bool)\n  (is_period_end_dec2013_to_sep2014 Bool)\n  (is_period_end_dec2014_to_sep2015 Bool)\n  (is_period_end_dec2015_to_sep2016 Bool)\n  (is_period_end_dec2016_and_after Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_last_day_of_testing_period is_compliance_date)\n      (and\n        (=> is_period_end_jun2013_to_sep2013 (<= total_leverage_ratio 5.75))\n        (=> is_period_end_dec2013_to_sep2014 (<= total_leverage_ratio 5.5))\n        (=> is_period_end_dec2014_to_sep2015 (<= total_leverage_ratio 5.25))\n        (=> is_period_end_dec2015_to_sep2016 (<= total_leverage_ratio 5.0))\n        (=> is_period_end_dec2016_and_after (<= total_leverage_ratio 4.75)))))",
  "symbols": [
