      "meaning": "Total Leverage Ratio of Holdings as of the last day of the Testing Period, on a Pro Forma Basis. Consolidated EBITDA includes any Specified Equity Contribution that Parent Borrower directed to be included. Debt is not reduced by the proceeds of such a contribution. Treated as an atomic ratio because no arithmetic definition is supplied.",
      "source_quote": "the Total Leverage Ratio as of the last day of a Testing Period"
    },
    {
      "name": "is_last_day_of_testing_period",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is the last day of a Testing Period. Testing Periods commence with the one ending June 30, 2013.",
