    {
      "name": "is_period_end_dec2016_and_after",
      "meaning": "True iff the Testing Period ends December 31, 2016 or thereafter (maximum ratio 4.75 to 1.00).",
      "source_quote": "December 31, 2016 and thereafter 4.75 to 1.00"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Pointwise translation of the Section 7.06 maximum Total Leverage Ratio covenant. The test applies only when the observation is the last day of a Testing Period and is also a Compliance Date. The ratio must be no greater than (<=) the threshold for the applicable period bucket. The evaluator supplies the mutually exclusive bucket flags. The Pro Forma Basis and the Specified Equity Contribution EBITDA treatment are folded into the supplied total_leverage_ratio input. The cure limits are not encoded: at least two quarters without a contribution in each trailing four, a contribution no larger than the amount needed for compliance, and at most five over the term. These depend on contribution history that this pointwise input schema does not carry. The deemed 5.75 requirement for other provisions that need compliance before the covenant applies is also not encoded. The 'Solely with respect to the Initial Revolving Credit Facility' scope is likewise not encoded as a parameter."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter (the measurement date in 9.12(1) and 9.12(2)).\n; is_on_or_after_june_30_2010_quarter: true iff the observation date falls in or after the Fiscal Quarter ending June 30, 2010 (the commencement of the covenant).\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Parent and the consolidated Borrower for the trailing twelve (12) month period ending on the observation date, as a ratio X in X to 1.00, computed per Section 8.1(c).\n; adjusted_ebitda: Adjusted EBITDA of the Parent and the consolidated Borrower for the trailing twelve (12) month period ending on the observation date, in US dollars, computed per Section 8.1(c).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_on_or_after_june_30_2010_quarter Bool) (fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (adjusted_ebitda Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_on_or_after_june_30_2010_quarter)\n      (and (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.05)\n           (>= adjusted_ebitda 10000000.0))))",
