{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; leverage_ratio: the Company's Leverage Ratio at the observation time, as a Real number of X in the ratio X to 1 (0.55 to 1 is 0.55). The source supplies no definition, so it is treated as atomic.\n; observation_on_or_before_1994_09_30: true iff the observation time is on or before September 30, 1994. False means the observation time is after September 30, 1994.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((leverage_ratio Real) (observation_on_or_before_1994_09_30 Bool)) Bool\n  (ite observation_on_or_before_1994_09_30\n       (<= leverage_ratio 0.55)\n       (<= leverage_ratio 0.5)))",
