{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; commitments_expired_or_terminated: true iff the Commitments have expired or terminated at this observation.\n; loans_and_fees_paid_in_full: true iff the principal of and interest on each Loan and all fees payable under the agreement have been paid in full at this observation.\n; interest_coverage_ratio: Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries for the period of four consecutive Fiscal Quarters ending with the most recent Fiscal Quarter (ratio X in X to 1.0).\n; consolidated_leverage_ratio: Consolidated Leverage Ratio of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries as of the last day of the Fiscal Quarter being tested (ratio X in X to 1.0).\n; is_fq_end_april_29_2000: true iff the observation is the last day of the Fiscal Quarter ending April 29, 2000.\n; is_pro_forma_6_04f_determination: true iff the leverage ratio is being used solely to determine compliance on a pro forma basis under Section 6.04(f).\n; is_fq_end_july_29_2000_or_oct_28_2000: true iff the observation is the last day of the Fiscal Quarter ending July 29, 2000 or October 28, 2000.\n; is_fq_end_succeeding_after_oct_28_2000: true iff the observation is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter succeeding the Fiscal Quarter ending October 28, 2000.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_last_day: true iff the observation is the last day of any Fiscal Quarter.\n; consolidated_net_worth: Consolidated Net Worth of the Borrower and its consolidated Subsidiaries as of the observation date, in US dollars.\n; cumulative_net_income_not_reduced_by_losses: in US dollars, the sum of Consolidated Net Income of the Borrower and its Consolidated Subsidiaries for the Fiscal Year ending January 27, 2001 and each Fiscal Year thereafter through the observation. Each Fiscal Year's amount is counted as zero if it is a loss, so losses do not reduce the sum. The sum is 0 if no such Fiscal Year has been included.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (commitments_expired_or_terminated Bool)\n    (loans_and_fees_paid_in_full Bool)\n    (interest_coverage_ratio Real)\n    (consolidated_leverage_ratio Real)\n    (is_fq_end_april_29_2000 Bool)\n    (is_pro_forma_6_04f_determination Bool)\n    (is_fq_end_july_29_2000_or_oct_28_2000 Bool)\n    (is_fq_end_succeeding_after_oct_28_2000 Bool)\n    (is_fiscal_quarter_last_day Bool)\n    (consolidated_net_worth Real)\n    (cumulative_net_income_not_reduced_by_losses Real)\n  ) Bool\n  (=> (not (and commitments_expired_or_terminated loans_and_fees_paid_in_full))\n      (and\n        ;; (a) interest coverage must not be less than 3.0\n        (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.0)\n        ;; (b) leverage must not be greater than the applicable limit\n        (=> is_fq_end_april_29_2000\n            (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio (ite is_pro_forma_6_04f_determination 3.25 3.0)))\n        (=> is_fq_end_july_29_2000_or_oct_28_2000\n            (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 3.25))\n        (=> is_fq_end_succeeding_after_oct_28_2000\n            (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 3.0))\n        ;; (c) net worth must not be less than 125,000,000 plus 50% of cumulative net income\n        (=> is_fiscal_quarter_last_day\n            (>= consolidated_net_worth\n                (+ 125000000.0 (* 0.5 cumulative_net_income_not_reduced_by_losses)))))))",
