{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fccr: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio determined for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation date, as a ratio (x in x to 1.00).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter.\n; funded_debt_to_ebitda: Borrower's Funded Debt to EBITDA ratio at the observation (x in x to 1.00).\n; borrower_elected_higher_level: true iff Borrower has elected the 4.00 to 1.00 level for the Test Period applicable at this observation.\n; election_in_certificate: true iff that election is reflected in the Section 5.01(c) certificate for the fiscal quarter at the end of the applicable Test Period.\n; election_for_capex_or_acquisition_with_prior_notice: true iff the election is made on account of a significant capital investment or Acquisition of which Borrower notified the Administrative Agent in writing prior to making it.\n; election_test_period_count: number of Test Periods after the Effective Date for which the 4.00 to 1.00 election has been used, including the current one.\n; tangible_net_worth: Borrower's Tangible Net Worth on a consolidated basis, in dollars, at the observation.\n; cumulative_positive_net_income: sum in dollars, over each fiscal year starting with the fiscal year that includes the Effective Date, of that year's positive Net Income (a year with non-positive Net Income contributes 0).\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (fccr Real)\n    (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n    (funded_debt_to_ebitda Real)\n    (borrower_elected_higher_level Bool)\n    (election_in_certificate Bool)\n    (election_for_capex_or_acquisition_with_prior_notice Bool)\n    (election_test_period_count Real)\n    (tangible_net_worth Real)\n    (cumulative_positive_net_income Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; (a) FCCR must not be less than 1.25 at each fiscal quarter end\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (>= fccr 1.25))\n    ; (b) Funded Debt to EBITDA at most 3.50, or at most 4.00 if the election conditions hold\n    (or (<= funded_debt_to_ebitda 3.5)\n        (and borrower_elected_higher_level\n             election_in_certificate\n             election_for_capex_or_acquisition_with_prior_notice\n             (<= election_test_period_count 3)\n             (<= funded_debt_to_ebitda 4.0)))\n    ; (c) Tangible Net Worth at least 60,000,000 plus 25% of cumulative positive Net Income\n    (>= tangible_net_worth (+ 60000000.0 (* 0.25 cumulative_positive_net_income)))))",
