  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; in_covenant_period: true iff the observation date is on or after the HQ Purchase Date and on or before the Scheduled Maturity Date.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of one of the Borrowers' fiscal quarters.\n; hq_off_balance_sheet_financed: true iff the HQ Purchase Transaction is financed with off balance sheet financing.\n; hq_on_balance_sheet_financed: true iff the HQ Purchase Transaction is financed with on balance sheet financing.\n; funded_debt: Funded Debt of the Borrowers and their Subsidiaries on a Consolidated basis, measured at the fiscal quarter end.\n; ebitdar_ttm: EBITDAR on a Consolidated basis, measured at the fiscal quarter end on a trailing four-quarter basis.\n; ebitda_ttm: EBITDA on a Consolidated basis, measured at the fiscal quarter end on a trailing four-quarter basis.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((in_covenant_period Bool)\n                            (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n                            (hq_off_balance_sheet_financed Bool)\n                            (hq_on_balance_sheet_financed Bool)\n                            (funded_debt Real)\n                            (ebitdar_ttm Real)\n                            (ebitda_ttm Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and in_covenant_period is_fiscal_quarter_end)\n      (and (=> hq_off_balance_sheet_financed\n               (<= (/ funded_debt ebitdar_ttm) 4.25))\n           (=> hq_on_balance_sheet_financed\n               (<= (/ funded_debt ebitda_ttm) 4.25)))))",
