  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (commitments_or_obligations_outstanding Bool) ; True if at the observation any Lender has a Commitment, any Loan or other Obligation remains unpaid or unsatisfied, or any Letter of Credit remains outstanding.\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) ; True if the observation is the end of a fiscal quarter.\n  (fs_delivery_required_for_quarter Bool) ; True if the Agreement requires the Company to deliver financial statements for the fiscal quarter ending at this observation.\n  (consolidated_leverage_ratio Real) ; Consolidated Leverage Ratio as X in X:1.0, for the twelve month period ending with this fiscal quarter, with any Acquisition in the period treated as if it occurred at the start of the period.\n  (consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio Real) ; Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio as X in X:1.0, for the twelve month period ending with this fiscal quarter.\n) Bool\n  (=> (and commitments_or_obligations_outstanding\n           is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           fs_delivery_required_for_quarter)\n      (and (<= consolidated_leverage_ratio 3.25)\n           (>= consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio 3.00))))",
