  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; obligations_outstanding: true when any of Borrower's Obligations are outstanding at this observation.\n; is_calendar_year_end_in_term: true when this observation is the end of a calendar year that ends during the Term of this Agreement.\n; net_income: Net Income of the Subsidiary Banks, on a consolidated basis, for the calendar year ending at this observation (currency units).\n; average_total_assets: average total assets of the Subsidiary Banks, on a consolidated basis, during that calendar year (currency units).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((obligations_outstanding Bool) (is_calendar_year_end_in_term Bool) (net_income Real) (average_total_assets Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and obligations_outstanding is_calendar_year_end_in_term)\n      (>= (/ net_income average_total_assets) 0.008)))",
