  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of Borrower.\n; any_note_loan_lc_outstanding: true iff any Note, Loan or L/C Obligation is outstanding under the agreement at the observation.\n; any_commitment_available_or_in_use: true iff any Commitment is available to or in use by Borrower under the agreement at the observation.\n; compliance_waived_in_writing: true iff compliance with Section 7.17 for this observation is waived in writing by the Required Banks.\n; recourse_leverage_ratio: Borrower's Recourse Leverage Ratio at the observation (the number x in x to 1.00), supplied as an atomic Real.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (any_note_loan_lc_outstanding Bool) (any_commitment_available_or_in_use Bool) (compliance_waived_in_writing Bool) (recourse_leverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           (or any_note_loan_lc_outstanding any_commitment_available_or_in_use)\n           (not compliance_waived_in_writing))\n      (<= recourse_leverage_ratio 0.65)))",
