{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is a fiscal quarter end of the Borrower.\n; is_on_or_after_effective_date: true iff the observation date is on or after the Effective Date.\n; commitment_termination_date_has_occurred: true iff the Commitment Termination Date has occurred as of the observation.\n; all_obligations_paid_in_full: true iff the Notes have been paid in full and the Borrower has performed all of its other obligations under the Loan Documents as of the observation.\n; interest_coverage: Interest Coverage at the observation, as a ratio where 1.0 = 100% (so 300% = 3.0). Atomic input; its definition is not supplied.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (is_on_or_after_effective_date Bool) (commitment_termination_date_has_occurred Bool) (all_obligations_paid_in_full Bool) (interest_coverage Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           is_on_or_after_effective_date\n           (not (and commitment_termination_date_has_occurred all_obligations_paid_in_full)))\n      (>= interest_coverage 3.0)))",
