  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; consolidated_debt: Consolidated Debt of the Borrower at the observation time.\n; consolidated_total_capitalization: Consolidated Total Capitalization of the Borrower at the observation time.\n; interest_coverage_ratio: Interest Coverage Ratio for the four fiscal quarter period ending at the observation time, expressed as a multiple (2.00 means 2.00 to 1).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation time is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_debt Real) (consolidated_total_capitalization Real) (interest_coverage_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 6.16(a): Consolidated Debt must not exceed 55.0% of Consolidated Total Capitalization\n    (<= consolidated_debt (* 0.55 consolidated_total_capitalization))\n    ; 6.16(b): at each fiscal quarter end, Interest Coverage Ratio must not be less than 2.00 to 1\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.0))))",
