{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Parent (the Leverage Ratio and Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio are determined as of the end of each fiscal quarter).\n; is_quarter_on_or_after_2011_07_30: true iff the fiscal quarter ends on or after July 30, 2011.\n; consolidated_net_indebtedness: Consolidated Net Indebtedness of the Group on a consolidated basis as of the end of the fiscal quarter (numerator of the Leverage Ratio).\n; consolidated_ebitda_ltm: Consolidated EBITDA of the Group on a consolidated basis for the four consecutive fiscal quarters ending with the end of the fiscal quarter (denominator of the Leverage Ratio).\n; consolidated_ebitdar_ltm: Consolidated EBITDAR of the Group on a consolidated basis for the four consecutive fiscal quarters ending with the end of the fiscal quarter (numerator of the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio).\n; consolidated_fixed_charges_ltm: Consolidated Fixed Charges of the Group on a consolidated basis for the four consecutive fiscal quarters ending with the end of the fiscal quarter (denominator of the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n                            (is_quarter_on_or_after_2011_07_30 Bool)\n                            (consolidated_net_indebtedness Real)\n                            (consolidated_ebitda_ltm Real)\n                            (consolidated_ebitdar_ltm Real)\n                            (consolidated_fixed_charges_ltm Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_quarter_on_or_after_2011_07_30)\n      (and\n        ; (a) Leverage Ratio must not be greater than 2.50 to 1.00\n        (<= (/ consolidated_net_indebtedness consolidated_ebitda_ltm) 2.5)\n        ; (b) Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio must not be less than 1.40 to 1.00\n        (>= (/ consolidated_ebitdar_ltm consolidated_fixed_charges_ltm) 1.4))))",
  "symbols": [
