      "meaning": "Consolidated EBITDA of the Group on a consolidated basis for the four consecutive fiscal quarters ending with the end of the fiscal quarter (denominator of the Leverage Ratio).",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated EBITDA for the period of four (4) consecutive fiscal quarters ending with the end of such fiscal quarter"
    },
    {
