{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; covenant_outstanding: true iff any of the indebtedness or credit under the Agreement remains unpaid or outstanding at the observation time.\n; in_period_through_1998: true iff the observation date is from the date of the Agreement through and including December 31, 1998.\n; in_period_1999: true iff the observation date is from January 1, 1999 through and including December 31, 1999.\n; in_period_2000_onward: true iff the observation date is on or after January 1, 2000.\n; real_estate_held_for_development: Real Estate Held for Development of the Company and its Subsidiaries, valued at cost or market.\n; lots_under_development: Lots Under Development, valued at cost or market.\n; developed_lots: Developed Lots, valued at cost or market.\n; land_deposits: Land Deposits, i.e. down payments, deposits or other funds paid under noncancellable, bona fide, arm's length contracts to purchase real property by the Company, valued at cost or market.\n; noncancellable_land_commitments: Noncancellable Land Commitments, i.e. the Company's obligations for the unpaid purchase price of noncancellable contracts to purchase real property, valued at cost or market.\n; net_equity_investment_in_joint_ventures: the Company's net equity investment in Investments in Joint Venture, valued at cost or market.\n; consolidated_tangible_net_worth: Consolidated Tangible Net Worth of the Company and its Subsidiaries (the denominator of the ratio).\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n    (covenant_outstanding Bool)\n    (in_period_through_1998 Bool)\n    (in_period_1999 Bool)\n    (in_period_2000_onward Bool)\n    (real_estate_held_for_development Real)\n    (lots_under_development Real)\n    (developed_lots Real)\n    (land_deposits Real)\n    (noncancellable_land_commitments Real)\n    (net_equity_investment_in_joint_ventures Real)\n    (consolidated_tangible_net_worth Real)) Bool\n  (=> covenant_outstanding\n    (and\n      (=> in_period_through_1998\n        (<= (/ (+ real_estate_held_for_development lots_under_development developed_lots land_deposits noncancellable_land_commitments net_equity_investment_in_joint_ventures) consolidated_tangible_net_worth) 2.00))\n      (=> in_period_1999\n        (<= (/ (+ real_estate_held_for_development lots_under_development developed_lots land_deposits noncancellable_land_commitments net_equity_investment_in_joint_ventures) consolidated_tangible_net_worth) 1.85))\n      (=> in_period_2000_onward\n        (<= (/ (+ real_estate_held_for_development lots_under_development developed_lots land_deposits noncancellable_land_commitments net_equity_investment_in_joint_ventures) consolidated_tangible_net_worth) 1.75)))))",
