  "notes": "Pointwise: at each fiscal quarter end on or after 2013-03-31 while the covenant period is in effect, both the Leverage Ratio must not exceed 3.50 (a value of exactly 3.50 complies) and the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio must not be below 2.00 (a value of exactly 2.00 complies). The two covenants (a) and (b) are conjoined. The ratios are atomic inputs because their definitions are not supplied. The minor wording difference between 'on and after' in (a) and 'on or after' in (b) is treated as the same date condition."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Borrowers as of the observation date (atomic ratio; definition not supplied), expressed as a number x for x to 1.00.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter.\n; availability_event_occurred: true iff an Availability Event has occurred on or before the observation date, i.e. Borrowers had Availability of less than U.S.$35,000,000 for any consecutive five (5) Business Days.\n; is_base_quarter_or_later: true iff the observation date is the last day of the Base Quarter (the most recent Fiscal Quarter for which financial statements were available when the Availability Event occurred) or the last day of a Fiscal Quarter following the Base Quarter.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (availability_event_occurred Bool) (is_base_quarter_or_later Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end availability_event_occurred is_base_quarter_or_later)\n      (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.15)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "fixed_charge_coverage_ratio",
      "meaning": "Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Borrowers as of the observation date (atomic ratio, definition not supplied), expressed as x for x to 1.00.",
      "source_quote": "The Borrowers will not permit the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio as of the last day of any Fiscal Quarter to be less than 1.15 to 1.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "is_fiscal_quarter_end",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter.",
      "source_quote": "as of the last day of any Fiscal Quarter"
    },
    {
      "name": "availability_event_occurred",
      "meaning": "True iff an Availability Event has occurred on or before the observation date, i.e. Borrowers had Availability below U.S.$35,000,000 for any consecutive five Business Days.",
      "source_quote": "Borrowers shall have Availability of less than U.S.$35,000,000 for any consecutive five (5) Business Days"
    },
    {
      "name": "is_base_quarter_or_later",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is the last day of the Base Quarter (most recent Fiscal Quarter with financial statements available when the Availability Event occurred) or of a later Fiscal Quarter.",
      "source_quote": "(y) as of the last day of each Fiscal Quarter following the Base Quarter"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Compliance is required only when it is a fiscal quarter end, an Availability Event has occurred, and the date is the Base Quarter or later. The requirement is FCCR >= 1.15 (not less than 1.15 to 1.00). The five-consecutive-Business-Day Availability test needs history, so it is supplied as an event-state Boolean input with the precise meaning above. There is no division in the formula, so there is no divide-by-zero case."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; ebitda: EBITDA of the Borrower for the four consecutive fiscal quarters taken as a single accounting period ending on the observation date, excluding the EBITDA of any Excluded Subsidiary.\n; interest_expense: Interest Expense of the Borrower for the four consecutive fiscal quarters taken as a single accounting period ending on the observation date, excluding Interest Expense of any Excluded Subsidiary.\n; maintenance_capex: Maintenance Capital Expenditures of the Borrower for the four consecutive fiscal quarters taken as a single accounting period ending on the observation date, excluding Maintenance Capital Expenditures of any Excluded Subsidiary.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (ebitda Real) (interest_expense Real) (maintenance_capex Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end\n      (>= (/ ebitda (+ interest_expense maintenance_capex)) 1.75)))",
