  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; total_debt: Total Debt of F.Y.I. and its Subsidiaries as of the observation date (numerator of the ratio).\n; ebitda_four_quarters: EBITDA of F.Y.I. and its Subsidiaries for the four fiscal quarters ended on the observation date (denominator of the ratio).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of F.Y.I.\n; is_quarter_on_or_after_june_30_1996: true iff the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date is the quarter ended June 30, 1996 or a later quarter.\n; in_period_1: true iff the fiscal quarter end falls from April 1, 1996 through September 30, 1997 (limit 3.25 to 1.00).\n; in_period_2: true iff the fiscal quarter end falls from October 1, 1997 through March 31, 1998 (limit 3.00 to 1.00).\n; in_period_3: true iff the fiscal quarter end falls from April 1, 1998 through March 31, 1999 (limit 2.75 to 1.00).\n; in_period_4: true iff the fiscal quarter end falls from April 1, 1999 through March 31, 2000 (limit 2.25 to 1.00).\n; in_period_5: true iff the fiscal quarter end falls on or after April 1, 2000 (limit 1.75 to 1.00).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((total_debt Real)\n                            (ebitda_four_quarters Real)\n                            (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n                            (is_quarter_on_or_after_june_30_1996 Bool)\n                            (in_period_1 Bool)\n                            (in_period_2 Bool)\n                            (in_period_3 Bool)\n                            (in_period_4 Bool)\n                            (in_period_5 Bool)) Bool\n  (let ((applies (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_quarter_on_or_after_june_30_1996)))\n    (and\n      (=> (and applies in_period_1) (not (> (/ total_debt ebitda_four_quarters) 3.25)))\n      (=> (and applies in_period_2) (not (> (/ total_debt ebitda_four_quarters) 3.0)))\n      (=> (and applies in_period_3) (not (> (/ total_debt ebitda_four_quarters) 2.75)))\n      (=> (and applies in_period_4) (not (> (/ total_debt ebitda_four_quarters) 2.25)))\n      (=> (and applies in_period_5) (not (> (/ total_debt ebitda_four_quarters) 1.75))))))",
