  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; interest_coverage_ratio: Company's Interest Coverage Ratio at the observation time, as a ratio X in X to 1.00 (atomic input; definition not supplied).\n; revolving_commitments_expired_or_terminated: true iff the Revolving Commitments have expired or terminated at the observation time.\n; loans_and_fees_paid_in_full: true iff the principal of and interest on each Loan and all fees payable under the agreement have been paid in full at the observation time.\n; letters_of_credit_expired_or_terminated: true iff all Letters of Credit have expired or terminated at the observation time.\n; lc_disbursements_reimbursed: true iff all LC Disbursements have been reimbursed at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((interest_coverage_ratio Real) (revolving_commitments_expired_or_terminated Bool) (loans_and_fees_paid_in_full Bool) (letters_of_credit_expired_or_terminated Bool) (lc_disbursements_reimbursed Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (not (and revolving_commitments_expired_or_terminated loans_and_fees_paid_in_full letters_of_credit_expired_or_terminated lc_disbursements_reimbursed))\n      (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.00)))",
