{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of Borrower.\n; is_on_or_after_march_31_2000: true iff the observation date is on or after March 31, 2000 (the start date of the covenant).\n; total_liabilities: Borrower's Total Liabilities as of the observation date.\n; subordinated_debt: Borrower's Subordinated Debt as of the observation date, subtracted from Total Liabilities.\n; deferred_revenue: Borrower's deferred revenue as of the observation date, subtracted from Total Liabilities.\n; effective_tangible_net_worth: Borrower's Effective Tangible Net Worth as of the observation date (the ratio denominator).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter Bool) (is_on_or_after_march_31_2000 Bool) (total_liabilities Real) (subordinated_debt Real) (deferred_revenue Real) (effective_tangible_net_worth Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_on_or_after_march_31_2000 is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter)\n      (<= (/ (- (- total_liabilities subordinated_debt) deferred_revenue) effective_tangible_net_worth) 2.5)))",
