  "notes": "The covenant applies only when both the quarter-end flag and the on-or-after-March-31-2000 flag are true. The tested ratio is (Total Liabilities - Subordinated Debt - deferred revenue) / Effective Tangible Net Worth, which must be at most 2.50 (\"not more than 2.50 to 1.00\", so non-strict <=). Division by zero is left to the evaluator to report as unresolved, and no sign assumptions are made. The terms Total Liabilities, Subordinated Debt and Effective Tangible Net Worth are not defined in the supplied text, so they remain atomic Real inputs. QF_NRA is used because the division is by a variable."
