  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio: Consolidated Interest Coverage Ratio for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters (or, if fewer, the full fiscal quarters after the Closing Date) ending on the observed date; 2.00 to 1.00 is 2.0\n; is_icr_test_date: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower that ends such a four-quarter (or shorter, if fewer full quarters since the Closing Date) period\n; test_quarter_closing_date_to_2004_12_31: true iff the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date falls in the 'Closing Date - 12/31/04' row\n; test_quarter_on_or_after_2005_01_01: true iff the fiscal quarter ending on the observation date falls in the '01/01/05 and thereafter' row\n; consolidated_debt_to_capital_ratio: Consolidated Debt to Capital Ratio at the observation time; 0.70 to 1.00 is 0.70\n; obs_on_or_before_2005_03_31: true iff the observation time is on or prior to March 31, 2005\n; obs_on_or_after_2005_04_01: true iff the observation time is on April 1, 2005 or thereafter\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio Real)\n                            (is_icr_test_date Bool)\n                            (test_quarter_closing_date_to_2004_12_31 Bool)\n                            (test_quarter_on_or_after_2005_01_01 Bool)\n                            (consolidated_debt_to_capital_ratio Real)\n                            (obs_on_or_before_2005_03_31 Bool)\n                            (obs_on_or_after_2005_04_01 Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 6.1(a): ratio must not be less than the minimum\n    (=> (and is_icr_test_date test_quarter_closing_date_to_2004_12_31)\n        (>= consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio 2.0))\n    (=> (and is_icr_test_date test_quarter_on_or_after_2005_01_01)\n        (>= consolidated_interest_coverage_ratio 2.5))\n    ; 6.1(b): ratio must not be greater than the maximum\n    (=> obs_on_or_before_2005_03_31\n        (<= consolidated_debt_to_capital_ratio 0.70))\n    (=> obs_on_or_after_2005_04_01\n        (<= consolidated_debt_to_capital_ratio 0.65))))",
