  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; commitment_in_effect: true iff the Commitment remains in effect at the observation time.\n; debt_paid_in_full: true iff all of the Debt has been paid in full at the observation time.\n; leverage_ratio: the Leverage Ratio at the observation time, as a plain ratio (0.50 to 1.00 is 0.5). Atomic because no definition is supplied.\n; interest_coverage_ratio: the Interest Coverage Ratio at the observation time, as a plain ratio (3.00 to 1.00 is 3.0). Atomic because no definition is supplied.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((commitment_in_effect Bool) (debt_paid_in_full Bool) (leverage_ratio Real) (interest_coverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (or commitment_in_effect (not debt_paid_in_full))\n      (and (<= leverage_ratio 0.5)\n           (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.0))))",
