{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; total_indebtedness_excl_hybrids: Total Indebtedness at the observation time in USD, computed with quarterly income preferred securities, quarterly income capital securities, monthly income preferred securities and other similar securities excluded (they are treated as Total Capital, not Total Indebtedness).\n; total_capital_before_goodwill_addback: Total Capital at the observation time in USD, with those hybrid securities included and goodwill impairment charges not yet disregarded (i.e. as reduced by those charges).\n; cumulative_goodwill_impairment_charges: aggregate goodwill impairment charges taken pursuant to FASB ASC 350 (or any predecessor), cumulative up to the observation time, in USD.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((total_indebtedness_excl_hybrids Real) (total_capital_before_goodwill_addback Real) (cumulative_goodwill_impairment_charges Real)) Bool\n  (<= (/ total_indebtedness_excl_hybrids\n         (+ total_capital_before_goodwill_addback\n            (ite (<= cumulative_goodwill_impairment_charges 750000000.0)\n                 cumulative_goodwill_impairment_charges\n                 750000000.0)))\n      0.60))",
