{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_quarter_end: true exactly when the observation date is the last day of a quarter.\n; unrestricted_cash_and_equivalents: Borrower's unrestricted cash and cash equivalents (currency units).\n; marketable_securities: Borrower's short-term plus long-term marketable securities (currency units).\n; accounts: Borrower's Accounts (the defined term in the quick ratio numerator), in currency units.\n; current_liabilities_excl_deferred_revenue: Current Liabilities excluding Deferred Revenue (currency units).\n; tangible_net_worth: Borrower's Tangible Net Worth in dollars, before any restatement add-back.\n; quarterly_net_income: Borrower's net income for the quarter in dollars; may be negative or zero.\n; restatement_noncash_charges: non-cash charges in dollars related to the restatement of financial statements for fiscal years 2002, 2003 and 2004. The formula caps the add-back at 4,000,000.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (is_quarter_end Bool)\n  (unrestricted_cash_and_equivalents Real)\n  (marketable_securities Real)\n  (accounts Real)\n  (current_liabilities_excl_deferred_revenue Real)\n  (tangible_net_worth Real)\n  (quarterly_net_income Real)\n  (restatement_noncash_charges Real)\n) Bool\n  (=> is_quarter_end\n    (and\n      ; (a) Adjusted Quick Ratio of at least 1.00 to 1.00\n      (>= (/ (+ unrestricted_cash_and_equivalents marketable_securities accounts)\n             current_liabilities_excl_deferred_revenue)\n          1.0)\n      ; (b) TNW (plus capped add-back) of at least 50,000,000 plus 50% of quarterly positive net income\n      (>= (+ tangible_net_worth\n             (ite (<= restatement_noncash_charges 4000000.0) restatement_noncash_charges 4000000.0))\n          (+ 50000000.0\n             (* 0.5 (ite (> quarterly_net_income 0.0) quarterly_net_income 0.0)))))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "is_quarter_end",
      "meaning": "True exactly when the observation date is the last day of a quarter.",
      "source_quote": "as of the last day of each quarter"
    },
    {
      "name": "unrestricted_cash_and_equivalents",
      "meaning": "Borrower's unrestricted cash and cash equivalents, in currency units.",
