{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; obligations_outstanding: true at the observation time if the covenant period has not ended, i.e. any of these holds: Commitments have not expired or terminated; principal/interest on any Loan, fees payable, or other amounts under the Loan Documents (other than contingent indemnification obligations) are unpaid; any Letter of Credit has not expired or terminated; any LC Disbursement is unreimbursed.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true if the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; leverage_ratio: the Borrower's Leverage Ratio at the observation time, expressed as a number x for x to 1.0.\n; current_assets: Borrower's consolidated current assets at the observation date, including the unused amount of the total Commitments and excluding non-cash assets under FAS 133.\n; current_liabilities: Borrower's consolidated current liabilities at the observation date, excluding non-cash obligations under FAS 133 and current maturities under this Agreement.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((obligations_outstanding Bool) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (leverage_ratio Real) (current_assets Real) (current_liabilities Real)) Bool\n  (=> obligations_outstanding\n      (and (<= leverage_ratio 3.5)\n           (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end\n               (>= (/ current_assets current_liabilities) 1.0)))))",
