th\n                (+ 20000000.0\n                   (* 0.5 cumulative_net_income)\n                   (* 0.5 equity_proceeds_capital_contributions))))\n        ; 6.2(a)(3): Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio must not be less than 1.0:1.0\n        (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end_on_or_after_1999_12_31\n            (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.0)))))",
