  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; operating_cash_flow: Borrower's Operating Cash Flow for the test period ending at this observation (the period set forth in the schedule).\n; capital_expenditures: Capital Expenditures for the same test period (first term of the denominator sum).\n; debt_service: Debt Service with respect to Borrower's Obligations for the same test period, on an accrual basis for the first four periods (Mar 31, Jun 30, Sep 30 and Dec 31, 1997 test periods).\n; income_taxes_paid: income taxes paid for the same test period, excluding income taxes attributable to extraordinary gains.\n; is_period_threshold_1_10: true iff the observation is a test-period end listed in the schedule with amount 1.10 (periods ended Mar 31, 1997 through Dec 31, 1998).\n; is_period_threshold_1_05: true iff the observation is a test-period end listed in the schedule with amount 1.05 (periods ended Mar 31, 1999 through Dec 31, 2001).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((operating_cash_flow Real) (capital_expenditures Real) (debt_service Real) (income_taxes_paid Real) (is_period_threshold_1_10 Bool) (is_period_threshold_1_05 Bool)) Bool\n  (ite is_period_threshold_1_10\n       (ite is_period_threshold_1_05\n            (and (>= (/ operating_cash_flow (+ capital_expenditures debt_service income_taxes_paid)) 1.10)\n                 (>= (/ operating_cash_flow (+ capital_expenditures debt_service income_taxes_paid)) 1.05))\n            (>= (/ operating_cash_flow (+ capital_expenditures debt_service income_taxes_paid)) 1.10))\n       (ite is_period_threshold_1_05\n            (>= (/ operating_cash_flow (+ capital_expenditures debt_service income_taxes_paid)) 1.05)\n            true)))",
