{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter of the Borrower.\n; long_term_debt: Long Term Debt of the Borrower as at the observation date (last day of the Fiscal Quarter), in dollars.\n; ebitda_four_quarters: EBITDA of the Borrower for the four consecutive Fiscal Quarters ending on the observation date, in dollars.\n; debt_to_capital_ratio: ratio of Debt to Capital of the Borrower at the observation time (atomic; its arithmetic definition is not supplied).\n; tangible_net_worth: Tangible Net Worth of the Borrower at the observation time, in dollars.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (long_term_debt Real) (ebitda_four_quarters Real) (debt_to_capital_ratio Real) (tangible_net_worth Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 11.01(e) Long Term Debt to EBITDA <= 3.5 to 1, tested at each Fiscal Quarter end\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (<= (/ long_term_debt ebitda_four_quarters) 3.5))\n    ; 11.01(f) Debt to Capital <= 0.55 to 1, at all times (pointwise)\n    (<= debt_to_capital_ratio 0.55)\n    ; 11.01(g) Tangible Net Worth >= $1,250,000,000, at all times (pointwise)\n    (>= tangible_net_worth 1250000000.0)))",
