  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Company.\n; any_advance_unpaid: true iff any Advance remains unpaid at the observation time.\n; any_lender_has_commitment: true iff any Lender has any Commitment under the agreement at the observation time.\n; pre_tax_income_continuing_ops_4q: Pre-Tax Income from Continuing Operations for the four fiscal quarters then ended (the four quarters ending at the observation date), in the agreement's currency.\n; consolidated_interest_expense_4q: Consolidated Interest Expense for the same four fiscal quarters, in the agreement's currency.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (any_advance_unpaid Bool) (any_lender_has_commitment Bool) (pre_tax_income_continuing_ops_4q Real) (consolidated_interest_expense_4q Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end (or any_advance_unpaid any_lender_has_commitment))\n      (>= (/ pre_tax_income_continuing_ops_4q consolidated_interest_expense_4q) 2.0)))",
