{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; consolidated_funded_indebtedness: Consolidated Funded Indebtedness of the Borrower as of the observed fiscal quarter end (numerator of the Leverage Ratio).\n; consolidated_ebitda_ltm: Consolidated EBITDA for the then most-recently ended four fiscal quarters (denominator of the Leverage Ratio).\n; is_initial_tier_test_date: True iff the observation is as of the Closing Date or the end of a fiscal quarter ending June 30, 2007, September 30, 2007, December 31, 2007 or March 31, 2008 (3.75 to 1.00 tier).\n; is_later_fiscal_quarter_end: True iff the observation is as of the end of a fiscal quarter thereafter, i.e. after March 31, 2008 (3.50 to 1.00 tier).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_funded_indebtedness Real) (consolidated_ebitda_ltm Real) (is_initial_tier_test_date Bool) (is_later_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> is_initial_tier_test_date (<= (/ consolidated_funded_indebtedness consolidated_ebitda_ltm) 3.75))\n    (=> is_later_fiscal_quarter_end (<= (/ consolidated_funded_indebtedness consolidated_ebitda_ltm) 3.5))))",
