{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; adjusted_total_leverage_ratio: Adjusted Total Leverage Ratio at the observation, calculated on a Pro Forma Basis (including pro forma effect of any Permitted Acquisition consummated), as a plain number (5.50:1.0 = 5.5).\n; is_fq_5_50: True iff the observation is the last day of a fiscal quarter ended closest to Sept 30, 1999, Dec 31, 1999, Mar 31, 2000, Jun 30, 2000, Sep 30, 2000 or Dec 31, 2000 (maximum ratio 5.50:1.0).\n; is_fq_5_25: True iff the observation is the last day of a fiscal quarter ended closest to Mar 31, 2001, Jun 30, 2001, Sep 30, 2001 or Dec 31, 2001 (maximum ratio 5.25:1.0).\n; is_fq_5_00: True iff the observation is the last day of a fiscal quarter ended closest to Mar 31, 2002, Jun 30, 2002, Sep 30, 2002 or Dec 31, 2002 (maximum ratio 5.00:1.0).\n; is_fq_4_75: True iff the observation is the last day of a fiscal quarter ended closest to Mar 31, 2003, Jun 30, 2003, Sep 30, 2003 or Dec 31, 2003 (maximum ratio 4.75:1.0).\n; is_fq_4_50: True iff the observation is the last day of a fiscal quarter ended closest to any of Mar 31, 2004 through Mar 31, 2006 listed in the table (maximum ratio 4.50:1.0).\n; is_permitted_acquisition_consummation: True iff the observation is upon the consummation of, and after giving Pro Forma effect to, a Permitted Acquisition.\n; max_permitted_acquisition_leverage_ratio: the Maximum Permitted Acquisition Leverage Ratio as a plain number.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((adjusted_total_leverage_ratio Real)\n                            (is_fq_5_50 Bool)\n                            (is_fq_5_25 Bool)\n                            (is_fq_5_00 Bool)\n                            (is_fq_4_75 Bool)\n                            (is_fq_4_50 Bool)\n                            (is_permitted_acquisition_consummation Bool)\n                            (max_permitted_acquisition_leverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> is_fq_5_50 (<= adjusted_total_leverage_ratio 5.5))\n    (=> is_fq_5_25 (<= adjusted_total_leverage_ratio 5.25))\n    (=> is_fq_5_00 (<= adjusted_total_leverage_ratio 5.0))\n    (=> is_fq_4_75 (<= adjusted_total_leverage_ratio 4.75))\n    (=> is_fq_4_50 (<= adjusted_total_leverage_ratio 4.5))\n    (=> is_permitted_acquisition_consummation\n        (<= adjusted_total_leverage_ratio max_permitted_acquisition_leverage_ratio))))",
