{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; lender_commitment_exists: true iff any Lender has any Commitment outstanding at the observation time.\n; loan_obligation_unpaid: true iff any Loan or other Obligation remains unpaid or unsatisfied at the observation time.\n; letter_of_credit_outstanding: true iff any Letter of Credit remains outstanding at the observation time.\n; covenant_compliance_event_continuing: true iff a Covenant Compliance Event is continuing at the observation time.\n; is_last_day_of_month: true iff the observation date is the last day of a calendar month.\n; fccr: Consolidated Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio (as a ratio, 1.1:1.0 = 1.1) calculated as of the observation date for the Measurement Period.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (lender_commitment_exists Bool)\n  (loan_obligation_unpaid Bool)\n  (letter_of_credit_outstanding Bool)\n  (covenant_compliance_event_continuing Bool)\n  (is_last_day_of_month Bool)\n  (fccr Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and (or lender_commitment_exists loan_obligation_unpaid letter_of_credit_outstanding)\n           covenant_compliance_event_continuing\n           is_last_day_of_month)\n      (>= fccr 1.1)))",
