{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff this observation is as of the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; total_funded_debt: Total Funded Debt of the Borrower at the observation time (last day of the fiscal quarter), in currency units.\n; ebitda_four_quarters: EBITDA of the Borrower for the four fiscal quarters then ended, in currency units.\n; interest_coverage_ratio: the Interest Coverage Ratio at the observation time (last day of the fiscal quarter), as a ratio X in X to 1.00.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (total_funded_debt Real) (ebitda_four_quarters Real) (interest_coverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end\n      (and (<= (/ total_funded_debt ebitda_four_quarters) 3.25)\n           (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.5))))",
