  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; any_loan_unpaid: True at the observation time if any Loan remains unpaid.\n; other_obligation_unpaid_or_unperformed: True at the observation time if any other Obligation remains unpaid or unperformed.\n; commitments_in_force: True at the observation time if any portion of the Commitments remains in force.\n; leverage_ratio: The Leverage Ratio at the observation time, as a number X meaning X to 1.00. It is an atomic input because its definition is not supplied.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((any_loan_unpaid Bool) (other_obligation_unpaid_or_unperformed Bool) (commitments_in_force Bool) (leverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (or any_loan_unpaid other_obligation_unpaid_or_unperformed commitments_in_force)\n      (not (> leverage_ratio 3.25))))",
