  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; interest_expense_coverage_ratio: Interest Expense Coverage Ratio (defined term, definition not supplied, so atomic), expressed as a multiple X in X to 1.00, for the period of four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation date.\n; is_last_day_of_four_quarter_period: true iff the observation date is the last day of a period of four consecutive fiscal quarters.\n; is_after_closing_date: true iff the observation date (the end of that four-quarter period) falls after the Closing Date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((interest_expense_coverage_ratio Real) (is_last_day_of_four_quarter_period Bool) (is_after_closing_date Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_last_day_of_four_quarter_period is_after_closing_date)\n      (>= interest_expense_coverage_ratio 3.0)))",
