{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter (Section 5.8(f)).\n; indebtedness_total: Indebtedness of the Borrower and EQR (incl. Down REITs and their wholly-owned Subsidiaries; excl. other Consolidated Subsidiaries/Investment Affiliates) plus Borrower's Share of Indebtedness of Consolidated Subsidiaries and Investment Affiliates (other than Down REITs and their wholly-owned Subsidiaries); before the 5.8(a) adjustment.\n; maturing_indebtedness_24m: Indebtedness that by its terms is scheduled to mature on or before the date 24 months after the calculation date.\n; unrestricted_cash: Unrestricted Cash or Cash Equivalents at the calculation date.\n; gross_asset_value: Gross Asset Value of the Borrower and EQR, before the 5.8(a) adjustment.\n; acquisition_relief_elected: true iff the Borrower has elected the acquisition-based higher leverage limit under 5.8(a).\n; in_acquisition_relief_window: true iff the observation quarter is a Fiscal Quarter in which the Borrower acquired Real Property Assets (purchase, merger or other corporate transaction), or one of the next three succeeding Fiscal Quarters.\n; secured_debt_total: Secured Debt of the Borrower and EQR (incl. Down REITs and their wholly-owned Subsidiaries; excl. other Consolidated Subsidiaries/Investment Affiliates) plus Borrower's Share of Secured Debt of Consolidated Subsidiaries and Investment Affiliates (other than Down REITs and their wholly-owned Subsidiaries).\n; consolidated_ebitda_ttm: Consolidated EBITDA for the most recently completed 12-month period.\n; fixed_charges_ttm: Fixed Charges for the most recently completed 12-month period.\n; unencumbered_asset_value: Unencumbered Asset Value.\n; unsecured_debt: outstanding Unsecured Debt.\n; permitted_holdings_value: aggregate value of Permitted Holdings, held directly or indirectly, without duplication, by the Borrower, EQR and/or their Subsidiaries.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (indebtedness_total Real)\n  (maturing_indebtedness_24m Real)\n  (unrestricted_cash Real)\n  (gross_asset_value Real)\n  (acquisition_relief_elected Bool)\n  (in_acquisition_relief_window Bool)\n  (secured_debt_total Real)\n  (consolidated_ebitda_ttm Real)\n  (fixed_charges_ttm Real)\n  (unencumbered_asset_value Real)\n  (unsecured_debt Real)\n  (permitted_holdings_value Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end\n    (and\n      ; (a) adjusted Indebtedness / adjusted GAV <= 0.60, or <= 0.65 under the elected acquisition relief; adjustment = lesser of maturing Indebtedness and Unrestricted Cash, deducted from both\n      (<= (/ (- indebtedness_total (ite (<= maturing_indebtedness_24m unrestricted_cash) maturing_indebtedness_24m unrestricted_cash))\n             (- gross_asset_value (ite (<= maturing_indebtedness_24m unrestricted_cash) maturing_indebtedness_24m unrestricted_cash)))\n          (ite (and acquisition_relief_elected in_acquisition_relief_window) 0.65 0.60))\n      ; (b) Secured Debt / GAV <= 0.40\n      (<= (/ secured_debt_total gross_asset_value) 0.40)\n      ; (c) Consolidated EBITDA / Fixed Charges >= 1.50\n      (>= (/ consolidated_ebitda_ttm fixed_charges_ttm) 1.50)\n      ; (d) Unencumbered Asset Value / Unsecured Debt >= 1.50\n      (>= (/ unencumbered_asset_value unsecured_debt) 1.50)\n      ; (e) Permitted Holdings <= 35% of GAV\n      (<= permitted_holdings_value (* 0.35 gross_asset_value)))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "is_fiscal_quarter_end",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter, when the ratios and financial requirements are calculated.",
