      "source_quote": "Indebtedness of the Borrower and EQR (including Indebtedness of Down REITs and wholly-owned Subsidiaries of Down REITs, but excluding Indebtedness of other Persons that are Consolidated Subsidiaries or Investment Affiliates)"
    },
