  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_closing_date: true iff this observation is the Closing Date.\n; revolving_credit_loans_drawn_on_closing_date: aggregate principal amount of Revolving Credit Loans drawn on the Closing Date, in US dollars.\n; proceeds_used_for_permitted_purposes: true iff the proceeds of the Credit Extensions are used for general corporate purposes not in contravention of any Law or of any Loan Document.\n; revolving_loans_used_for_permitted_acquisition_after_closing: true iff, following the Closing Date, the Borrower uses Revolving Credit Loans to consummate a Permitted Acquisition at this observation.\n; availability_after_permitted_acquisition: availability under the Revolving Credit Facility immediately following the Permitted Acquisition, in US dollars.\n; first_lien_secured_leverage_ratio_pro_forma: Borrower's First Lien Secured Leverage Ratio immediately following the Permitted Acquisition, on a Pro Forma Basis, as a multiple (x to 1.00).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_closing_date Bool)\n                            (revolving_credit_loans_drawn_on_closing_date Real)\n                            (proceeds_used_for_permitted_purposes Bool)\n                            (revolving_loans_used_for_permitted_acquisition_after_closing Bool)\n                            (availability_after_permitted_acquisition Real)\n                            (first_lien_secured_leverage_ratio_pro_forma Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    proceeds_used_for_permitted_purposes\n    (=> is_closing_date (<= revolving_credit_loans_drawn_on_closing_date 25000000.0))\n    (=> revolving_loans_used_for_permitted_acquisition_after_closing\n        (and (>= availability_after_permitted_acquisition 100000000.0)\n             (< first_lien_secured_leverage_ratio_pro_forma 4.75)))))",
