  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_month_end: true iff the observation is as of the end of a fiscal month of Holdings (debt/capitalization measured from the internal fiscal month-end consolidated balance sheet).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation is at the end of a fiscal quarter of Holdings (measured from the consolidated financial statements delivered under Section 5.1).\n; consolidated_total_debt: Consolidated Total Debt of Holdings and its Group Members at the observation date, in currency units.\n; total_capitalization: Total Capitalization at the observation date, in the same currency units.\n; consolidated_net_worth: Consolidated Net Worth at the observation time (any time), in currency units.\n; net_worth_june_30_2004: Consolidated Net Worth as of June 30, 2004, in currency units.\n; cumulative_positive_quarterly_net_income: sum over fiscal quarters of Holdings ending after June 30, 2004 of each quarter's positive consolidated net income (loss quarters contribute 0), as of the observation time, in currency units.\n; equity_issuance_net_proceeds_after_june_30_2004: cumulative Net Proceeds from all Equity Issuances of any Group Member occurring after June 30, 2004, as of the observation time, in currency units.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (is_fiscal_month_end Bool)\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (consolidated_total_debt Real)\n  (total_capitalization Real)\n  (consolidated_net_worth Real)\n  (net_worth_june_30_2004 Real)\n  (cumulative_positive_quarterly_net_income Real)\n  (equity_issuance_net_proceeds_after_june_30_2004 Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; 6.1(a): ratio of debt to total capitalization must not be greater than 0.70:1.00 at fiscal month-end or fiscal quarter-end\n    (=> (or is_fiscal_month_end is_fiscal_quarter_end)\n        (<= (/ consolidated_total_debt total_capitalization) 0.70))\n    ; 6.1(b): net worth at any time must not be less than the required floor\n    (>= consolidated_net_worth\n        (+ (* 0.75 net_worth_june_30_2004)\n           (* 0.25 cumulative_positive_quarterly_net_income)\n           (* 0.75 equity_issuance_net_proceeds_after_june_30_2004)))))",
