  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; consolidated_fixed_charges_coverage_ratio: Consolidated Fixed Charges Coverage Ratio for the period of four consecutive Fiscal Quarters most recently ended as of the observation date (atomic Real; the source supplies no arithmetic definition; ratio X to 1.00 is given as X).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a Fiscal Quarter.\n; revolving_credit_commitment_in_effect: true iff the Revolving Credit Commitment is in effect under the Agreement at the observation time.\n; amount_payable_unpaid: true iff any amount payable under the Agreement or any other Loan Document remains unpaid at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_fixed_charges_coverage_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (revolving_credit_commitment_in_effect Bool) (amount_payable_unpaid Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end (or revolving_credit_commitment_in_effect amount_payable_unpaid))\n      (not (< consolidated_fixed_charges_coverage_ratio 1.6))))",
