  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_test_date: True iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter that ends after the Effective Date.\n; unsold_land: Value of Unsold Land of the Borrower and its Restricted Subsidiaries, determined in conformity with GAAP, as of the observation date (currency units).\n; adjusted_consolidated_tangible_net_worth: Adjusted Consolidated Tangible Net Worth as of the observation date (same currency units).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_test_date Bool) (unsold_land Real) (adjusted_consolidated_tangible_net_worth Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_test_date (<= (/ unsold_land adjusted_consolidated_tangible_net_worth) 1.5)))",
