{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_funding_date: true iff the observation date is the Funding Date (Determination Date clause (I)).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end_after_funding: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower occurring after the Funding Date (Determination Date clause (II)).\n; consolidated_ebitda: PBI Consolidated EBITDA for the four fiscal quarter period ended immediately preceding the Determination Date.\n; consolidated_cash_interest_expense_pro_forma: PBI Consolidated Cash Interest Expense for the same four-quarter period, adjusted pro forma for Indebtedness Incurred during the period and for repayment of Indebtedness repaid with its proceeds, as stated in Section 6.10(a).\n; total_debt_leverage_ratio: Total Debt Leverage Ratio of PBI and its Subsidiaries at the Determination Date, calculated after giving effect to Indebtedness Incurred or to be Incurred after the end of such month and on or prior to the Determination Date (Section 6.10(b)).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_funding_date Bool) (is_fiscal_quarter_end_after_funding Bool) (consolidated_ebitda Real) (consolidated_cash_interest_expense_pro_forma Real) (total_debt_leverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (or is_funding_date is_fiscal_quarter_end_after_funding)\n      (and (not (< (/ consolidated_ebitda consolidated_cash_interest_expense_pro_forma) 1.1))\n           (not (> total_debt_leverage_ratio 8.75)))))",
