  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: True iff the observation date is the last date/day of a Fiscal Quarter of the Company.\n; fiscal_quarter_end_on_or_after_2014_06_30: True iff the Fiscal Quarter ending at this observation is the quarter ending on June 30, 2014 or a later quarter.\n; fiscal_quarter_end_on_or_after_2015_06_30: True iff the Fiscal Quarter ending at this observation is the quarter ending on June 30, 2015 or a later quarter.\n; total_leverage_ratio: Total Leverage Ratio as of the last date of the Fiscal Quarter, as a number X meaning X:1.00.\n; interest_coverage_ratio: Minimum Interest Coverage Ratio for the four-Fiscal Quarter period ending on the last day of the Fiscal Quarter, as a number X meaning X:1.00.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n                            (fiscal_quarter_end_on_or_after_2014_06_30 Bool)\n                            (fiscal_quarter_end_on_or_after_2015_06_30 Bool)\n                            (total_leverage_ratio Real)\n                            (interest_coverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; (a) Maximum Total Leverage Ratio: 4.25 base, 4.00 from the quarter ending June 30, 2014, 3.50 from the quarter ending June 30, 2015\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end\n        (<= total_leverage_ratio\n            (ite fiscal_quarter_end_on_or_after_2015_06_30 3.5\n                 (ite fiscal_quarter_end_on_or_after_2014_06_30 4.0 4.25))))\n    ; (b) Minimum Interest Coverage Ratio: must not be less than 3.00\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end\n        (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.0))))",
