{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_month_end: true iff the observation is as of the end of a fiscal month of Holdings.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation is as of the end of a fiscal quarter of Holdings.\n; consolidated_total_debt: Consolidated Total Debt as of the observation date, including any outstanding amounts under Hybrid Securities, before any hybrid exclusion.\n; total_capitalization: Total Capitalization as of the observation date.\n; hybrid_securities_in_debt: outstanding amount of Hybrid Securities included in Consolidated Total Debt as of the observation date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_month_end Bool) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (consolidated_total_debt Real) (total_capitalization Real) (hybrid_securities_in_debt Real)) Bool\n  (let ((max_hybrid_exclusion (ite (<= hybrid_securities_in_debt (* 0.15 total_capitalization)) hybrid_securities_in_debt (* 0.15 total_capitalization))))\n    (=> (or is_fiscal_month_end is_fiscal_quarter_end)\n        (<= (/ (- consolidated_total_debt max_hybrid_exclusion) total_capitalization) 0.70))))",
