{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; leverage_ratio: Leverage Ratio for the trailing four-quarter period measured as of the observation date (ratio X in X to 1.0); used only when the observation date is a fiscal quarter end.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter.\n; commitments_not_terminated: true iff the Commitments have not yet expired or terminated.\n; loans_or_fees_unpaid: true iff the principal of or interest on any Loan, or any fees payable under the agreement, have not been paid in full.\n; letters_of_credit_outstanding: true iff any Letter of Credit has not yet expired or terminated.\n; lc_disbursements_unreimbursed: true iff any LC Disbursement has not yet been reimbursed.\n; in_period_effective_date_through_2008: true iff the observation date falls from the Effective Date through December 31, 2008.\n; in_period_2009: true iff the observation date falls from January 1, 2009 through December 31, 2009.\n; in_period_2010: true iff the observation date falls from January 1, 2010 through December 31, 2010.\n; in_period_after_2010: true iff the observation date falls after December 31, 2010 (the 'thereafter' period).\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (leverage_ratio Real)\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (commitments_not_terminated Bool)\n  (loans_or_fees_unpaid Bool)\n  (letters_of_credit_outstanding Bool)\n  (lc_disbursements_unreimbursed Bool)\n  (in_period_effective_date_through_2008 Bool)\n  (in_period_2009 Bool)\n  (in_period_2010 Bool)\n  (in_period_after_2010 Bool)\n) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           (or commitments_not_terminated\n               loans_or_fees_unpaid\n               letters_of_credit_outstanding\n               lc_disbursements_unreimbursed))\n      (and (=> in_period_effective_date_through_2008 (<= leverage_ratio 2.0))\n           (=> in_period_2009 (<= leverage_ratio 1.5))\n           (=> in_period_2010 (<= leverage_ratio 1.25))\n           (=> in_period_after_2010 (<= leverage_ratio 1.0)))))",
