  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; any_bank_has_commitment: true iff at the observation time any Bank has any Commitment under the agreement.\n; any_loan_outstanding: true iff at the observation time any Loan remains outstanding.\n; any_letter_of_credit_outstanding: true iff at the observation time any Letter of Credit remains outstanding.\n; any_note_amount_unpaid: true iff at the observation time any amount payable under any Note remains unpaid.\n; consolidated_debt_before_preferred_adjustment: Consolidated Debt at the observation time, excluding the preferred-stock inclusion in the next parameter.\n; outside_preferred_stock_value: aggregate value of preferred stock of Consolidated Subsidiaries held by a Person other than the Borrower or a Wholly-Owned Subsidiary of the Borrower, each issue at the higher of its voluntary or involuntary liquidation value.\n; qualifying_subordinated_debt: Qualifying Subordinated Debt at the observation time.\n; consolidated_net_worth: Consolidated Net Worth at the observation time.\n; qualifying_subordinated_obligations: Qualifying Subordinated Obligations at the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (any_bank_has_commitment Bool)\n  (any_loan_outstanding Bool)\n  (any_letter_of_credit_outstanding Bool)\n  (any_note_amount_unpaid Bool)\n  (consolidated_debt_before_preferred_adjustment Real)\n  (outside_preferred_stock_value Real)\n  (qualifying_subordinated_debt Real)\n  (consolidated_net_worth Real)\n  (qualifying_subordinated_obligations Real)) Bool\n  (=> (or any_bank_has_commitment any_loan_outstanding any_letter_of_credit_outstanding any_note_amount_unpaid)\n      (<= (/ (- (+ consolidated_debt_before_preferred_adjustment outside_preferred_stock_value) qualifying_subordinated_debt)\n             (+ consolidated_net_worth qualifying_subordinated_obligations))\n          8.0)))",
