{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; sale_leaseback_entered: True iff at this observation Parent or a Subsidiary enters into an arrangement whereby it sells or transfers property used or useful in its business and thereafter rents or leases that property or substantially similar-purpose property back from the transferee or its Affiliates (a Sale/Leaseback Transaction).\n; entered_by_excluded_subsidiary: True iff the Sale/Leaseback Transaction at this observation is entered into by an Excluded Subsidiary (the prohibition does not apply to it).\n; priority_indebtedness_pro_forma: aggregate amount of Priority Indebtedness in US$ after giving pro forma effect to the Sale/Leaseback Transaction.\n; consolidated_total_assets: Consolidated Total Assets in US$ as of the end of the fiscal quarter of Parent then most recently ended.\n; event_of_default_continuing_pro_forma: True iff, after giving pro forma effect to the Sale/Leaseback Transaction, an Event of Default has occurred and is continuing.\n; leverage_ratio_covenant_compliant: True iff Parent is in compliance with the Leverage Ratio covenant in Section 6.10 as of the end of the fiscal quarter of Parent then most recently ended.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((sale_leaseback_entered Bool) (entered_by_excluded_subsidiary Bool) (priority_indebtedness_pro_forma Real) (consolidated_total_assets Real) (event_of_default_continuing_pro_forma Bool) (leverage_ratio_covenant_compliant Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (and sale_leaseback_entered (not entered_by_excluded_subsidiary))\n      (and\n        (<= priority_indebtedness_pro_forma\n            (ite (>= 300000000.0 (* 0.15 consolidated_total_assets))\n                 300000000.0\n                 (* 0.15 consolidated_total_assets)))\n        (not event_of_default_continuing_pro_forma)\n        leverage_ratio_covenant_compliant)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
