      "meaning": "True iff at this observation Parent or a Subsidiary enters into an arrangement whereby it sells or transfers property used or useful in its business and thereafter rents or leases that property or substantially similar-purpose property back from the transferee or its Affiliates (a Sale/Leaseback Transaction).",
      "source_quote": "enter into any arrangement, directly or indirectly, with any Person whereby Parent or any such Subsidiary shall sell or transfer any property"
