  "notes": "The covenant applies at fiscal quarter ends while any Obligation is outstanding or the Bank has any commitment. Adjusted Net Profit = net income + non-cash addbacks + cash capital contributions + sub debt increase - unfunded capex - sub debt decrease. The test is the ratio Adjusted Net Profit / Fixed Charges >= 1.50, written as a division, so the evaluator reports zero Fixed Charges as unresolved. QF_NRA is used because the denominator is a variable. The subordination qualification (acceptable to Bank in its sole discretion) is built into the supplied sub debt inputs."
