{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true exactly when the observation time is the end of a fiscal quarter of PESCO.\n; consolidated_funded_debt: Consolidated Funded Debt (Real) at the observation time, as defined in the credit agreement; the numerator of the ratio.\n; total_capital: Total Capital (Real) at the observation time, as defined in the credit agreement; the denominator of the ratio.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (consolidated_funded_debt Real) (total_capital Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (<= (/ consolidated_funded_debt total_capital) 0.45)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "is_fiscal_quarter_end",
      "meaning": "True exactly when the observation time is the end of a fiscal quarter of PESCO.",
      "source_quote": "at the end of any fiscal quarter of PESCO"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_funded_debt",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Funded Debt (Real) at the observation time, as defined in the credit agreement; the numerator of the ratio.",
      "source_quote": "ratio of Consolidated Funded Debt to Total Capital"
    },
    {
      "name": "total_capital",
      "meaning": "Total Capital (Real) at the observation time, as defined in the credit agreement; the denominator of the ratio.",
      "source_quote": "ratio of Consolidated Funded Debt to Total Capital"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The covenant is applied pointwise at fiscal-quarter-end observations. The ratio is Consolidated Funded Debt divided by Total Capital and must not be greater than 0.45:1.00, so the test is <= 0.45. The source supplies no definitions of Consolidated Funded Debt or Total Capital, so both are atomic Real inputs. The division is kept as written, so a zero Total Capital is reported by the evaluator as unresolved. QF_NRA is needed because the denominator is a variable. The covenant's lead-in period (from the Effective Date until the commitments terminate and obligations are paid in full) is not modeled as a separate input. Observations are assumed to be supplied only within that period."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; total_debt_to_total_capitalization_ratio: Borrower's Total Debt to Total Capitalization Ratio as at the observation date (Total Debt divided by Total Capitalization, as defined in the Credit Agreement; atomic input, expressed as a plain ratio, e.g. 0.6 means 0.6:1.0).\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of a Fiscal Quarter of the Borrower.\n; is_on_or_after_effective_date: true iff the observation date is on or after the Effective Date (the Effective Date itself included).\n; commitments_expired_or_terminated: true iff the Commitments have expired or been terminated as of the observation date.\n; loans_and_fees_paid_in_full: true iff the principal of and interest on each Loan and all fees payable under the agreement have been paid in full as of the observation date.\n; is_on_or_after_sept_30_2009: true iff the observation date is September 30, 2009 or any later date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (total_debt_to_total_capitalization_ratio Real)\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (is_on_or_after_effective_date Bool)\n  (commitments_expired_or_terminated Bool)\n  (loans_and_fees_paid_in_full Bool)\n  (is_on_or_after_sept_30_2009 Bool)\n) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end\n           is_on_or_after_effective_date\n           (not (and commitments_expired_or_terminated loans_and_fees_paid_in_full)))\n      (ite is_on_or_after_sept_30_2009\n           (<= total_debt_to_total_capitalization_ratio 0.50)\n           (<= total_debt_to_total_capitalization_ratio 0.6))))",
