  ],
  "notes": "Pointwise translation. The covenant applies at Fiscal Quarter ends from the Effective Date until both the Commitments have expired or been terminated and all Loan principal, interest and fees have been paid in full. The limit is at most 0.6 before September 30, 2009 and at most 0.50 on and after that date, both non-strict. The ratio is left atomic because the source gives no definition of Total Debt or Total Capitalization."
