  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_last_day_of_test_period: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Test Period.\n; is_on_or_after_fiscal_quarter_ending_june_30_2012: true iff the Test Period ends on or after the fiscal quarter ending June 30, 2012 (the covenant's start).\n; consolidated_ebitda_to_interest_expense_ratio: the Consolidated EBITDA to Consolidated Interest Expense Ratio as of the last day of the Test Period, as a Real (x in x to 1.0).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_last_day_of_test_period Bool) (is_on_or_after_fiscal_quarter_ending_june_30_2012 Bool) (consolidated_ebitda_to_interest_expense_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_last_day_of_test_period is_on_or_after_fiscal_quarter_ending_june_30_2012)\n      (>= consolidated_ebitda_to_interest_expense_ratio 3.0)))",
  "symbols": [
