      "meaning": "The Consolidated EBITDA to Consolidated Interest Expense Ratio as of the last day of the Test Period, expressed as a Real number x for x to 1.0.",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated EBITDA to Consolidated Interest Expense Ratio"
