  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_on_or_after_effective_date: true if the observation date is on or after the Effective Date.\n; is_commitment_termination_date_occurred: true if the Commitment Termination Date has occurred as of the observation.\n; is_payment_in_full_made: true if the Notes, the Commitment Fee and all other sums then due and payable under the Loan Documents have been paid in full as of the observation.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true if the observation date is the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; interest_coverage_ratio: the Borrower's Interest Coverage Ratio at the observation, expressed as a number X meaning X:1.0.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_on_or_after_effective_date Bool) (is_commitment_termination_date_occurred Bool) (is_payment_in_full_made Bool) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (interest_coverage_ratio Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_on_or_after_effective_date\n           (not (and is_commitment_termination_date_occurred is_payment_in_full_made))\n           is_fiscal_quarter_end)\n      (>= interest_coverage_ratio 2.0)))",
  "symbols": [
