  ],
  "notes": "The covenant applies on and after the Effective Date until the later of the Commitment Termination Date and payment in full. It is therefore in force while at least one of those two events has not yet occurred, which the formula encodes as not (both occurred). The test is only required at fiscal quarter end. The threshold is non-strict (>= 2.0), matching 'not less than'. The ratio is atomic, so the formula contains no division."
