{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is a fiscal quarter-end of the Borrowers.\n; total_liabilities: Total Liabilities as of the observation date (numerator of the leverage ratio).\n; tangible_net_worth: Tangible Net Worth as of the observation date (denominator of the leverage ratio).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (total_liabilities Real) (tangible_net_worth Real)) Bool\n  (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (<= (/ total_liabilities tangible_net_worth) 0.6)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
