  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; total_debt_to_cap_pct: Borrower's Total Debt to Capitalization Ratio expressed as a percentage (60 means 60%) at the observation time, calculated disregarding the effects of FAS 133 and FAS 143 and any non-cash writedowns.\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Borrower's Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio as a multiple (2.5 means 2.5 to 1.0) for the Fiscal Quarter ending at the observation, calculated disregarding the effects of FAS 133 and FAS 143 and any non-cash writedowns.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: True iff the observation time is the end of a Fiscal Quarter.\n; financial_statements_available: True iff financial statements for the relevant Fiscal Quarter are available to the Borrower and reflect the ratio values supplied (the condition for a Default to be deemed to have occurred under clause (a) or (b)).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((total_debt_to_cap_pct Real) (fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (financial_statements_available Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    ;; (a) the ratio must not exceed 60% at any time; a Default is deemed only once financial statements are available\n    (=> financial_statements_available (<= total_debt_to_cap_pct 60.0))\n    ;; (b) at the end of a Fiscal Quarter the ratio must not be equal to or less than 2.5, so it must be strictly greater than 2.5\n    (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end financial_statements_available) (> fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 2.5))))",
