      "meaning": "True at the observation time if any Lender has any Commitment, or any Loan, Committed Loan Note, Competitive Bid Loan Note or other Borrower obligation under the Agreement/Loan Documents remains unpaid or unperformed, i.e. Article VI is in force.",
      "source_quote": "So long as any Lender shall have any Commitment hereunder and, until payment in full of each Loan"
    },
    {
      "name": "agent_written_consent",
      "meaning": "True at the observation time if the Agent, with the consent of the Majority Lenders, has otherwise consented in writing to non-compliance with Section 6.14.",
