{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Borrower as of the observation date (last day of a fiscal quarter), as a real number (1.00:1.00 = 1.0).\n; commitments_in_effect: true iff the Commitments remain in effect at the observation.\n; letter_of_credit_outstanding_excess: true iff a Letter of Credit remains outstanding in a face amount in excess of the sum of (i) cash then held in the Letter of Credit Account and (ii) the face amount of back-to-back letters of credit delivered pursuant to Section 2.02(j).\n; credit_linked_deposit_outstanding: true iff any Credit-Linked Deposit remains outstanding.\n; amount_owing: true iff any Loan or other amount is owing to any Lender or the Administrative Agent hereunder, other than contingent indemnification obligations not due and payable.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end_june_2007: true iff the observation is the last day of the fiscal quarter ending in June 2007.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end_september_2007: true iff the observation is the last day of the fiscal quarter ending in September 2007.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end_december_2007: true iff the observation is the last day of the fiscal quarter ending in December 2007.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end_march_2008_through_maturity: true iff the observation is the last day of a fiscal quarter ending in March 2008 or later, through the Maturity Date.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real)\n                            (commitments_in_effect Bool)\n                            (letter_of_credit_outstanding_excess Bool)\n                            (credit_linked_deposit_outstanding Bool)\n                            (amount_owing Bool)\n                            (is_fiscal_quarter_end_june_2007 Bool)\n                            (is_fiscal_quarter_end_september_2007 Bool)\n                            (is_fiscal_quarter_end_december_2007 Bool)\n                            (is_fiscal_quarter_end_march_2008_through_maturity Bool)) Bool\n  (=> (or commitments_in_effect\n          letter_of_credit_outstanding_excess\n          credit_linked_deposit_outstanding\n          amount_owing)\n      (and (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end_june_2007 (not (< fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.0)))\n           (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end_september_2007 (not (< fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.0)))\n           (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end_december_2007 (not (< fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.0)))\n           (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end_march_2008_through_maturity (not (< fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.2))))))",
