{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; amount_unpaid: true iff at the observation time an amount payable by the Company under the agreement remains unpaid\n; leverage_ratio: the Company's Leverage Ratio at the observation time (atomic; definition not supplied)\n; tools_business_sold: true iff at the observation time the Company has sold all or substantially all of the Tools Business\n; in_period_a_i: true iff the observation date is in the period from completion of the WICOR Acquisition to October 1, 2004\n; in_period_a_ii: true iff the observation date is in the period from October 2, 2004 to December 30, 2004\n; sale_before_july_3_2004: true iff the Company sold all or substantially all of the Tools Business prior to July 3, 2004\n; in_period_x: true iff the observation date is in period (x), from completion of such sale to the earlier of October 1, 2004 or the date the Company notifies the Administrative Agent that the maximum Leverage Ratio should be reduced to 3.00 to 1\n; on_or_after_last_day_of_period_x: true iff the observation date is on or after the last day of period (x)\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((amount_unpaid Bool) (leverage_ratio Real) (tools_business_sold Bool) (in_period_a_i Bool) (in_period_a_ii Bool) (sale_before_july_3_2004 Bool) (in_period_x Bool) (on_or_after_last_day_of_period_x Bool)) Bool\n  (let ((use_325 (and tools_business_sold sale_before_july_3_2004 in_period_x (not on_or_after_last_day_of_period_x))))\n    (=> amount_unpaid\n      (and\n        (=> (and (not tools_business_sold) in_period_a_i) (<= leverage_ratio 4.35))\n        (=> (and (not tools_business_sold) in_period_a_ii) (<= leverage_ratio 4.25))\n        (=> use_325 (<= leverage_ratio 3.25))\n        (=> (and tools_business_sold (not use_325)) (<= leverage_ratio 3.00))))))",
