{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; letter_of_credit_outstanding: any Letter of Credit remains outstanding at the observation time.\n; reimbursement_principal_unpaid: any principal amount of any reimbursement obligation in respect of any Letter of Credit remains unpaid or outstanding at the observation time.\n; loan_principal_unpaid: any principal amount of any Loan remains unpaid or outstanding at the observation time.\n; interest_unpaid: any amount of interest accrued under the Notes or in respect of any Letter of Credit remains unpaid or outstanding at the observation time.\n; other_amounts_unpaid: any commitment, facility or other fee, expense, compensation or other amount payable to any member of the Bank Group under the Loan Documents remains unpaid or outstanding at the observation time.\n; bank_has_commitment: any Bank has any Commitment under the agreement at the observation time.\n; ebitda: Borrower EBITDA for the twelve month period ending at the observation time (currency units).\n; interest_expense: Borrower Interest Expense for the same twelve month period (currency units).\n; preferred_dividends_paid: dividends paid by the Borrower on its Preferred Stock during the same twelve month period (currency units).\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((letter_of_credit_outstanding Bool)\n                            (reimbursement_principal_unpaid Bool)\n                            (loan_principal_unpaid Bool)\n                            (interest_unpaid Bool)\n                            (other_amounts_unpaid Bool)\n                            (bank_has_commitment Bool)\n                            (ebitda Real)\n                            (interest_expense Real)\n                            (preferred_dividends_paid Real)) Bool\n  (=> (or letter_of_credit_outstanding\n          reimbursement_principal_unpaid\n          loan_principal_unpaid\n          interest_unpaid\n          other_amounts_unpaid\n          bank_has_commitment)\n      (>= (/ ebitda (+ interest_expense preferred_dividends_paid)) 2.0)))",
