  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; adjusted_leverage_ratio: The Borrower's Adjusted Leverage Ratio as of the observation date, expressed as the first number in 'X : 1.0' (for example 5.0 means 5.00 : 1.0).\n; is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter: True iff the observation date is the last day of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower.\n; in_period_dec2001_to_jun2004: True iff the observation date falls from December 31, 2001 through June 30, 2004, inclusive.\n; in_period_jul2004_to_dec2004: True iff the observation date falls from July 1, 2004 through December 31, 2004, inclusive.\n; in_period_jan2005_to_dec2005: True iff the observation date falls from January 1, 2005 through December 31, 2005, inclusive.\n; in_period_thereafter: True iff the observation date falls after December 31, 2005, i.e. the 'Thereafter' period.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((adjusted_leverage_ratio Real) (is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter Bool) (in_period_dec2001_to_jun2004 Bool) (in_period_jul2004_to_dec2004 Bool) (in_period_jan2005_to_dec2005 Bool) (in_period_thereafter Bool)) Bool\n  (=> is_last_day_of_fiscal_quarter\n      (and (=> in_period_dec2001_to_jun2004 (<= adjusted_leverage_ratio 5.0))\n           (=> in_period_jul2004_to_dec2004 (<= adjusted_leverage_ratio 4.75))\n           (=> in_period_jan2005_to_dec2005 (<= adjusted_leverage_ratio 4.5))\n           (=> in_period_thereafter (<= adjusted_leverage_ratio 4.25)))))",
