  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff this observation is as of the end of a fiscal quarter of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries (applicability for clauses (a) and (b)).\n; leverage_ratio: Leverage Ratio of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries as of this observation, expressed as X in X to 1.0.\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries as of this observation, expressed as X in X to 1.0.\n; net_worth: Net Worth at this observation time.\n; cumulative_quarterly_net_income_excluding_losses: sum, over fiscal quarters from the quarter ending February 28, 1998 through the most recent quarter end on or before this observation, of Net Income for each quarter, with loss quarters counted as zero (without deductions for losses), in dollars.\n; cumulative_equity_net_cash_proceeds: cumulative Net Cash Proceeds from all Equity Transactions subsequent to the Closing Date, up to this observation, in dollars.\n; cumulative_acquired_net_worth: cumulative net worth of all Persons acquired by the Borrower pursuant to a Permitted Acquisition, up to this observation, in dollars.\n; working_capital: Working Capital at this observation time, in dollars.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n                            (leverage_ratio Real)\n                            (fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real)\n                            (net_worth Real)\n                            (cumulative_quarterly_net_income_excluding_losses Real)\n                            (cumulative_equity_net_cash_proceeds Real)\n                            (cumulative_acquired_net_worth Real)\n                            (working_capital Real)) Bool\n  (and\n    ; (a) Leverage Ratio strictly less than 3.0 at each fiscal quarter end\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (< leverage_ratio 3.0))\n    ; (b) Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio strictly greater than 1.5 at each fiscal quarter end\n    (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end (> fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.5))\n    ; (c) at all times, Net Worth must not be less than the cumulatively increased floor\n    (not (< net_worth\n            (+ 227000000.0\n               (* 0.5 cumulative_quarterly_net_income_excluding_losses)\n               (* 0.75 cumulative_equity_net_cash_proceeds)\n               (* 0.75 cumulative_acquired_net_worth))))\n    ; (d) at all times, Working Capital must not be less than zero\n    (not (< working_capital 0.0))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
