  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the end of one of the Company's fiscal quarters (the date of determination).\n; is_on_or_after_april_30_2000: true iff the observation date is on or after April 30, 2000, the first determination date.\n; net_income_excl_extraordinary: Net income (or net loss) of the Company and its consolidated Subsidiaries on a combined basis under GAAP for the four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation date, excluding extraordinary gains or losses and taxes associated therewith.\n; interest_expense_deducted: Interest expense deducted in determining that net income, for the same four-quarter period (EBITDDA add-back (a)).\n; income_tax_expense_deducted: Income tax expense deducted in determining that net income, for the same four-quarter period (add-back (b)).\n; depreciation_expense_deducted: Depreciation expense deducted in determining that net income, for the same four-quarter period (add-back (c)).\n; depletion_expense_deducted: Depletion expense deducted in determining that net income, for the same four-quarter period (add-back (d)).\n; amortization_expense_deducted: Amortization expense deducted in determining that net income, for the same four-quarter period (add-back (e)).\n; combined_interest_expense: Combined interest expense of the Company and its Subsidiaries for the four consecutive fiscal quarters ending on the observation date, including capitalized interest and the interest portion of capital lease obligations.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (is_on_or_after_april_30_2000 Bool)\n  (net_income_excl_extraordinary Real)\n  (interest_expense_deducted Real)\n  (income_tax_expense_deducted Real)\n  (depreciation_expense_deducted Real)\n  (depletion_expense_deducted Real)\n  (amortization_expense_deducted Real)\n  (combined_interest_expense Real)) Bool\n  (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end is_on_or_after_april_30_2000)\n      (>= (/ (+ net_income_excl_extraordinary\n                interest_expense_deducted\n                income_tax_expense_deducted\n                depreciation_expense_deducted\n                depletion_expense_deducted\n                amortization_expense_deducted)\n             combined_interest_expense)\n          2.75)))",
