  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (consolidated_senior_indebtedness Real) ; Consolidated Senior Indebtedness of TDC and its Subsidiaries at the observation time, as defined in the Agreement\n  (consolidated_total_capital Real) ; Consolidated Total Capital of TDC and its Subsidiaries at the observation time, as defined in the Agreement\n  (convertible_indebtedness_issued Bool) ; True iff the observation time is on or after the date TDC or any Subsidiary issued any Convertible Indebtedness; false if no such issuance has yet occurred\n  ) Bool\n  ; Compliance means the ratio does not exceed the threshold: 0.55 on/after Convertible Indebtedness issuance, else 0.60\n  (<= (/ consolidated_senior_indebtedness consolidated_total_capital)\n      (ite convertible_indebtedness_issued 0.55 0.60)))",
