{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; consolidated_current_assets: Borrower's Consolidated current assets at the observation time, before adding any unused Borrowing Base availability.\n; unused_borrowing_base_available: Unused portion of the Borrowing Base that is then available for borrowing at the observation time. It is added to current assets.\n; consolidated_current_liabilities: Borrower's Consolidated current liabilities at the observation time, before excluding any Note or Subordinated Note principal.\n; note_principal_due_within_one_year: Payments of principal on the Notes or the Subordinated Notes that are required to be repaid within one year of the observation time. This amount is excluded from current liabilities.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((consolidated_current_assets Real) (unused_borrowing_base_available Real) (consolidated_current_liabilities Real) (note_principal_due_within_one_year Real)) Bool\n  (>= (/ (+ consolidated_current_assets unused_borrowing_base_available)\n         (- consolidated_current_liabilities note_principal_due_within_one_year))\n      1.0))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "consolidated_current_assets",
      "meaning": "Borrower's Consolidated current assets at the observation time, before adding any unused Borrowing Base availability.",
      "source_quote": "Borrower's Consolidated current assets"
    },
    {
      "name": "unused_borrowing_base_available",
      "meaning": "Unused portion of the Borrowing Base that is then available for borrowing at the observation time. It is added to current assets.",
      "source_quote": "any unused portion of the Borrowing Base which is then available for borrowing"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_current_liabilities",
      "meaning": "Borrower's Consolidated current liabilities at the observation time, before excluding any Note or Subordinated Note principal.",
      "source_quote": "Borrower's Consolidated current liabilities"
    },
    {
      "name": "note_principal_due_within_one_year",
      "meaning": "Payments of principal on the Notes or the Subordinated Notes that are required to be repaid within one year of the observation time. This amount is excluded from current liabilities.",
      "source_quote": "any payments of principal on the Notes or the Subordinated Notes which are required to be repaid within one year from the time of calculation"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Pointwise translation of 'will never be less than 1.0 to 1.0': at each observation, (current assets + unused available Borrowing Base) / (current liabilities - Note and Subordinated Note principal due within one year) >= 1.0. The ratio is kept as a division, so a zero denominator is left to the evaluator to report as unresolved, and no sign or positivity assumptions are made. QF_NRA is used because the denominator is a non-constant term. The 'until full and final payment of the Obligations' and 'Required Lenders' waiver language defines the covenant's duration and an exception. It is not encoded as a parameter, because the evaluator supplies only observations in which the covenant applies."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_NRA)\n; covenant_in_force: true iff the observation time is on or after the Effective Date, the Agreement is in effect, and the termination/payment-in-full conditions have not all been met (Revolving Loan Commitments terminated, no Notes outstanding, Loans, interest, Fees and all other Obligations paid in full).\n; consolidated_debt: Consolidated Debt of the Company and its Restricted Subsidiaries at the date of determination (the observation time).\n; consolidated_ebitda: Consolidated EBITDA of the Company and its Restricted Subsidiaries for the Test Period then last ended as of the observation time.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((covenant_in_force Bool) (consolidated_debt Real) (consolidated_ebitda Real)) Bool\n  (=> covenant_in_force\n      (<= (/ consolidated_debt consolidated_ebitda) 6.0)))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "covenant_in_force",
      "meaning": "True iff the observation time is on or after the Effective Date and the Agreement is in effect, and the Revolving Loan Commitments have not yet terminated, or Notes remain outstanding, or the Loans, interest, Fees and all other Obligations are not yet paid in full. False once all those termination and payment conditions have been met.",
      "source_quote": "thereafter for so long as this Agreement is in effect and until the Revolving Loan Commitments have terminated, no Notes are outstanding and the Loans, together with interest, Fees and all other Obligations are paid in full"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_debt",
      "meaning": "Consolidated Debt of the Company and its Restricted Subsidiaries at the date of determination (the observation time), the numerator of the Leverage Ratio.",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated Debt of the Company and its Restricted Subsidiaries at any date of determination thereof"
    },
    {
      "name": "consolidated_ebitda",
      "meaning": "Consolidated EBITDA of the Company and its Restricted Subsidiaries for the Test Period then last ended as of the observation time, the denominator of the Leverage Ratio.",
      "source_quote": "Consolidated EBITDA of the Company and its Restricted Subsidiaries for the Test Period then last ended"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The Leverage Ratio is Consolidated Debt divided by Consolidated EBITDA, and it must not exceed 6.00:1.00, so the constraint is ratio <= 6.0 (non-strict). The division is kept explicit so the evaluator reports a zero EBITDA as unresolved, and no sign or positivity assumption is made. 'At any time' is translated pointwise, with no calendar flag, because the covenant applies at every observation while it is in force. QF_NRA is used because the division is by a variable."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; obligation_outstanding: true iff any Bank has any Commitment, or any Loan or other Obligation remains unpaid or unsatisfied at the observation time.\n; majority_banks_waived: true iff the Majority Banks have waived compliance in writing for this observation.\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation date is the last day of a Fiscal Quarter.\n; is_borrowing_date: true iff the observation date is the date of a Borrowing.\n; in_period_1: true iff the observation date is within 3/31/00 through 12/30/00 (maximum 4.50:1.00).\n; in_period_2: true iff the observation date is within 12/31/00 through 6/29/01 (maximum 4.00:1.00).\n; in_period_3: true iff the observation date is 6/30/01 or thereafter (maximum 3.50:1.00).\n; leverage_ratio: Leverage Ratio as measured as of the observation date (the last day of the Fiscal Quarter), as a ratio X:1.00.\n; leverage_ratio_before_borrowing: Leverage Ratio as of the Borrowing date before giving effect to the Borrowing.\n; leverage_ratio_after_borrowing: Leverage Ratio as of the Borrowing date after giving effect to the Borrowing.\n(define-fun covenant_holds (\n  (obligation_outstanding Bool)\n  (majority_banks_waived Bool)\n  (is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool)\n  (is_borrowing_date Bool)\n  (in_period_1 Bool)\n  (in_period_2 Bool)\n  (in_period_3 Bool)\n  (leverage_ratio Real)\n  (leverage_ratio_before_borrowing Real)\n  (leverage_ratio_after_borrowing Real)\n) Bool\n  (=> (and obligation_outstanding (not majority_banks_waived))\n    (and\n      (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end in_period_1) (<= leverage_ratio 4.5))\n      (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end in_period_2) (<= leverage_ratio 4.0))\n      (=> (and is_fiscal_quarter_end in_period_3) (<= leverage_ratio 3.5))\n      (=> (and is_borrowing_date in_period_1)\n          (and (<= leverage_ratio_before_borrowing 4.5) (<= leverage_ratio_after_borrowing 4.5)))\n      (=> (and is_borrowing_date in_period_2)\n          (and (<= leverage_ratio_before_borrowing 4.0) (<= leverage_ratio_after_borrowing 4.0)))\n      (=> (and is_borrowing_date in_period_3)\n          (and (<= leverage_ratio_before_borrowing 3.5) (<= leverage_ratio_after_borrowing 3.5))))))",
  "symbols": [
    {
      "name": "obligation_outstanding",
      "meaning": "True iff any Bank has any Commitment, or any Loan or other Obligation remains unpaid or unsatisfied at the observation time.",
      "source_quote": "So long as any Bank shall have any Commitment hereunder, or any Loan or other Obligation shall remain unpaid or unsatisfied"
    },
    {
