    {
      "name": "is_four_quarters_ending_1999_12_31_or_later",
      "meaning": "True iff this observation is the end of a Fiscal Quarter that is December 31, 1999 or later, with the trailing four Fiscal Quarter period measured.",
      "source_quote": "2.90 to 1 for the four Fiscal Quarters ending December 31, 1999 and for each trailing four Fiscal Quarter period thereafter, measured as of the end of each Fiscal Quarter"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Pointwise translation: each period flag gates its own minimum EBIT / Adjusted Net Interest Expense ratio (3.00 or 2.90, inclusive, 'at least'). Flags for (a) and (b) can both be true at the December 31, 1998 quarter end, and both then apply. The ratio uses real division, so a zero denominator is reported as unresolved by the evaluator. No positivity assumptions are made. Definitions of EBIT and Adjusted Net Interest Expense were not supplied, so they are atomic inputs. QF_NRA is used because the ratio divides one variable by another."
}

{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; fixed_charge_coverage_ratio: Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio of the Borrower and its consolidated Subsidiaries, calculated as of the observed fiscal quarter end for the four fiscal quarters then ended (ratio expressed as X in X to 1.00).\n; is_fqe_2004_04_30: true iff the observation is as of the fiscal quarter end April 30, 2004.\n; is_fqe_2004_07_31: true iff the observation is as of the fiscal quarter end July 31, 2004.\n; is_fqe_2004_10_31: true iff the observation is as of the fiscal quarter end October 31, 2004.\n; is_fqe_on_or_after_2005_01_31: true iff the observation is as of a fiscal quarter end falling on or after January 31, 2005.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((fixed_charge_coverage_ratio Real) (is_fqe_2004_04_30 Bool) (is_fqe_2004_07_31 Bool) (is_fqe_2004_10_31 Bool) (is_fqe_on_or_after_2005_01_31 Bool)) Bool\n  (and\n    (=> is_fqe_2004_04_30 (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.10))\n    (=> is_fqe_2004_07_31 (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.25))\n    (=> is_fqe_2004_10_31 (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.25))\n    (=> is_fqe_on_or_after_2005_01_31 (>= fixed_charge_coverage_ratio 1.50))))",
