{
  "status": "formalized",
  "smt2": "(set-logic QF_LRA)\n; is_fiscal_quarter_end: true iff the observation is at the end of a fiscal quarter.\n; leverage_ratio: the Leverage Ratio at the end of the fiscal quarter, as a number (x in x to 1.0).\n; interest_coverage_ratio: the Interest Coverage Ratio at the end of the fiscal quarter, as a number (x in x to 1.0).\n; before_term_loan_effective_date: true iff the observation time is prior to the Term Loan Facility Effective Date.\n; in_period_tlfed_to_2009_03_30: true iff the observation time is in the period beginning on the Term Loan Facility Effective Date and ending March 30, 2009.\n; in_period_2009_03_31_to_2010_03_30: true iff the observation time is in the period beginning on March 31, 2009 and ending March 30, 2010.\n; on_or_after_2010_03_31: true iff the observation time is on or after March 31, 2010.\n(define-fun covenant_holds ((is_fiscal_quarter_end Bool) (leverage_ratio Real) (interest_coverage_ratio Real) (before_term_loan_effective_date Bool) (in_period_tlfed_to_2009_03_30 Bool) (in_period_2009_03_31_to_2010_03_30 Bool) (on_or_after_2010_03_31 Bool)) Bool\n  (=> is_fiscal_quarter_end\n      (and\n        (=> before_term_loan_effective_date (<= leverage_ratio 3.5))\n        (=> in_period_tlfed_to_2009_03_30 (<= leverage_ratio 4.5))\n        (=> in_period_2009_03_31_to_2010_03_30 (<= leverage_ratio 4.0))\n        (=> on_or_after_2010_03_31 (<= leverage_ratio 3.5))\n        (>= interest_coverage_ratio 3.0))))",
